tival","cn":null,"fr":"Festival","sp":"Festival","nl":"Festival"}},"others":{"list":[120],"translations":{"de":["Theater"],"pt":[null],"en":["Theatre"],"it":["Teatro"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Th\u00e9\u00e2tre"],"sp":["Teatro"],"nl":["Theater"]}}},"translations":{"de":{"name":"29e Mondial d'impro","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.fbia.be\/","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50002935"},"pt":{"name":"29e Mondial d'impro","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.fbia.be\/","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50002935"},"en":{"name":"29e Mondial d'impro","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.fbia.be\/","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50002935"},"it":{"name":"29e Mondial d'impro","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.fbia.be\/","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50002935"},"cn":{"name":"29e Mondial d'impro","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.fbia.be\/","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50002935"},"fr":{"name":"29e Mondial d'impro","shortdescr":"Attention, d\u00e9collage imminent..3, 2, 1\u2026\nDirection le MONDIAL DE L'IMPRO\n\nCette ann\u00e9e, 5 \u00e9quipes venues de galaxie fort lointaines posent leurs vaisseau-m\u00e8re \u00e0 Bruxelles pour 10 jours de match du 19 au 28 octobre.\n\nIls sont l\u00e0 dans le but d'accomplir une mission : remporter Jos\u00e9 !\nPour cela, ils ont besoin de vous !\nChoisissez quelle \u00e9quipe en ressortira vainqueur...\n\nAlors ? Vous montez \u00e0 bord ?","longdescr":"NOM DE MISSION : MONDIAL 2023. \n\nIl vous a envoy\u00e9 dans le cosmos en 2017. Apr\u00e8s un tour de la galaxie, le Mondial d\u2019improvisation (re)d\u00e9barque sur notre belge plan\u00e8te pour sa 29\u00e8me \u00e9dition !\n\nDu 19 au 28 octobre 2023, cinq nations venues des quatre coins de la francophonie exploreront nos contr\u00e9es \u00e0 la recherche de Jos\u00e9, le troph\u00e9e mythique du Mondial. \nD\u00e9collage imminent pour Bruxelles, Namur, Libramont, Wavre et Ottignies Louvain-la-Neuve. Partez pour un voyage en orbite de vos plus belles \u00e9motions improvis\u00e9es. \n\nUn programme qui ne doit rien au NASArd. Des matchs d\u2019improvisations interplan\u00e9taires. Des \u00e9quipes. Des histoires cosmiques, des personnages solaires et des intrigues nouvelles vous emm\u00e8neront dans un vortex inoubliable. M\u00eame pas le temps d\u2019\u00eatre dans la lune une seconde. \n\nPr\u00eats \u00e0 (re)d\u00e9couvrir le match d\u2019improvisation ? \u00c0 mission exceptionnelle, formations exceptionnelles : ces nations enverront leur 5 meilleur\u00b7es agent\u00b7es et leur coach national pour votre plus grand bonheur !\n\n19.10 Bruxelles - Centre Culturel d\u2019Uccle\n20.10 Bruxelles - Espace Lumen\n21.10 Ottignies - Le Spott \/ Centre Culturel d\u2019Ottignies Louvain-la-Neuve\n22.10 Libramont - Centre Culturel\n23.10 Bruxelles - Wolubilis\n24.10 Bruxelles - Espace Lumen\n25.10 Namur - Universit\u00e9 de Namur\n26.10 Wavre - La Sucrerie\n27.10 Bruxelles - Centre Culturel d\u2019Auderghem\n28.10 Bruxelles - Universit\u00e9 Libre de Bruxelles\n\nQui repartira avec Jos\u00e9 ?\nR\u00e9ponse lors de la grande finale le 28 octobre !","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.fbia.be\/","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50002935"},"sp":{"name":"29e Mondial d'impro","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.fbia.be\/","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50002935"},"nl":{"name":"29e Mondial d'impro","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.fbia.be\/","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50002935"}},"place":{"id":240318,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Fbia asbl (F\u00e9d\u00e9ration belge d'improvisation amateur)","address_street_name":"Rue Saint-Josse","address_street_number":"19","address_street_box":null,"email":"production@fbia.be","website":"http:\/\/www.fbia.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 672 93 25","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","address_line1":"Rue Saint-Josse, 19","address_line2":"1210 Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Fbia asbl (F\u00e9d\u00e9ration belge d'improvisation amateur)","address_street_name":"Rue Saint-Josse","address_street_number":"19","address_street_box":null,"email":"production@fbia.be","website":"http:\/\/www.fbia.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 672 93 25","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","address_line1":"Rue Saint-Josse, 19","address_line2":"1210 Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Fbia asbl (F\u00e9d\u00e9ration belge d'improvisation amateur)","address_street_name":"Rue Saint-Josse","address_street_number":"19","address_street_box":null,"email":"production@fbia.be","websit