,"start":"18:00:00","timestamp":"2023-10-14T18:00:00"}},{"id":50002948,"date_start":"2023-10-19","date_end":"2023-11-19","date_next":"2023-10-23","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":true,"is_pay_as_you_can":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"last_updated_at":"2023-10-23T02:03:09+02:00","published_at":"2023-10-05T16:26:46+02:00","publication_state":"public","date_embargo":null,"show_in_agenda":true,"is_outside":false,"is_high_capacity":false,"is_not_major_event":false,"backoffice_id":286608,"facebook_link":null,"import_origin":null,"is_part_of":"Ann\u00e9e Art Nouveau","sub_type":"expo","ranking":0.3968502629920499,"languages":{"spoken":["fr","en"],"subtitles":[]},"categories":{"main":{"id":23,"translations":{"de":"Ausstellung","pt":null,"en":"Exhibition","it":"Esposizioni","cn":null,"fr":"Exposition","sp":"Exhibici\u00f3n","nl":"Tentoonstellingen"}},"others":{}},"translations":{"de":{"name":"Ljubljana at the turn of the 20th century","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50002948"},"pt":{"name":"Ljubljana at the turn of the 20th century","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50002948"},"en":{"name":"Ljubljana at the turn of the 20th century","shortdescr":"Ljubljana, during the 19th century and especially in its final quarter, transformed from being a small provincial center into a modern national capital. At that time new secessionist, art nouveau forms were introduced into the traditional historic architecture of Habsburg monarchy.","longdescr":"The town boundaries expanded and population increased rapidly. The structure of society changed and was marked by the cultural revival. The most important turning point in the development of Ljubljana was the devastating earthquake that struck the town in 1895. Intensive reconstruction began immediately and in the following fifteen years the image of the town changed more than in any previous period. ","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50002948"},"it":{"name":"Ljubljana at the turn of the 20th century","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50002948"},"cn":{"name":"Ljubljana at the turn of the 20th century","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50002948"},"fr":{"name":"Ljubljana au tournant du XXe si\u00e8cle","shortdescr":"Ljubljana, au cours du 19e si\u00e8cle et surtout dans son dernier quart, s'est transform\u00e9e d'un petit centre provincial en une capitale nationale moderne. \u00c0 cette \u00e9poque, de nouvelles formes s\u00e9cessionnistes et art nouveau ont \u00e9t\u00e9 introduites dans l'architecture historique traditionnelle de la monarchie des Habsbourg. ","longdescr":"Les fronti\u00e8res de la ville se sont \u00e9tendues et la population a augment\u00e9 rapidement. La structure de la soci\u00e9t\u00e9 a chang\u00e9 et a \u00e9t\u00e9 marqu\u00e9e par le renouveau culturel. Le tournant le plus important dans le d\u00e9veloppement de Ljubljana a \u00e9t\u00e9 le tremblement de terre d\u00e9vastateur qui a frapp\u00e9 la ville en 1895. La reconstruction intensive commen\u00e7a imm\u00e9diatement et, au cours des quinze ann\u00e9es qui suivirent, l'image de la ville changea plus qu'\u00e0 n'importe quelle autre p\u00e9riode.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50002948"},"sp":{"name":"Ljubljana at the turn of the 20th century","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50002948"},"nl":{"name":"Ljubljana at the turn of the 20th century","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50002948"}},"place":{"id":247371,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Halles Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_street_name":"Place Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"accueil@hallessaintgery.be","website":"http:\/\/www.hallessaintgery.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 44 24","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Die Halles Saint-G\u00e9ry mit ihrer eklektischen Architektur wurden Ende des 19. Jahrhundert als Markthalle erbaut und spielten in der Br\u00fcsseler Stadtgeschichte eine wichtige Rolle.\r\n\r\nDie Saint-G\u00e9ry-Hallen waren einerseits sowohl legend\u00e4re als auch kaufm\u00e4nnische Wiege der Stadt. Ab dem 11. Jahrhundert stand an dieser Stelle eine dem Heiligen Saint-G\u00e9ry gewidmete Kapelle. Verschiedene Wohnh\u00e4user waren hier entstanden und aufgrund der N\u00e4he zur Senne entwickelten sich zahlreiche Aktivit\u00e4ten.\r\n\r\nIm 16. Jahrhundert erhielt die Kapelle den Status einer Pfarrkirche, die prachtvoll im gotischen Stil erweitert wurde, dann aber im Zuge der Franz\u00f6sische Revolution dem Erdboden gleichgemacht wurde.\r\n\r\nDer ehemalige Markt - und sogar das gesamte Saint-G\u00e9ry-Viertel \u2013 waren ihrerseits in den 1960er-Jahren von der Zerst\u00f6rung bedroht, bis das Viertel in den 1990er-Jahren eine Art zweiten Fr\u00fchling erlebte. Seit 1999 fungieren die Saint-G\u00e9ry-Hallen als Informations- und Ausstellungszentrum rund um die Br\u00fcsseler Stadtgeschichte und das st\u00e4dtische Leben in Br\u00fcssel. An der Bar gibt es Getr\u00e4nke und Speisen.\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Halles Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_street_name":"Place Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"accueil@hallessaintgery.be","website":"http:\/\/www.hallessaintgery.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 44 24","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Halles Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_street_name":"Place Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"accueil@hallessaintgery.be","website":"http:\/\/www.hallessaintgery.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 44 24","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"The Saint-G\u00e9ry Market Halls are a fine architectural example of 19th-century public markets in Brussels. The building was completely restored several years ago and is now a permanent information and exhibition space, with urban planning, heritage, and urban renewal as its central themes.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Halle di Saint-Gery","address_street_name":"Place Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"accueil@hallessaintgery.be","website":"http:\/\/www.hallessaintgery.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 44 24","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Le Halles Saint-G\u00e9ry (mercato coperto) ospitano un centro d'informazione dedicato al patrimonio e al quadro di vita dei Bruxellesi...\r\nLe Halles Saint-G\u00e9ry (mercato coperto) ospitano un centro d'informazione dedicato al patrimonio e al quadro di vita dei Bruxellesi. Sotto il patrocinio della regione di Bruxelles Capitale.\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"Halles Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_street_name":"Place Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"accueil@hallessaintgery.be","website":"http:\/\/www.hallessaintgery.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 44 24","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"fr":{"name":"Halles Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_street_name":"Place Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"accueil@hallessaintgery.be","website":"http:\/\/www.hallessaintgery.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 44 24","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Remarquable t\u00e9moin de l\u2019architecture des march\u00e9s couverts, les Halles Saint-G\u00e9ry  contribuent \u00e0 valoriser le patrimoine de la R\u00e9gion de Bruxelles-Capitale. Centre d\u2019exposition et de manifestation bas\u00e9 en plein coeur du pentagone, elles ont pour vocation de mettre en valeur les traits de d\u00e9marcation du cadre de vie bruxellois et de son identit\u00e9 urbaine par le biais d'une programmation hybride, allant des expositions, aux conf\u00e9rences, concerts, rencontres et performances \u2026\r\nLe Centre Urbain (guichet d\u2019information r\u00e9gional, pour mieux vous conseiller sur l\u2019habitat durable en R\u00e9gion de Bruxelles-Capitale) est \u00e9galement situ\u00e9 au sein des Halles.\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Halles Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_street_name":"Place Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"accueil@hallessaintgery.be","website":"http:\/\/www.hallessaintgery.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 44 24","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Verdadero testigo de los mercados cubiertos, las Halles Saint-G\u00e9ry albergan un centro de informaci\u00f3n, bajo la \u00e9gida de la Regio\u00f3n de Bruselas Capital y dedicado al patrimonio...\r\nVerdadero testigo de los mercados cubiertos, las Halles Saint-G\u00e9ry albergan un centro de informaci\u00f3n, bajo la \u00e9gida de la Regio\u00f3n de Bruselas Capital y dedicado al patrimonio y al marco de vida de los bruselenses.\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Sint-Gorikshallen","address_street_name":"Sint-Goriksplein","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"accueil@hallessaintgery.be","website":"http:\/\/www.hallessaintgery.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 44 24","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Sint-Goriksplein","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"De Sint-Gorikshallen zijn een prachtig architecturaal staaltje van openbare markthallen in het 19de-eeuwse Brussel. Het gebouw werd een aantal jaren geleden volledig gerestaureerd en doet tegenwoordig dienst als permanente informatie-, tentoonstellings- en evenementenruimte gewijd aan het erfgoed en de levenswijzen in de hoofdstad. Op amper twee minuten stappen van de Beurs vormen de Sint-Gorikshallen een gezellige plek om te ontspannen en nieuwe dingen te ontdekken, zowel overdag als bij het vallen van de nacht.\r\nDe hallen herbergen ook de Stadswinkel, een vereniging die de inwoners van het Brussels Hoofdstedelijk Gewest  wil informeren over het leefmilieu en een kwaliteitsvolle leefomgeving, huisvesting, stadsrenovatie, stedenbouw en ruimtelijke ordening, en rationeel energiegebruik. ","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null}},"districts":{"list":[3],"translations":{"de":["Dansaert\/Sainte-Catherine"],"pt":[null],"en":["Dansaert\/Sainte-Catherine"],"it":["Dansaert\/Sainte-Catherine"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Dansaert\/Sainte-Catherine"],"sp":["Dansaert\/Sainte-Catherine"],"nl":["Dansaertwijk\/Sint-Katelijne"]}},"zones":{"list":[19],"translations":{"de":["Zentrum"],"pt":[null],"en":["Centre"],"it":["Centro"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Centre"],"sp":["Centro"],"nl":["Centrum"]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":9562,"location":{"lat":50.84801328,"lon":4.34683241},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2022-12-19T14:03:38+01:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:26:22+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":247371,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Halles Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_street_name":"Place Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"accueil@hallessaintgery.be","website":"http:\/\/www.hallessaintgery.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 44 24","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place Saint-G\u00e9r