stamp":"2023-10-19T19:00:00"}},{"id":50001839,"date_start":"2023-09-08","date_end":"2023-11-05","date_next":"2023-10-23","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_pay_as_you_can":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"last_updated_at":"2023-10-23T02:02:53+02:00","published_at":"2023-09-05T13:17:46+02:00","publication_state":"public","date_embargo":null,"show_in_agenda":true,"is_outside":false,"is_high_capacity":false,"is_not_major_event":false,"backoffice_id":284815,"facebook_link":null,"import_origin":null,"is_part_of":null,"sub_type":"expo","ranking":0.3236378653619318,"languages":{"spoken":["nl","fr","en"],"subtitles":[]},"categories":{"main":{"id":23,"translations":{"de":"Ausstellung","pt":null,"en":"Exhibition","it":"Esposizioni","cn":null,"fr":"Exposition","sp":"Exhibici\u00f3n","nl":"Tentoonstellingen"}},"others":{}},"translations":{"de":{"name":"Bugatti Unseen","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.autoworld.be\/fr\/","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50001839"},"pt":{"name":"Bugatti Unseen","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.autoworld.be\/fr\/","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50001839"},"en":{"name":"Bugatti Unseen","shortdescr":"BUGATTI, THE LEGENDARY MAKE PAR EXCELLENCE, ARRIVES AT AUTOWORLD FROM 8TH SEPTEMBER THROUGH 5TH NOVEMBER 2023!\nSome fifteen unique cars will be on display at the Museum\u2019s entrance. These are all rare models and have hardly ever been presented to the general public. In addition, most of them are produced in limited series...","longdescr":"Among these gems you will have the opportunity of admiring the concept car of the one and only \u201cLa Voiture Noire\"! It was inspired from Jean Bugatti\u2019s personal car (the black Type 57 SC Atlantic which disappeared without a trace shortly before the Second World War).\n\nIn 2022 the car was sold for 16 million euros to a secret buyer about whom rumours are still rife \u2026\nContinuing along the contemporary Hypercars front, worth noting the renowned Veyron and Chiron, as well as the EB110, at the root of the Bugatti revival in the \u201890s, are all present.\nThe concept cars of the Centodieci, of which a mere ten models were produced, and of the Divo, of which only 40 units were built, will also be on hand.\n \nFour racing machines, part of a gorgeous Swiss collection, will be exhibited for the first time. But shush, we\u2019ll say no more about the identity of these models \u2026\n\nLast but not least, a number of cars linked to great names will be gathered in this out of the ordinary panel. For example, a Type 40 Coup\u00e9, Jean Bugatti\u2019s personal car, or the Type 57 SC Sp\u00e9cial Coup\u00e9, Ettore Bugatti\u2019s (himself) personal car before the Second World War.\n\nOne of our previous sovereigns, King L\u00e9opold III, was a fan of the make? One of his bygone cars is also part of the exhibition!\n\nHe also wanted to pass on his passion for Bugatti to his sons at a young age by putting them behind the wheel of the \"Baby Bugatti.\" This children's \"voiturette\" was produced from 1927 to 1936 in around 500 units. A version 2 of the \"Baby Bugatti\" was created in 2019 for the brand's 110th anniversary.\n\nIn a nutshell, this exhibition is synonymous with beauty but also a rich past that started out as a family story and love of not only elegant but also high-performance cars.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.autoworld.be\/en\/","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50001839"},"it":{"name":"Bugatti Unseen","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.autoworld.be\/fr\/","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50001839"},"cn":{"name":"Bugatti Unseen","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.autoworld.be\/fr\/","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50001839"},"fr":{"name":"Bugatti Unseen","shortdescr":"BUGATTI, LA MARQUE MYTHIQUE PAR EXCELLENCE DEBARQUE A AUTOWORLD DU 8 SEPTEMBRE AU 5 NOVEMBRE 2023!\nUne quinzaine de voitures uniques seront expos\u00e9es \u00e0 l\u2019entr\u00e9e du Mus\u00e9e. Elles sont rares et n\u2019ont presque jamais \u00e9t\u00e9 pr\u00e9sent\u00e9es au grand public. La plupart d\u2019entre elles est par ailleurs produite en s\u00e9rie tr\u00e8s limit\u00e9e\u2026","longdescr":"Toujours du c\u00f4t\u00e9 des hypercars contemporaines, notons que les c\u00e9l\u00e8bres Veyron et Chiron ainsi que la EB110 \u00e0 l\u2019origine du revival de Bugatti dans les ann\u00e9es 90 r\u00e9pondent toutes pr\u00e9sentes \u00e0 l\u2019invitation.\nLa Centodieci, produite \u00e0 seulement dix exemplaires et la Divo fabriqu\u00e9e, elle, \u00e0 40 unit\u00e9s sont \u00e9galement de la partie.\nQuatre voitures de course, faisant partie d\u2019une belle collection suisse seront expos\u00e9es pour la premi\u00e8re fois. Mais chuuuut nous n\u2019en dirons pas plus sur l\u2019identit\u00e9 des mod\u00e8les\u2026\n \nEnfin, quelques voitures li\u00e9es \u00e0 de grands noms se retrouvent dans ce panel hors du commun. Par exemple, une Type 40 Coup\u00e9, la voiture personnelle de Jean Bugatti ou encore la Type 57 SC Sp\u00e9cial Coup\u00e9, la voiture personnelle de Ettore Bugatti (himself) avant la deuxi\u00e8me guerre mondiale.\nNotre ancien souverain, le Roi Leopold III \u00e9tait un fan inconditionnel de la marque? Un de ses anciens bolides fait partie de la collection expos\u00e9e.\n\nIl a par ailleurs voulu transmettre assez t\u00f4t sa passion pour Bugatti \u00e0 ses fils en les mettant au volant de la \"Baby Bugatti\". Cette \"voiturette\" pour enfants a \u00e9t\u00e9 produite de 1927 \u00e0 1936 en 500 exemplaires environ. Une version 2 de la \"Baby Bugatti\" a \u00e9t\u00e9 cr\u00e9\u00e9e en 2019 pour l'anniversaire des 110 ans de la marque. \n\nBref, cette exposition est synonyme de beaut\u00e9 mais aussi de riche pass\u00e9 qui commen\u00e7a par une histoire familiale et un amour des voitures non seulement \u00e9l\u00e9gantes mais aussi performantes","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.autoworld.be\/fr\/","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50001839"},"sp":{"name":"Bugatti Unseen","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.autoworld.be\/fr\/","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50001839"},"nl":{"name":"Bugatti Unseen","shortdescr":"BUGATTI, HET LEGENDARISCHE MERK BIJ UITSTEK, KOMT NAAR AUTOWORLD VAN 8 SEPTEMBER TOT 5 NOVEMBER 2023! \nZo'n vijftien speciale auto's zullen te zien zijn in de tijdelijke expozone van het museum. Ze zijn zeldzaam en zijn bijna nooit aan het grote publiek getoond. De meeste zijn unieke stukken, of in zeer beperkte oplage geproduceerd...","longdescr":"Een van de auto\u2019s die ons door \u201cde fabriek\u201d werd ter beschikking gesteld, is de concept car van de enige echte \"La Voiture Noire\"! Hij is ge\u00efnspireerd op de persoonlijke auto van Jean Bugatti, de zwarte Type 57 SC Atlantic, die kort voor de Tweede Wereldoorlog spoorloos verdween.\n\nZijn nieuwe naamgenoot werd in 2022 voor 16 miljoen euro verkocht aan een mysterieuze eigenaar over wie nog steeds geruchten de ronde doen...\n\nOver hedendaagse hypercars gesproken: de beroemde Veyron en Chiron, maar ook de EB110 die in de jaren 90 de Bugatti-revival inluidde, zijn allemaal aanwezig.\nDe concept cars van Centodieci, waarvan er slechts tien zijn geproduceerd, en van de Divo, waarvan er 40 zijn gebouwd, werden ons ook door Bugatti uitgeleend.\n\nVier raceauto's uit een mooie Zwitserse collectie zullen voor het eerst te zien zijn. Maar ssst, we gaan voorlopig niets meer vertellen over de identiteit van de modellen\u2026\n\n \n\nLast but not least vind je in deze buitengewone line-up een aantal auto's die verbonden zijn aan enkele van 's werelds grootste namen. Bijvoorbeeld een Type 40 Coup\u00e9, de persoonlijke auto van Jean Bugatti, of de Type 57 SC Sp\u00e9cial Coup\u00e9, de persoonlijke auto van Ettore Bugatti (zelf) in de jaren voor de Tweede Wereldoorlog.\n\nEen van onze vorige vorsten, koning Leopold III, een Bugatti-fan was? Een van zijn vroegere auto's maakt ook deel uit van de tentoonstelling!\n\nHij wilde zijn passie voor Bugatti ook op jonge leeftijd doorgeven aan zijn zonen, door hen achter het stuur van de \"Baby Bugatti\" te zetten. Tussen 1927 en 1936 werden ongeveer 500 van het \"wagentje\" geproduceerd. Een versie 2 van de \"Baby Bugatti\" werd in 2019 gemaakt voor de 110e verjaardag van het merk.\n\nKortom, deze tentoonstelling staat synoniem voor schoonheid, maar ook voor een rijk verleden dat begon met een familiegeschiedenis en een liefde voor auto's die niet alleen elegant zijn, maar ook hoge prestaties leveren.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.autoworld.be\/nl\/","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50001839"}},"place":{"id":734,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Autoworld","address_street_name":"Parc du Cinquantenaire","address_street_number":"11","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@autoworld.be","website":"http:\/\/www.autoworld.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 736 41 65","phone_booking":"+32 2 736 41 65","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Parc du Cinquantenaire, 11","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Autoworld ist ein au\u00dfergew\u00f6hnlicher Ort, einzigartig in seiner Architektur, seiner Sammlung und den dort organisierten Ausstellungen.\r\nDas Museum befindet sich in einem repr\u00e4sentativen Geb\u00e4ude des Parc du Cinquantenaire, welches  1880 anl\u00e4sslich des 50. Jahrestages der Gr\u00fcndung des K\u00f6nigreichs Belgien erbaut wurde.\r\n\r\nMehr als 300 Fahrzeuge, Reisebusse und Motorr\u00e4der unterschiedlicher Herkunft zeichnen die Geschichte des Automobils nach und veranschaulichen die spektakul\u00e4re Entwicklung von Fahrzeugen \u00fcber mehr als ein Jahrhundert. Die emblematischsten Autos jeder Epoche erm\u00f6glichen es au\u00dferdem, die Entwicklung des Autodesigns von Anfang an bis heute zu verfolgen.\r\nThemenbereiche beleuchten spezifische Aspekte dieser Geschichte. Der \u201eSport & Wettbewerb\u201c Abschnitt zeichnet die Meilensteine des Motorsport (Rallyes und Rennen) seit 1906. \r\n\u201eMan darf nicht vergessen, dass unser Land im fr\u00fchen 20. Jahrhundert eines der wichtigsten Automobilhersteller war\u201c.\r\nIm neuen \"Media Room\" erz\u00e4hlen Filme, Videos und historische Dokumente diese Geschichte ebenso wie die automobile Entwicklung der letzten 30 Jahre.\r\n\r\nTempor\u00e4re Ausstellungen werden regelm\u00e4\u00dfig organisiert.\r\n\r\nWeitere Informationen und den Messekalender finden Sie unter: www.autoworld.be\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Autoworld","address_street_name":"Parc du Cinquantenaire","address_street_number":"11","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@autoworld.be","website":"http:\/\/www.autoworld.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 736 41 65","phone_booking":"+32 2 736 41 65","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Parc du Cinquantenaire, 11","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Esquecemo-nos frequentemente que o autom\u00f3vel foi um dos baluartes da ind\u00fastria belga antes da Segunda Guerra Mundial: Minerva, FN, Imperia, Nagant, Germain, Vivinus, para citar alguns dos mais importantes. A estrutura met\u00e1lica do museu foi concebida em 1880. Abrigou o Sal\u00e3o Autom\u00f3vel de 1902 a 1934. O museu pode ser considerado como um dos mais prestigiosos do seu g\u00e9nero na Europa, ou mesmo no mundo (cerca de 400 ve\u00edculos, todos operacionais). Podemos a\u00ed reviver a hist\u00f3ria do autom\u00f3vel, de 1886 aos anos 70, da Ford T, passando pela 2CV da Citro\u00ebn, a Carocha alem\u00e3, a Tatra checoslovaca e alguns modelos raros que pertenceram a celebridades do nosso s\u00e9culo (\u00e0 fam\u00edlia real belga ou um ve\u00edculo especialmente concebido de acordo com as exig\u00eancias do X\u00e1 da P\u00e9rsia, mas nunca fornecido).\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Autoworld","address_street_name":"Parc du Cinquantenaire","address_street_number":"11","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@autoworld.be","website":"http:\/\/www.autoworld.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 736 41 65","phone_booking":"+32 2 736 41 65","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Parc du Cinquantenaire, 11","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"An impressive historic building in Brussels, linked with automotive history, is home to Autoworld, the Belgian National Automobile Museum. Situated in the \u2018Parc du Cinquantenaire\u2019, the neo-classical building commemorated the 50th anniversary of the Kingdom of Belgium in 1880. From 1902 to 1936 it hosted motor\u00accar and motorbike exhibitions. Since 1986 it has treasured the major part of Ghislain Mahy\u2019s renowned classic car collection. \r\n\r\nOver 300 vehicles, ranging from cars and trucks to motorcycles, are on permanent display. From the earliest models of the dis\u00actant past to contemporary cars that prefigure the automobile of tomorrow, visitors are guided through the motorcar\u2019s history dating as far back as 1896. \r\n\r\nVarious cars representing the most exciting years of the auto\u00acmobile history since 1960 can be approached and admired from close by, thanks to a brilliantly designed scenography.\r\nSpecial sections focus on sports and competition, cars owned by the Belgian Royal Family, micro and bubble cars, and car design. The Belgium at Autoworld section is dedicated to the roots and history of the Belgian car industry. \r\n\r\nAutoworld is a museum on the move, with temporary exhibi\u00actions taking on various automotive themes organised through\u00acout the year. \r\n\r\nMore detailed information on autoworld.be\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Autoworld","address_street_name":"Parc du Cinquantenaire","address_street_number":"11","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@autoworld.be","website":"http:\/\/www.autoworld.be\/home","phone_contact":"+32 2 736 41 65","phone_booking":"+32 2 736 41 65","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Parc du Cinquantenaire, 11","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Autoworld, la collezione d'auto pi\u00f9 prestigiosa al mondo, inaugurata nel 1986 \u00e8 ospitata nel sontuoso edificio del Palais Mondial di Bruxelles.\r\nAutoworld \u00e8 pi\u00f9 di unmuseo, vi scoprirete una collezione di pi\u00f9 di 250 auto che raccontano la storia dell'automobile  dalle sue origini. Una zona interamente allestitata con la scenografia delle gare di auto , un altra zona dove si racconta il la storia dell'automobile e del Belgio. Il tutto situato nel Parco  Halle Sud del Cinquantenario a Bruxelles.\r\nAutoworld, un museo vivente\r\nAutoworld \u00e8 un museo vivente dove vi attende la nuova sezione Sport & Comp\u00e9tition che traccia le grandi tappe della competizione automobilistica in una scenografia originale e dinamica. \r\nSenza dimenticare la sezione pedagogica che rappresenta in maniera interattiva e ludica i vari aspetti del settore automobilistico. \r\nIl museo propone delle esposizioni dedicate al mondo dell'automobile, ai personaggi chiave della sua storia e all'evoluzione della mobilit\u00e0. \r\n\r\nSe le auto da corsa vi appassionano non perdete il laboratorio di restauroche ha luogo ogni domenica.\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"Autoworld","address_street_name":"Parc du Cinquantenaire","address_street_number":"11","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@autoworld.be","website":"http:\/\/www.autoworld.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 736 41 65","phone_booking":"+32 2 736 41 65","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Parc du Cinquantenaire, 11","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"fr":{"name":"Autoworld","address_street_name":"Parc du Cinquantenaire","address_street_number":"11","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@autoworld.be","website":"http:\/\/www.autoworld.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 736 41 65","phone_booking":"+32 2 736 41 65","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Parc du Cinquantenaire, 11","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Autoworld est un lieu exceptionnel et unique tant par son architecture que par la collection qu\u2019il abrite et les expositions qui y sont organis\u00e9es.\r\nLe mus\u00e9e est situ\u00e9 dans un prestigieux \u00e9difice du Parc du Cinquantenaire, construit en 1880 pour c\u00e9l\u00e9brer le 50\u00e8me anniversaire de la cr\u00e9ation du Royaume de Belgique. \r\n\r\nPlus de 300 v\u00e9hicules, carrosses et motos de diff\u00e9rentes origines retracent l\u2019histoire de l\u2019automobile et illustrent le d\u00e9veloppement spectaculaire des v\u00e9hicules sur plus d\u2019un si\u00e8cle. Les voitures les plus embl\u00e9matiques de chaque \u00e9poque permettent \u00e9galement de suivre l\u2019\u00e9volution du design automobile du d\u00e9but jusqu\u2019\u00e0 aujourd\u2019hui.  \r\nDes zones \u00e0 th\u00e8mes mettent en lumi\u00e8re des aspects sp\u00e9cifiques de cette histoire. La zone \u00ab Sport & Comp\u00e9tition \u00bb retrace les grandes \u00e9tapes de la comp\u00e9tition automobile (rallyes et courses) depuis 1906, et la zone \u00ab Belgium at Autoworld \u00bb rappelle que notre pays fut l\u2019un des principaux fabricants automobiles au d\u00e9but du 20\u00e8me si\u00e8cle. Dans la nouvelle \u00ab Media room \u00bb des films, vid\u00e9os et documents historiques relatent eux aussi cette histoire ainsi que l\u2019\u00e9volution automobile depuis les 30 derni\u00e8res ann\u00e9es.\r\nDes expositions temporaires sont r\u00e9guli\u00e8rement organis\u00e9es.\r\nPlus d\u2019infos et le calendrier des expositions sur : www.autoworld.be \r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Autoworld","address_street_name":"Parc du Cinquantenaire","address_street_number":"11","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@autoworld.be","website":"http:\/\/www.autoworld.be\/home","phone_contact":"+32 2 736 41 65","phone_booking":"+32 2 736 41 65","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Parc du Cinquantenaire, 11","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"A menudo olvidamos que el autom\u00f3vil fue uno de los florones de la industria belga antes de la Segunda Guerra Mundial: Minerva, FN, Imperia, Nagant, Germanin y Vivinus, por citar solo los m\u00e1s importantes. La estructura met\u00e1lica fue dise\u00f1ada en 1880. Acogi\u00f3 el sal\u00f3n del autom\u00f3vil de 1902 a 1934. El museo puede ser considerado como uno de los m\u00e1s prestigiosos de su g\u00e9nero en Europa, incluso del mundo (aproximadamente 400 veh\u00edculos, todos en estado de funcionamiento). Podemos revivir la historia del autom\u00f3vil desde el a\u00f1o 1886 hasta los a\u00f1os 70, desde el Ford T hasta llegar al Citro\u00ebn 2CV, el Volkswagen Escarabajo, el Tatra checo y algunos modelos raros que han pertenecido a celebridades de nuestro siglo (a la familia real belga o tambi\u00e9n un veh\u00edculo especialmente dise\u00f1ado seg\u00fan las exigencias del Sha de Persia, pero jam\u00e1s entregado)","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Autoworld","address_street_name":"Jubelpark","address_street_number":"11","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@autoworld.be","website":"http:\/\/www.autoworld.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 736 41 65","phone_booking":"+32 2 736 41 65","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Jubelpark, 11","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Autoworld, het nationale automuseum, is gelegen in het hart van Brussel, ondergebracht in een prestigieus gebouw in het Jubelpark. \r\n\r\nMeer dan 300 voertuigen (auto's, vrachtwagens en motorfietsen) worden er permanent tentoongesteld.  De bezoeker wordt er langs de fabelachtige geschiedenis van de auto van 1896 tot nu geleid, vanaf de oudste modellen uit een ver verleden tot hedendaagse auto's die ons een blik gunnen op  de voertuigen van morgen en zelfs van later. \r\nDe collectie werd onlangs aangevuld met een groot aantal voertuigen uit de spannendste jaren van de autogeschiedenis sinds 1960. In een licht en luchtig decor kan het publiek de tentoongestelde auto's van dichtbij bewonderen. \r\nHier en daar werden themazones ingericht, waar voertuigen van de openbare diensten, auto's die ooit aan de Koninklijke Familie toebehoorden, microcars en modellen onder het thema Design Story en Sport & Competition worden tentoongesteld.\r\nCentraal in het museum bevindt zich 'Belgium at Autoworld', een ruimte die volledig aan de bakermat en de geschiedenis van de Belgische auto-industrie tot op de dag van vandaag gewijd is. \r\nIn de 'Sport & Competition'-zone wordt een overzicht gegeven van de grote perioden in de geschiedenis van de autosport (rally en circuit) sinds 1906. \r\nAutoworld is een museum dat voortdurend evolueert. Het hele jaar door worden er tijdelijke tentoonstellingen georganiseerd over verschillende thema's die verband houden met de auto.\r\nMeer informatie over de kalender van de tentoonstellingen vindt u op www.autoworld.be \r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null}},"districts":{"list":[9],"translations":{"de":["Europ\u00e4isches Viertel"],"pt":[null],"en":["European Quarter"],"it":["Quartiere europeo"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Quartier europ\u00e9en"],"sp":["Barrio Europeo"],"nl":["Europese wijk"]}},"zones":{"list":[22],"translations":{"de":["Osten"],"pt":[null],"en":["East"],"it":["Est"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Est"],"sp":["Este"],"nl":["Oost"]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":147,"location":{"lat":50.83992036,"lon":4.39340998},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2023-08-14T16:23:39+02:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:13:18+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":false,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":734,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Autoworld","address_street_name":"Parc du Cinquantenaire","address_street_number":"11","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@autoworld.be","website":"http:\/\/www.autoworld.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 736 41 65","phone_booking":"+32 2 736 41 65","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Parc du Cinquantenaire, 11","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Autoworld ist ein au\u00dfergew\u00f6hnlicher Ort, einzigartig in seiner Architektur, seiner Sammlung und den dort organisierten Ausstellungen.\r\nDas Museum befindet sich in einem repr\u00e4sentativen Geb\u00e4ude des Parc du Cinquantenaire, welches  1880 anl\u00e4sslich des 50. Jahrestages der Gr\u00fcndung des K\u00f6nigreichs Belgien erbaut wurde.\r\n\r\nMehr als 300 Fahrzeuge, Reisebusse und Motorr\u00e4der unterschiedlicher Herkunft zeichnen die Geschichte des Automobils nach und veranschaulichen die spektakul\u00e4re Entwicklung von Fahrzeugen \u00fcber mehr als ein Jahrhundert. Die emblematischsten Autos jeder Epoche erm\u00f6glichen es au\u00dferdem, die Entwicklung des Autodesigns von Anfang an bis heute zu verfolgen.\r\nThemenbereiche beleuchten spezifische Aspekte dieser Geschichte. Der \u201eSport & Wettbewerb\u201c Abschnitt zeichnet die Meilensteine des Motorsport (Rallyes und Rennen) seit 1906. \r\n\u201eMan darf nicht vergessen, dass unser Land im fr\u00fchen 20. Jahrhundert eines der wichtigsten Automobilhersteller war\u201c.\r\nIm neuen \"Media Room\" erz\u00e4hlen Filme, Videos und historische Dokumente diese Geschichte ebenso wie die automobile Entwicklung der letzten 30 Jahre.\r\n\r\nTempor\u00e4re Ausstellungen werden regelm\u00e4\u00dfig organisiert.\r\n\r\nWeitere Informationen und den Messekalender finden Sie unter: www.autoworld.be\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Autoworld","address_street_name":"Parc du Cinquantenaire","address_street_number":"11","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@autoworld.be","website":"http:\/\/www.autoworld.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 736 41 65","phone_booking":"+32 2 736 41 65","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Parc du Cinquantenaire, 11","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Esquecemo-nos frequentemente que o autom\u00f3vel foi um dos baluartes da ind\u00fastria belga antes da Segunda Guerra Mundial: Minerva, FN, Imperia, Nagant, Germain, Vivinus, para citar alguns dos mais importantes. A estrutura met\u00e1lica do museu foi concebida em 1880. Abrigou o Sal\u00e3o Autom\u00f3vel de 1902 a 1934. O museu pode ser considerado como um dos mais prestigiosos do seu g\u00e9nero na Europa, ou mesmo no mundo (cerca de 400 ve\u00edculos, todos operacionais). Podemos a\u00ed reviver a hist\u00f3ria do autom\u00f3vel, de 1886 aos anos 70, da Ford T, passando pela 2CV da Citro\u00ebn, a Carocha alem\u00e3, a Tatra checoslovaca e alguns modelos raros que pertenceram a celebridades do nosso s\u00e9culo (\u00e0 fam\u00edlia real belga ou um ve\u00edculo especialmente concebido de acordo com as exig\u00eancias do X\u00e1 da P\u00e9rsia, mas nunca fornecido).\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Autoworld","address_street_name":"Parc du Cinquantenaire","address_street_number":"11","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@autoworld.be","website":"http:\/\/www.autoworld.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 736 41 65","phone_booking":"+32 2 736 41 65","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Parc du Cinquantenaire, 11","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"An impressive historic building in Brussels, linked with automotive history, is home to Autoworld, the Belgian National Automobile Museum. Situated in the \u2018Parc du Cinquantenaire\u2019, the neo-classical building commemorated the 50th anniversary of the Kingdom of Belgium in 1880. From 1902 to 1936 it hosted motor\u00accar and motorbike exhibitions. Since 1986 it has treasured the major part of Ghislain Mahy\u2019s renowned classic car collection. \r\n\r\nOver 300 vehicles, ranging from cars and trucks to motorcycles, are on permanent display. From the earliest models of the dis\u00actant past to contemporary cars that prefigure the automobile of tomorrow, visitors are guided through the motorcar\u2019s history dating as far back as 1896. \r\n\r\nVarious cars representing the most exciting years of the auto\u00acmobile history since 1960 can be approached and admired from close by, thanks to a brilliantly designed scenography.\r\nSpecial sections focus on sports and competition, cars owned by the Belgian Royal Family, micro and bubble cars, and car design. The Belgium at Autoworld section is dedicated to the roots and history of the Belgian car industry. \r\n\r\nAutoworld is a museum on the move, with temporary exhibi\u00actions taking on various automotive themes organised through\u00acout the year. \r\n\r\nMore detailed information on autoworld.be\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Autoworld","address_street_name":"Parc du Cinquantenaire","address_street_number":"11","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@autoworld.be","website":"http:\/\/www.autoworld.be\/home","phone_contact":"+32 2 736 41 65","phone_booking":"+32 2 736 41 65","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Parc du Cinquantenaire, 11","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Autoworld, la collezione d'auto pi\u00f9 prestigiosa al mondo, inaugurata nel 1986 \u00e8 ospitata nel sontuoso edificio del Palais Mondial di Bruxelles.\r\nAutoworld \u00e8 pi\u00f9 di unmuseo, vi scoprirete una collezione di pi\u00f9 di 250 auto che raccontano la storia dell'automobile  dalle sue origini. Una zona interamente allestitata con la scenografia delle gare di auto , un altra zona dove si racconta il la storia dell'automobile e del Belgio. Il tutto situato nel Parco  Halle Sud del Cinquantenario a Bruxelles.\r\nAutoworld, un museo vivente\r\nAutoworld \u00e8 un museo vivente dove vi attende la nuova sezione Sport & Comp\u00e9tition che traccia le grandi tappe della competizione automobilistica in una scenografia originale e dinamica. \r\nSenza dimenticare la sezione pedagogica che rappresenta in maniera interattiva e ludica i vari aspetti del settore automobilistico. \r\nIl museo propone delle esposizioni dedicate al mondo dell'automobile, ai personaggi chiave della sua storia e all'evoluzione della mobilit\u00e0. \r\n\r\nSe le auto da corsa vi appassionano non perdete il laboratorio di restauroche ha luogo ogni domenica.\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"Autoworld","address_street_name":"Parc du Cinquantenaire","address_street_number":"11","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@autoworld.be","website":"http:\/\/www.autoworld.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 736 41 65","phone_booking":"+32 2 736 41 65","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Parc du Cinquantenaire, 11","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"fr":{"name":"Autoworld","address_street_name":"Parc du Cinquantenaire","address_street_number":"11","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@autoworld.be","website":"http:\/\/www.autoworld.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 736 41 65","phone_booking":"+32 2 736 41 65","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Parc du Cinquantenaire, 11","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Autoworld est un lieu exceptionnel et unique tant par son architecture que par la collection qu\u2019il abrite et les expositions qui y sont organis\u00e9es.\r\nLe mus\u00e9e est situ\u00e9 dans un prestigieux \u00e9difice du Parc du Cinquantenaire, construit en 1880 pour c\u00e9l\u00e9brer le 50\u00e8me anniversaire de la cr\u00e9ation du Royaume de Belgique. \r\n\r\nPlus de 300 v\u00e9hicules, carrosses et motos de diff\u00e9rentes origines retracent l\u2019histoire de l\u2019automobile et illustrent le d\u00e9veloppement spectaculaire des v\u00e9hicules sur plus d\u2019un si\u00e8cle. Les voitures les plus embl\u00e9matiques de chaque \u00e9poque permettent \u00e9galement de suivre l\u2019\u00e9volution du design automobile du d\u00e9but jusqu\u2019\u00e0 aujourd\u2019hui.  \r\nDes zones \u00e0 th\u00e8mes mettent en lumi\u00e8re des aspects sp\u00e9cifiques de cette histoire. La zone \u00ab Sport & Comp\u00e9tition \u00bb retrace les grandes \u00e9tapes de la comp\u00e9tition automobile (rallyes et courses) depuis 1906, et la zone \u00ab Belgium at Autoworld \u00bb rappelle que notre pays fut l\u2019un des principaux fabricants automobiles au d\u00e9but du 20\u00e8me si\u00e8cle. Dans la nouvelle \u00ab Media room \u00bb des films, vid\u00e9os et documents historiques relatent eux aussi cette histoire ainsi que l\u2019\u00e9volution automobile depuis les 30 derni\u00e8res ann\u00e9es.\r\nDes expositions temporaires sont r\u00e9guli\u00e8rement organis\u00e9es.\r\nPlus d\u2019infos et le calendrier des expositions sur : www.autoworld.be \r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Autoworld","address_street_name":"Parc du Cinquantenaire","address_street_number":"11","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@autoworld.be","website":"http:\/\/www.autoworld.be\/home","phone_contact":"+32 2 736 41 65","phone_booking":"+32 2 736 41 65","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Parc du Cinquantenaire, 11","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"A menudo olvidamos que el autom\u00f3vil fue uno de los florones de la industria belga antes de la Segunda Guerra Mundial: Minerva, FN, Imperia, Nagant, Germanin y Vivinus, por citar solo los m\u00e1s importantes. La estructura met\u00e1lica fue dise\u00f1ada en 1880. Acogi\u00f3 el sal\u00f3n del autom\u00f3vil de 1902 a 1934. El museo puede ser considerado como uno de los m\u00e1s prestigiosos de su g\u00e9nero en Europa, incluso del mundo (aproximadamente 400 veh\u00edculos, todos en estado de funcionamiento). Podemos revivir la historia del autom\u00f3vil desde el a\u00f1o 1886 hasta los a\u00f1os 70, desde el Ford T hasta llegar al Citro\u00ebn 2CV, el Volkswagen Escarabajo, el Tatra checo y algunos modelos raros que han pertenecido a celebridades de nuestro siglo (a la familia real belga o tambi\u00e9n un veh\u00edculo especialmente dise\u00f1ado seg\u00fan las exigencias del Sha de Persia, pero jam\u00e1s entregado)","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Autoworld","address_street_name":"Jubelpark","address_street_number":"11","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@autoworld.be","website":"http:\/\/www.autoworld.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 736 41 65","phone_booking":"+32 2 736 41 65","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Jubelpark, 11","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Autoworld, het nationale automuseum, is gelegen in het hart van Brussel, ondergebracht in een prestigieus gebouw in het Jubelpark. \r\n\r\nMeer dan 300 voertuigen (auto's, vrachtwagens en motorfietsen) worden er permanent tentoongesteld.  De bezoeker wordt er langs de fabelachtige geschiedenis van de auto van 1896 tot nu geleid, vanaf de oudste modellen uit een ver verleden tot hedendaagse auto's die ons een blik gunnen op  de voertuigen van morgen en zelfs van later. \r\nDe collectie werd onlangs aangevuld met een groot aantal voertuigen uit de spannendste jaren van de autogeschiedenis sinds 1960. In een licht en luchtig decor kan het publiek de tentoongestelde auto's van dichtbij bewonderen. \r\nHier en daar werden themazones ingericht, waar voertuigen van de openbare diensten, auto's die ooit aan de Koninklijke Familie toebehoorden, microcars en modellen onder het thema Design Story en Sport & Competition worden tentoongesteld.\r\nCentraal in het museum bevindt zich 'Belgium at Autoworld', een ruimte die volledig aan de bakermat en de geschiedenis van de Belgische auto-industrie tot op de dag van vandaag gewijd is. \r\nIn de 'Sport & Competition'-zone wordt een overzicht gegeven van de grote perioden in de geschiedenis van de autosport (rally en circuit) sinds 1906. \r\nAutoworld is een museum dat voortdurend evolueert. Het hele jaar door worden er tijdelijke tentoonstellingen georganiseerd over verschillende thema's die verband houden met de auto.\r\nMeer informatie over de kalender van de tentoonstellingen vindt u op www.autoworld.be \r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"region":"brussels","backoffice_id":147,"location":{"lat":50.83992036,"lon":4.39340998},"last_updated_at":"2023-08-14T16:23:39+02:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:13:18+02:00","is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":false,"import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"resto_ranking":0},"media":[{"type":"photo","link":"https:\/\/agendabrussels2.imgix.net\/e9b6d76cb2c950c725aabe338d26191da8e37ed8.jpg","width":1200,"height":675,"ratio":1,"oEmbed_height":675,"oEmbed_width":1200,"translations":{"de":{"title":"Bugatti Unseen","copyright":null},"pt":{"title":"Bugatti Unseen","copyright":null},"en":{"title":"Bugatti Unseen","copyright":null},"it":{"title":"Bugatti Unseen","copyright":null},"cn":{"title":"Bugatti Unseen","copyright":null},"fr":{"title":"Bugatti Unseen","copyright":null},"sp":{"title":"Bugatti Unseen","copyright":null},"nl":{"title":"Bugatti Unseen","copyright":null}}}],"dates":[{"day":"2023-09-08","doors":null,"start":"10:00:00","end":"17:00:00","end_night_life":null,"is_soldout":false,"is_canceled":false},{"day":"2023-09-09","doors":null,"start":"10:00:00","end":"18:00:00","end_night_life":null,"is_soldout":false,"is_canceled":false},{"day":"2023-09-10","doors":null,"start":"10:00:00","end":"18:00:00","end_night_life":null,"is_soldout":false,"is_canceled":false},{"day":"2023-09-11","doors":null,"start":"10:00:00","end":"17:00:00","end_night_life":null,"is_soldout":false,"is_canceled":false},{"day":"2023-09-12","doors":null,"start":"10:00:00","end":"17:00:00","end_night_life":null,"is_soldout":false,"is_canceled":false},{"day":"2023-09-13","doors":null,"start":"10:00:00","end":"17:00:00","end_night_life":null,"is_soldout":f