 et dimanche: de 13:00 \u00e0 19:00"],"nl":["maandag, dinsdag, woensdag, donderdag, vrijdag, zaterdag en zondag: van 13:00 tot 19:00"]},"date_start":"2023-09-21","date_end":"2023-10-29","is_also_by_appointment":true}],"date_exceptions":[],"closing_days":[],"child_events":[],"parent_events":[],"accessibilities":[],"recurring":[],"targets":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"educational_targets":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"tags":["annee_art_nouveau"]},{"id":50002590,"date_start":"2023-09-29","date_end":"2023-12-31","date_next":"2023-10-23","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":true,"is_pay_as_you_can":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"last_updated_at":"2023-10-23T02:03:40+02:00","published_at":"2023-09-24T10:07:36+02:00","publication_state":"public","date_embargo":null,"show_in_agenda":true,"is_outside":true,"is_high_capacity":false,"is_not_major_event":false,"backoffice_id":286035,"facebook_link":null,"import_origin":null,"is_part_of":"Ann\u00e9e Art Nouveau","sub_type":"expo","ranking":0.2770984186529621,"languages":{"spoken":["en","nl","fr"],"subtitles":[]},"categories":{"main":{"id":23,"translations":{"de":"Ausstellung","pt":null,"en":"Exhibition","it":"Esposizioni","cn":null,"fr":"Exposition","sp":"Exhibici\u00f3n","nl":"Tentoonstellingen"}},"others":{}},"translations":{"de":{"name":"DAUGHTERS","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/hallessaintgery.be\/","email":"accueil@hallessaintgery.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 44 24","phone_booking":"+32 2 502 44 24","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50002590"},"pt":{"name":"DAUGHTERS","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/hallessaintgery.be\/","email":"accueil@hallessaintgery.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 44 24","phone_booking":"+32 2 502 44 24","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50002590"},"en":{"name":"DAUGHTERS","shortdescr":"Conceived in the context of the Art Nouveau year, \u00ab Daughters \u00bb proposes to create a dialogue between past and present by connecting female Art Nouveau artists and contemporary female artists practising the same mediums (textile, silk painting, sculpture, engraving, etc.). The aim is to present and promote these artists and observe how their shared practice creates a genuine link among them.","longdescr":" While the Art Nouveau style advocated equality among all the arts, at the turn of the twentieth century, gender parity was far from being a reality. While some Art Nouveau artists have gone down in history, those are rarely women, unless they are associated with men. This invisibility is sometimes linked to the fragility of the chosen medium, but is most often due to the dictates of society that tend to forget women's work.\n\u00ab Daughters \u00bb is also an exhibition on view in the public space 24\/7 until 29 October 2023 at H\u00f4tel des Monnaies metro station.\n\nThe Art Nouveau Brussels 2023 programme is held jointly by Urban, visit.brussels and their stakeholders.","performers":"Photographer and artistic director : Barbara Salom\u00e9 Felgenhauer\n Authoress : L\u00e9one Drapeaud\nGraphic designer : C\u00e9line Boveroux (Studio la Folie)\nFloral scenographer : Ell\u00e9a Cartier\nAssistants photographer : Camille Poitevin & Anna Safiatou Tour\u00e9\nArtists : Olga Boich\u00e9, Laura Bossicart, Lou Cocody Valentino, Brigitte Danse, Camille Dufour, Chanel Kapitanj, M\u00e9gane Likin & Zyle","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/hallessaintgery.be\/","email":"accueil@hallessaintgery.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 44 24","phone_booking":"+32 2 502 44 24","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50002590"},"it":{"name":"DAUGHTERS","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/hallessaintgery.be\/","email":"accueil@hallessaintgery.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 44 24","phone_booking":"+32 2 502 44 24","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50002590"},"cn":{"name":"DAUGHTERS","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/hallessaintgery.be\/","email":"accueil@hallessaintgery.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 44 24","phone_booking":"+32 2 502 44 24","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50002590"},"fr":{"name":"H\u00c9RITI\u00c8RES","shortdescr":"Con\u00e7ue dans le cadre de l\u2019ann\u00e9e Art nouveau, \u00ab H\u00e9riti\u00e8res \u00bb souhaite cr\u00e9er un dialogue entre pass\u00e9 et pr\u00e9sent en connectant artistes Art nouveau et artistes contemporaines pratiquant les m\u00eames mediums (textile, peinture sur soie, sculpture, gravure\u2026). L\u2019objectif est de mieux faire conna\u00eetre ces artistes et d\u2019observer comment la pratique commune cr\u00e9e entre elles un lien v\u00e9ritable. ","longdescr":"Alors que le style Art nouveau pr\u00f4ne l\u2019\u00e9galit\u00e9 entre tous les arts, \u00e0 l\u2019\u00e9poque, la parit\u00e9 en mati\u00e8re de genre est loin d\u2019\u00eatre r\u00e9elle. Si l\u2019Histoire a retenu des noms d\u2019artistes Art nouveau, il s\u2019agit rarement de femmes, sinon associ\u00e9es \u00e0 des hommes. Leur invisibilisation est parfois li\u00e9e \u00e0 la fragilit\u00e9 du medium choisi, mais le plus souvent \u00e0 un effacement devant les dictats de la soci\u00e9t\u00e9. \n\u00ab H\u00e9riti\u00e8res \u00bb est \u00e9galement une exposition visible dans l\u2019espace public 24h sur 24 et 7j sur 7 jusqu\u2019au 29 octobre 2023 \u00e0 la station de m\u00e9tro H\u00f4tel des Monnaies. \n\nLa programmation Art Nouveau Brussels 2023 est organis\u00e9e conjointement par Urban, visit.brussels et leurs partenaires.","performers":"Photographe et directrice artistique : Barbara Salom\u00e9 Felgenhauer\nAutrice : L\u00e9one Drapeaud\nGraphiste : C\u00e9line Boveroux (Studio la Folie)\nSc\u00e9nographe florale : Ell\u00e9a Cartier\nAssistantes photographe  : Camille Poitevin & Anna Safiatou Tour\u00e9\nArtistes : Olga Boich\u00e9, Laura Bossicart, Lou Cocody Valentino, Brigitte Danse, Camille Dufour, Chanel Kapitanj, M\u00e9gane Likin & Zyle","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/hallessaintgery.be\/","email":"accueil@hallessaintgery.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 44 24","phone_booking":"+32 2 502 44 24","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50002590"},"sp":{"name":"DAUGHTERS","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/hallessaintgery.be\/","email":"accueil@hallessaintgery.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 44 24","phone_booking":"+32 2 502 44 24","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50002590"},"nl":{"name":"ERFGENAMES","shortdescr":"In het kader van het art-nouveaujaar wil \"Erfgenames\" een dialoog tot stand brengen tussen heden en verleden door art-nouveaukunstenaressen in contact te brengen met hedendaagse kunstenaressen die in dezelfde media werken (textiel, zijdeschilderen, beeldhouwen, enz.). Het doel is om deze kunstenaressen beter te leren kennen en te zien hoe hun gedeelde praktijk een echte band tussen hen cre\u00ebert.","longdescr":"Hoewel de art-nouveaustijl gelijkheid tussen alle kunsten voorstond was er rond de eeuwwisseling nog lang geen sprake van gendergelijkheid. Wanneer de geschiedenis het over de namen van art-nouveaukunstenares heeft, dan gaat het zelden over vrouwen, tenzij ze geassocieerd worden met mannen. Deze onzichtbaarheid heeft soms te maken met de kwetsbaarheid van het gekozen medium, maar meestal met een terugtrekking uit de dictaten van de maatschappij. \n\u00ab Erfgenames \u00bb is ook een tentoonstelling die 24\/7 in de openbare ruimte te zien is tot 29 oktober 2023 in metrostation Munthof.\n\nHet programma Art Nouveau Brussels 2023 wordt samen georganiseerd door Urban, visit.brussels en hun partners.","performers":"Fotografe en artistiek directeur : Barbara Salom\u00e9 Felgenhauer\nSchrijfster : L\u00e9one Drapeaud\nGrafisch ontwerpster : C\u00e9line Boveroux (Studio la Folie)\nBloemsierkunstenares : Ell\u00e9a Cartier\nAssistenten schietfotograaf : Camille Poitevin & Anna Safiatou Tour\u00e9\nKunstenares : Olga Boich\u00e9, Laura Bossicart, Lou Cocody Valentino, Brigitte Danse, Camille Dufour, Chanel Kapitanj, M\u00e9gane Likin & Zyle","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/hallessaintgery.be\/","email":"accueil@hallessaintgery.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 44 24","phone_booking":"+32 2 502 44 24","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50002590"}},"place":{"id":247371,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Halles Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_street_name":"Place Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"accueil@hallessaintgery.be","website":"http:\/\/www.hallessaintgery.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 44 24","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Die Halles Saint-G\u00e9ry mit ihrer eklektischen Architektur wurden Ende des 19. Jahrhundert als Markthalle erbaut und spielten in der Br\u00fcsseler Stadtgeschichte eine wichtige Rolle.\r\n\r\nDie Saint-G\u00e9ry-Hallen waren einerseits sowohl legend\u00e4re als auch kaufm\u00e4nnische Wiege der Stadt. Ab dem 11. Jahrhundert stand an dieser Stelle eine dem Heiligen Saint-G\u00e9ry gewidmete Kapelle. Verschiedene Wohnh\u00e4user waren hier entstanden und aufgrund der N\u00e4he zur Senne entwickelten sich zahlreiche Aktivit\u00e4ten.\r\n\r\nIm 16. Jahrhundert erhielt die Kapelle den Status einer Pfarrkirche, die prachtvoll im gotischen Stil erweitert wurde, dann aber im Zuge der Franz\u00f6sische Revolution dem Erdboden gleichgemacht wurde.\r\n\r\nDer ehemalige Markt - und sogar das gesamte Saint-G\u00e9ry-Viertel \u2013 waren ihrerseits in den 1960er-Jahren von der Zerst\u00f6rung bedroht, bis das Viertel in den 1990er-Jahren eine Art zweiten Fr\u00fchling erlebte. Seit 1999 fungieren die Saint-G\u00e9ry-Hallen als Informations- und Ausstellungszentrum rund um die Br\u00fcsseler Stadtgeschichte und das st\u00e4dtische Leben in Br\u00fcssel. An der Bar gibt es Getr\u00e4nke und Speisen.\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Halles Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_street_name":"Place Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"accueil@hallessaintgery.be","website":"http:\/\/www.hallessaintgery.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 44 24","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Halles Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_street_name":"Place Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"accueil@hallessaintgery.be","website":"http:\/\/www.hallessaintgery.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 44 24","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"The Saint-G\u00e9ry Market Halls are a fine architectural example of 19th-century public markets in Brussels. The building was completely restored several years ago and is now a permanent information and exhibition space, with urban planning, heritage, and urban renewal as its central themes.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Halle di Saint-Gery","address_street_name":"Place Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"accueil@hallessaintgery.be","website":"http:\/\/www.hallessaintgery.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 44 24","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Le Halles Saint-G\u00e9ry (mercato coperto) ospitano un centro d'informazione dedicato al patrimonio e al quadro di vita dei Bruxellesi...\r\nLe Halles Saint-G\u00e9ry (mercato coperto) ospitano un centro d'informazione dedicato al patrimonio e al quadro di vita dei Bruxellesi. Sotto il patrocinio della regione di Bruxelles Capitale.\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"Halles Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_street_name":"Place Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"accueil@hallessaintgery.be","website":"http:\/\/www.hallessaintgery.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 44 24","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"fr":{"name":"Halles Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_street_name":"Place Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"accueil@hallessaintgery.be","website":"http:\/\/www.hallessaintgery.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 44 24","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Remarquable t\u00e9moin de l\u2019architecture des march\u00e9s couverts, les Halles Saint-G\u00e9ry  contribuent \u00e0 valoriser le patrimoine de la R\u00e9gion de Bruxelles-Capitale. Centre d\u2019exposition et de manifestation bas\u00e9 en plein coeur du pentagone, elles ont pour vocation de mettre en valeur les traits de d\u00e9marcation du cadre de vie bruxellois et de son identit\u00e9 urbaine par le biais d'une programmation hybride, allant des expositions, aux conf\u00e9rences, concerts, rencontres et performances \u2026\r\nLe Centre Urbain (guichet d\u2019information r\u00e9gional, pour mieux vous conseiller sur l\u2019habitat durable en R\u00e9gion de Bruxelles-Capitale) est \u00e9galement situ\u00e9 au sein des Halles.\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Halles Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_street_name":"Place Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"accueil@hallessaintgery.be","website":"http:\/\/www.hallessaintgery.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 44 24","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Verdadero testigo de los mercados cubiertos, las Halles Saint-G\u00e9ry albergan un centro de informaci\u00f3n, bajo la \u00e9gida de la Regio\u00f3n de Bruselas Capital y dedicado al patrimonio...\r\nVerdadero testigo de los mercados cubiertos, las Halles Saint-G\u00e9ry albergan un centro de informaci\u00f3n, bajo la \u00e9gida de la Regio\u00f3n de Bruselas Capital y dedicado al patrimonio y al marco de vida de los bruselenses.\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Sint-Gorikshallen","address_street_name":"Sint-Goriksplein","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"accueil@hallessaintgery.be","website":"http:\/\/www.hallessaintgery.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 44 24","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Sint-Goriksplein","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"De Sint-Gorikshallen zijn een prachtig architecturaal staaltje van openbare markthallen in het 19de-eeuwse Brussel. Het gebouw werd een aantal jaren geleden volledig gerestaureerd en doet tegenwoordig dienst als permanente informatie-, tentoonstellings- en evenementenruimte gewijd aan het erfgoed en de levenswijzen in de hoofdstad. Op amper twee minuten stappen van de Beurs vormen de Sint-Gorikshallen een gezellige plek om te ontspannen en nieuwe dingen te ontdekken, zowel overdag als bij het vallen van de nacht.\r\nDe hallen herbergen ook de Stadswinkel, een vereniging die de inwoners van het Brussels Hoofdstedelijk Gewest  wil informeren over het leefmilieu en een kwaliteitsvolle leefomgeving, huisvesting, stadsrenovatie, stedenbouw en ruimtelijke ordening, en rationeel energiegebruik. ","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null}},"districts":{"list":[3],"translations":{"de":["Dansaert\/Sainte-Catherine"],"pt":[null],"en":["Dansaert\/Sainte-Catherine"],"it":["Dansaert\/Sainte-Catherine"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Dansaert\/Sainte-Catherine"],"sp":["Dansaert\/Sainte-Catherine"],"nl":["Dansaertwijk\/Sint-Katelijne"]}},"zones":{"list":[19],"translations":{"de":["Zentrum"],"pt":[null],"en":["Centre"],"it":["Centro"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Centre"],"sp":["Centro"],"nl":["Centrum"]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":9562,"location":{"lat":50.84801328,"lon":4.34683241},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2022-12-19T14:03:38+01:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:26:22+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":247371,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Halles Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_street_name":"Place Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"accueil@hallessaintgery.be","website":"http:\/\/www.hallessaintgery.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 44 24","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Die Halles Saint-G\u00e9ry mit ihrer eklektischen Architektur wurden Ende des 19. Jahrhundert als Markthalle erbaut und spielten in der Br\u00fcsseler Stadtgeschichte eine wichtige Rolle.\r\n\r\nDie Saint-G\u00e9ry-Hallen waren einerseits sowohl legend\u00e4re als auch kaufm\u00e4nnische Wiege der Stadt. Ab dem 11. Jahrhundert stand an dieser Stelle eine dem Heiligen Saint-G\u00e9ry gewidmete Kapelle. Verschiedene Wohnh\u00e4user waren hier entstanden und aufgrund der N\u00e4he zur Senne entwickelten sich zahlreiche Aktivit\u00e4ten.\r\n\r\nIm 16. Jahrhundert erhielt die Kapelle den Status einer Pfarrkirche, die prachtvoll im gotischen Stil erweitert wurde, dann aber im Zuge der Franz\u00f6sische Revolution dem Erdboden gleichgemacht wurde.\r\n\r\nDer ehemalige Markt - und sogar das gesamte Saint-G\u00e9ry-Viertel \u2013 waren ihrerseits in den 1960er-Jahren von der Zerst\u00f6rung bedroht, bis das Viertel in den 1990er-Jahren eine Art zweiten Fr\u00fchling erlebte. Seit 1999 fungieren die Saint-G\u00e9ry-Hallen als Informations- und Ausstellungszentrum rund um die Br\u00fcsseler Stadtgeschichte und das st\u00e4dtische Leben in Br\u00fcssel. An der Bar gibt es Getr\u00e4nke und Speisen.\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Halles Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_street_name":"Place Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"accueil@hallessaintgery.be","website":"http:\/\/www.hallessaintgery.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 44 24","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Halles Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_street_name":"Place Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"accueil@hallessaintgery.be","website":"http:\/\/www.hallessaintgery.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 44 24","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"The Saint-G\u00e9ry Market Halls are a fine architectural example of 19th-century public markets in Brussels. The building was completely restored several years ago and is now a permanent information and exhibition space, with urban planning, heritage, and urban renewal as its central themes.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Halle di Saint-Gery","address_street_name":"Place Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"accueil@hallessaintgery.be","website":"http:\/\/www.hallessaintgery.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 44 24","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Le Halles Saint-G\u00e9ry (mercato coperto) ospitano un centro d'informazione dedicato al patrimonio e al quadro di vita dei Bruxellesi...\r\nLe Halles Saint-G\u00e9ry (mercato coperto) ospitano un centro d'informazione dedicato al patrimonio e al quadro di vita dei Bruxellesi. Sotto il patrocinio della regione di Bruxelles Capitale.\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"Halles Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_street_name":"Place Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"accueil@hallessaintgery.be","website":"http:\/\/www.hallessaintgery.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 44 24","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"fr":{"name":"Halles Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_street_name":"Place Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"accueil@hallessaintgery.be","website":"http:\/\/www.hallessaintgery.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 44 24","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Remarquable t\u00e9moin de l\u2019architecture des march\u00e9s couverts, les Halles Saint-G\u00e9ry  contribuent \u00e0 valoriser le patrimoine de la R\u00e9gion de Bruxelles-Capitale. Centre d\u2019exposition et de manifestation bas\u00e9 en plein coeur du pentagone, elles ont pour vocation de mettre en valeur les traits de d\u00e9marcation du cadre de vie bruxellois et de son identit\u00e9 urbaine par le biais d'une programmation hybride, allant des expositions, aux conf\u00e9rences, concerts, rencontres et performances \u2026\r\nLe Centre Urbain (guichet d\u2019information r\u00e9gional, pour mieux vous conseiller sur l\u2019habitat durable en R\u00e9gion de Bruxelles-Capitale) est \u00e9galement situ\u00e9 au sein des Halles.\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Halles Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_street_name":"Place Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"accueil@hallessaintgery.be","website":"http:\/\/www.hallessaintgery.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 44 24","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Verdadero testigo de los mercados cubiertos, las Halles Saint-G\u00e9ry albergan un centro de informaci\u00f3n, bajo la \u00e9gida de la Regio\u00f3n de Bruselas Capital y dedicado al patrimonio...\r\nVerdadero testigo de los mercados cubiertos, las Halles Saint-G\u00e9ry albergan un centro de informaci\u00f3n, bajo la \u00e9gida de la Regio\u00f3n de Bruselas Capital y dedicado al patrimonio y al marco de vida de los bruselenses.\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Sint-Gorikshallen","address_street_name":"Sint-Goriksplein","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"accueil@hallessaintgery.be","website":"http:\/\/www.hallessaintgery.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 44 24","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Sint-Goriksplein","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"De Sint-Gorikshallen zijn een prachtig architecturaal staaltje van openbare markthallen in het 19de-eeuwse Brussel. Het gebouw werd een aantal jaren geleden volledig gerestaureerd en doet tegenwoordig dienst als permanente informatie-, tentoonstellings- en evenementenruimte gewijd aan het erfgoed en de levenswijzen in de hoofdstad. Op amper twee minuten stappen van de Beurs vormen de Sint-Gorikshallen een gezellige plek om te ontspannen en nieuwe dingen te ontdekken, zowel overdag als bij het vallen van de nacht.\r\nDe hallen herbergen ook de Stadswinkel, een vereniging die de inwoners van het Brussels Hoofdstedelijk Gewest  wil informeren over het leefmilieu en een kwaliteitsvolle leefomgeving, huisvesting, stadsrenovatie, stedenbouw en ruimtelijke ordening, en rationeel energiegebruik. ","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"region":"brussels","backoffice_id":9562,"location":{"lat":50.84801328,"lon":4.34683241},"last_updated_at":"2022-12-19T14:03:38+01:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:26:22+02:00","is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"resto_ranking":0},"media":[{"type":"photo","link":"https:\/\/agendabrussels2.imgix.net\/477b6cc150502ccb5a26d31d3a0650bb529d36aa.jpg","width":2436,"height":3435,"ratio":0,"oEmbed_height":3435,"oEmbed_width":2436,"translations":{"de":{"title":"H\u00c9RITI\u00c8RES","copyright":"Barbara Salom\u00e9 Felg