r":"Exposition","sp":"Exhibici\u00f3n","nl":"Tentoonstellingen"}},"others":{"list":[41,36],"translations":{"de":["Installation, Performance","Museen & Kunstzentren"],"pt":[null,null],"en":["Installation, performance","Museums and art centers"],"it":["Installazioni, performance","Musei e centri artistici"],"cn":[null,null],"fr":["Installation, performance","Mus\u00e9es et art centers"],"sp":["Instalaci\u00f3n, performance","Museos y centros de arte"],"nl":["Installatie, performance","Musea en kunstcentra"]}}},"translations":{"de":{"name":"Age of Dust","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/constantvzw.org","email":"info@constantvzw.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 539 24 67","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50001936"},"pt":{"name":"Age of Dust","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/constantvzw.org","email":"info@constantvzw.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 539 24 67","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50001936"},"en":{"name":"Age of Dust","shortdescr":"In the installation in the window of Constant, Hackers & Designers will show traces of the workshop Age of Dust. Essential source of energy, sacred healing powers, geological warning, what messages and hopes does the Dust carry?","longdescr":"Opening: Thursday 21 September 2023 from 18:00 on\n\nGenerations after the eruption of the Volcano, three communities meet around the discovery of a mysterious mineral: the Dust. Essential source of energy, sacred healing powers, geological warning, what messages and hopes does the Dust carry? When different belief systems meet, how to find a common ground? How will their encounter shape the world of tomorrow?\n\nIn the installation in the window of Constant, Hackers & Designers will show traces of the workshop Age of Dust which took place in Brussels on 15,16 and 17 September. During the workshop, the collective invited the participants to play out social and somatic dynamics to resist conventional narrative stereotypes and think beyond humans while experimenting with collaborative storytelling.","performers":"Hackers & Designers (Art collective)","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/constantvzw.org","email":"info@constantvzw.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 539 24 67","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50001936"},"it":{"name":"Age of Dust","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/constantvzw.org","email":"info@constantvzw.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 539 24 67","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50001936"},"cn":{"name":"Age of Dust","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/constantvzw.org","email":"info@constantvzw.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 539 24 67","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50001936"},"fr":{"name":"L\u2019\u00e2ge de la poussi\u00e8re","shortdescr":"Dans l\u2019installation dans la vitrine de Constant, Hackers & Designers montrera des traces de l\u2019atelier L\u2019\u00c2ge de la poussi\u00e8re. Source essentielle d\u2019\u00e9nergie, pouvoir sacr\u00e9 de gu\u00e9rison, alerte g\u00e9ologique...quels sont les messages et les espoirs v\u00e9hicul\u00e9s par la poussi\u00e8re ?","longdescr":"Vernissage : jeudi 21 septembre 2023 \u00e0 partir de 18:00\n\nDes g\u00e9n\u00e9rations apr\u00e8s l\u2019\u00e9ruption du Volcan, trois communaut\u00e9s se retrouvent autour de la d\u00e9couverte d\u2019un ph\u00e9nom\u00e8ne g\u00e9ologique myst\u00e9rieux : la Poussi\u00e8re. Source essentielle d\u2019\u00e9nergie, pouvoir sacr\u00e9 de gu\u00e9rison, alerte g\u00e9ologique...quels sont les messages et les espoirs v\u00e9hicul\u00e9s par la poussi\u00e8re ? Quand des syst\u00e8mes de croyances diff\u00e9rents se rencontrent, comment trouver un terrain d\u2019entente ? Comment leur rencontre va-t-elle fa\u00e7onner le monde de demain ?\n\nDans l\u2019installation de la vitrine de Constant, Hackers & Designers montrera des traces de l\u2019atelier L\u2019\u00c2ge de la poussi\u00e8re qui s\u2019est d\u00e9roul\u00e9 \u00e0 Bruxelles les 15, 16 et 17 septembre. Au cours de cet atelier, le collectif a invit\u00e9 les participants \u00e0 jouer des dynamiques somatiques et sociales pour r\u00e9sister aux st\u00e9r\u00e9otypes de narrations conventionnels et \u00e0 penser au del\u00e0 de l\u2019humain, tout en tissant une histoire collective.","performers":"Hackers & Designers (Collective artistique)","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/constantvzw.org","email":"info@constantvzw.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 539 24 67","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50001936"},"sp":{"name":"Age of Dust","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/constantvzw.org","email":"info@constantvzw.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 539 24 67","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50001936"},"nl":{"name":"De Tijd van het Stof","shortdescr":"In de installatie in de vitrine van Constant toont Hackers & Designers sporen van de workshop De Tijd van het Stof. Het Stof is een essenti\u00eble bron van energie, heilige helende krachten en geologische waarschuwing. Welke hoop en berichten draagt het Stof met zich mee?","longdescr":"Opening: donderdag 21 september 2023 vanaf 18:00\n\nGeneraties na de uitbarsting van De Vulkaan ontmoeten drie gemeenschappen elkaar rond de ontdekking van een mysterieus mineraal: het Stof. Het Stof is een essenti\u00eble bron van energie, heilige helende krachten en geologische waarschuwing. Welke hoop en berichten draagt het Stof met zich mee? Hoe vinden verschillende geloofssystemen een gemeenschappelijke basis wanneer zij elkaar tegenkomen? Hoe kan hun ontmoeting helpen vorm te geven aan de wereld van morgen?\n\nIn de installatie in de vitrine van Constant toont Hackers & Designers sporen van de workshop De Tijd van het Stof die op 15, 16 en 17 september plaatsvond in Brussel. Tijdens de workshop nodigde het collectief de deelnemers uit te spelen met sociale en lichamelijke dynamieken en samen te experimenteren met het collaboratief verhalen vertellen, om zo conventionele verhaallijnen te weerstaan en verder te denken dan het menselijk perspectief.","performers":"Hackers & Designers (Kunstcollectief)","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/constantvzw.org","email":"info@constantvzw.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 539 24 67","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50001936"}},"place":{"id":243917,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Constant asbl","address_street_name":"Rue du Fort","address_street_number":"5","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@constantvzw.org","website":"http:\/\/www.constantvzw.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 539 24 67","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue du Fort, 5","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Constant asbl","address_street_name":"Rue du Fort","address_street_number":"5","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@constantvzw.org","website":"http:\/\/www.constantvzw.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 539 24 67","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue du Fort, 5","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Constant","address_street_name":"Rue du Fort","address_street_number":"5","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@constantvzw.org","website":"http:\/\/www.constantvzw.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 539 24 67","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue du Fort, 5","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Constant asbl","address_street_name":"Rue du Fort","address_street_number":"5","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@constantvzw.org","website":"http:\/\/www.constantvzw.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 539 24 67","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue du Fort, 5","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"Constant asbl","address_street_name":"Rue du Fort","address_street_number":"5","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@constantvzw.org","website":"http:\/\/www.constantvzw.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 539 24 67","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue du Fort, 5","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"fr":{"name":"Constant asbl","address_street_name":"Rue du Fort","address_street_number":"5","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@constantvzw.org","website":"http:\/\/www.constantvzw.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 539 24 67","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue du Fort, 5","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":"Constant est une association sans but lucratif bas\u00e9e \u00e0 Bruxelles, active depuis 1997 dans les domaines de l\u2019art et des m\u00e9dias.\r\nConstant est un atelier interdisciplinaire qui se concentre sur la culture et l\u2019\u00e9thique du web. La pratique artistique de Constant est inspir\u00e9e par la fa\u00e7on avec laquelle les infrastructures technologiques, les \u00e9changes de donn\u00e9es et les logiciels d\u00e9terminent nos vies quotidiennes. Quelques chantiers importants sont le logiciel libre, les alternatives au copyright et le (cyber)f\u00e9minisme.\r\nDe fa\u00e7on r\u00e9guli\u00e8re Constant organise des ateliers, des print-parties, des balades, des performances, des lectures et des rencontres \u2018Verbindingen\/Jonctions\u2019 pour un public qui aime l\u2019exp\u00e9rimentation, la discussion et des \u00e9changes de toutes sortes.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Constant asbl","address_street_name":"Rue du Fort","address_street_number":"5","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@constantvzw.org","website":"http:\/\/www.constantvzw.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 539 24 67","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue du Fort, 5","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Constant vzw","address_street_name":"Fortstraat","address_street_number":"5","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@constantvzw.org","website":"http:\/\/www.constantvzw.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 539 24 67","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Fortstraat, 5","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":"Constant is een vereniging zonder winstoogmerk werkzaam in het gebied tussen kunst en media.\r\nHet is een interdisciplinaire werkplaats die zich bezighoudt met de cultuur en ethiek van het web. De artistieke praktijk van Constant wordt ge\u00efnspireerd door de manier waarop technologische infrastructuren, data-uitwisseling en software ons dagelijkse leven bepalen. Belangrijke werkterreinen zijn vrije software, alternatieven op auteursrecht en (cyber)feminisme.\r\nConstant organisee