ery.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 495 32 03 62","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.539613"},"en":{"name":"World War I Tour in Brussels","shortdescr":"The tour highlights the consequences of the German occupation for the inhabitants of Brussels in the period 1914-1918. A unique experience.","longdescr":"Did you know that in 1914, the German general staff moved into the Brussels City Hall, that the Royal Palace was used as a hospital, that the parks were transformed into a vegetable garden, that dogs pulled hand carts? We have so many historical events and anecdotes to tell you, but also to show you during a short projection of filmed archives, making you relive the daily life of the Brussels inhabitants during the Great War. Practical information: Price: 200 \u20ac (guided tour of 3 hours \u2013 up to 10 people). 250 \u20ac (guided tour of 3 hours \u2013 up to 25 people). 250 \u20ac (guided tour of 6 hours \u2013 up to 10 people). 320 \u20ac (guided tour of 6 hours \u2013 up to 25 people). When: Every day. Starting time: You choose. Meeting point: You decide (The Grand-Place of Brussels, at the Congress Column, in your hotel or anywhere else in the historic center of Brussels). Duration: 3 hours or 6 hours. Language: The tour is exclusively in English. Included: English speaking guide. Exclusive and private tour. Tours defined according to your needs. Can be included: transport, museum admissions, meals, drinks\u2026","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.bravodiscovery.com","email":"info@bravodiscovery.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 495 32 03 62","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.539613"},"it":{"name":"Visite guid\u00e9e Bruxelles 14-18","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.bravodiscovery.com","email":"info@bravodiscovery.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 495 32 03 62","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.539613"},"cn":{"name":"Visite guid\u00e9e Bruxelles 14-18","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.bravodiscovery.com","email":"info@bravodiscovery.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 495 32 03 62","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.539613"},"fr":{"name":"Visite guid\u00e9e Bruxelles 14-18","shortdescr":"Visite guid\u00e9e : vivre Bruxelles en 14-18. La ville de Bruxelles a eu une importance capitale durant celle que l\u2019on a appel\u00e9 la Grande guerre. Avec la visite guid\u00e9e Bruxelles 14-18, d\u00e9couvrons \u00e0 quel niveau.","longdescr":"La capitale actuelle de l\u2019Europe fut le quartier g\u00e9n\u00e9ral des allemands durant la Premi\u00e8re Guerre Mondiale et ce ne fut pas sans cons\u00e9quence. Par cette visite, nous apprendrons notamment l\u2019importance de certains b\u00e2timents lorsque les allemands occupaient notre ville : notons notamment l\u2019h\u00f4tel de ville o\u00f9 \u00e9tait le QG de l\u2019\u00e9tat-major ou le palais royal qui servait d\u2019h\u00f4pital. Informations pratiques : Prix : 200 \u20ac (visite guid\u00e9e de 3 heures \u2013 jusqu\u2019\u00e0 10 personnes). 250 \u20ac (visite guid\u00e9e de 3 heures \u2013 jusqu\u2019\u00e0 25 personnes). 250 \u20ac (visite guid\u00e9e de 6 heures \u2013 jusqu\u2019\u00e0 10 personnes). 320 \u20ac (visite guid\u00e9e de 6 heures \u2013 jusqu\u2019\u00e0 25 personnes). Quand : Tous les jours. Heures de d\u00e9part : \u00c0 vous de choisir. Point de rencontre : \u00c0 vous de choisir : \u00e0 la Grand-Place de Bruxelles, \u00e0 la Colonne du Congr\u00e8s, \u00e0 votre h\u00f4tel (tant que celui-ci est situ\u00e9 dans le centre de Bruxelles) ou \u00e0 l\u2019endroit de votre choix au centre-ville de Bruxelles. Dur\u00e9e : 3 heures ou 6 heures. Langue : Fran\u00e7ais. Inclus : Guide professionnel francophone. Visite priv\u00e9e et personnalis\u00e9e. Circuits d\u00e9finis selon vos besoins. Non inclus : Transport, entr\u00e9es aux mus\u00e9es, repas, boissons, \u2026 Leur prix sera ajout\u00e9 au montant initial de la facture. R\u00e9servez l\u2019une de nos formules ci-dessus ou envoyez-nous un message pour r\u00e9server un de nos guides priv\u00e9s, obtenir de plus amples informations ou recevoir une offre personnalis\u00e9e.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.bravodiscovery.com","email":"info@bravodiscovery.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 495 32 03 62","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.539613"},"sp":{"name":"Visite guid\u00e9e Bruxelles 14-18","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.bravodiscovery.com","email":"info@bravodiscovery.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 495 32 03 62","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.539613"},"nl":{"name":"Visite guid\u00e9e Bruxelles 14-18","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.bravodiscovery.com","email":"info@bravodiscovery.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 495 32 03 62","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.539613"}},"place":{"id":258936,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Bravo Discovery sprl","address_street_name":"Rue du Midi 76 ","address_street_number":"76","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@bravodiscovery.com","website":"http:\/\/www.bravodiscovery.com","phone_contact":"+32 470 60 35 05","phone_booking":"+32 495 32 03 62","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Midi 76 , 76","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Bravo Discovery sprl","address_street_name":"Rue du Midi 76 ","address_street_number":"76","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@bravodiscovery.com","website":"http:\/\/www.bravodiscovery.com","phone_contact":"+32 470 60 35 05","phone_booking":"+32 495 32 03 62","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Midi 76 , 76","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Bravo Discovery sprl","address_street_name":"Rue du Midi 76 ","address_street_number":"76","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@bravodiscovery.com","website":"http:\/\/www.bravodiscovery.com","phone_contact":"+32 470 60 35 05","phone_booking":"+32 495 32 03 62","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Midi 76 , 76","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Bravo Discovery offers you a quality tour guide service anywhere in Belgium.\r\nWe work in conjunction with the Brussels tourism office. We practice responsible tourism while respecting the local economy. Our employees are professional guides and we have a team of freelance guides trained in the \u201cHaute \u00c9coles\u201d of Brussels.\r\n\u200bWe work in partnership with local businesses and can call on a range of quality service providers to suit your needs.\r\nWe specialize in providing tailor-made tours, based on the interests of our clients and mindful of the need to balance culture and relaxation.\r\n\u200bOur strengths: experience, local guides, enthusiastic and charismatic staff.\r\nOur values: responsible tourism, professionalism, respect of the historical and cultural heritage, protection of the environment, sustainable competitiveness.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Bravo Discovery sprl","address_street_name":"Rue du Midi 76 ","address_street_number":"76","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@bravodiscovery.com","website":"http:\/\/www.bravodiscovery.c