ivate tour. Tours defined according to your needs. Can be included: transport, museum admissions, meals, drinks\u2026 Not included: Transport, museums tickets and tastings","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.bravodiscovery.com","email":"info@bravodiscovery.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 495 32 03 62","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.539558"},"it":{"name":"Visite priv\u00e9e Art Nouveau et Art D\u00e9co \u00e0 Bruxelles","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.bravodiscovery.com","email":"info@bravodiscovery.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 495 32 03 62","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.539558"},"cn":{"name":"Visite priv\u00e9e Art Nouveau et Art D\u00e9co \u00e0 Bruxelles","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.bravodiscovery.com","email":"info@bravodiscovery.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 495 32 03 62","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.539558"},"fr":{"name":"Visite priv\u00e9e Art Nouveau et Art D\u00e9co \u00e0 Bruxelles","shortdescr":"Visite guid\u00e9e Art Nouveau et Art D\u00e9co \u00e0 Bruxelles. Tour guid\u00e9e par un expert de l\u2019architecture Art Nouveau et Art D\u00e9co \u00e0 Bruxelles.","longdescr":"Durant cette tour priv\u00e9e Art Nouveau et Art D\u00e9co \u00e0 Bruxelles, explorons les trois quartiers qui pr\u00e9sentent la plus grande concentration de b\u00e2timents Art Nouveau dans la capitale : l\u2019avenue Louise, le quartier Bailli et les \u00e9tangs d\u2019Ixelles avec la place Flagey. Informations pratiques: Prix: 170 \u20ac (visite priv\u00e9e de 3 heures \u2013 jusqu\u2019\u00e0 10 personnes). 220 \u20ac (visite priv\u00e9e de 3 heures \u2013 jusqu\u2019\u00e0 25 personnes). 220 \u20ac (visite priv\u00e9e de 6 heures \u2013 jusqu\u2019\u00e0 10 personnes). 320 \u20ac (visite priv\u00e9e de 6 heures \u2013 jusqu\u2019\u00e0 25 personnes). Quand: Tous les jours. Heures de d\u00e9part: \u00c0 vous de choisir. Point de rencontre: \u00c0 vous de choisir : \u00e0 la Grand-Place de Bruxelles, \u00e0 votre h\u00f4tel (tant que celui-ci est situ\u00e9 dans le centre de Bruxelles) ou \u00e0 l\u2019endroit de votre choix au centre-ville de Bruxelles. Dur\u00e9e: 3 heures ou 6 heures Langue: Fran\u00e7ais Inclus: Guide francophone. Visite priv\u00e9e et personnalis\u00e9e. Circuits d\u00e9finis selon vos besoins. Peuvent \u00eatre inclus: transport, entr\u00e9es aux mus\u00e9es, repas, boissons, \u2026 Non inclus: Les transports, entr\u00e9es aux mus\u00e9es et d\u00e9gustations (nourriture et boissons) ne sont pas compris dans le prix initial","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.bravodiscovery.com","email":"info@bravodiscovery.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 495 32 03 62","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.539558"},"sp":{"name":"Visite priv\u00e9e Art Nouveau et Art D\u00e9co \u00e0 Bruxelles","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.bravodiscovery.com","email":"info@bravodiscovery.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 495 32 03 62","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.539558"},"nl":{"name":"Visite priv\u00e9e Art Nouveau et Art D\u00e9co \u00e0 Bruxelles","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.bravodiscovery.com","email":"info@bravodiscovery.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 495 32 03 62","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.539558"}},"place":{"id":258936,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Bravo Discovery sprl","address_street_name":"Rue du Midi 76 ","address_street_number":"76","address_street_box":null,"email":