,"is_high_capacity":false,"is_not_major_event":false,"backoffice_id":224860,"facebook_link":null,"import_origin":null,"is_part_of":null,"sub_type":"expo","ranking":0.11833346326288821,"languages":{"spoken":["en","nl","fr","de"],"subtitles":[]},"categories":{"main":{"id":23,"translations":{"de":"Ausstellung","pt":null,"en":"Exhibition","it":"Esposizioni","cn":null,"fr":"Exposition","sp":"Exhibici\u00f3n","nl":"Tentoonstellingen"}},"others":{"list":[43,36],"translations":{"de":["Dekorative K\u00fcnste","Museen & Kunstzentren"],"pt":[null,null],"en":["Decorative art","Museums and art centers"],"it":["Arti decorative","Musei e centri artistici"],"cn":[null,null],"fr":["Arts D\u00e9coratifs","Mus\u00e9es et art centers"],"sp":["Artes decorativas","Museos y centros de arte"],"nl":["Decoratieve kunsten","Musea en kunstcentra"]}}},"translations":{"de":{"name":"KBR museum","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.kbr.be\/fr\/museum","email":"info@kbr.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 519 53 11","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.504860"},"pt":{"name":"KBR museum","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.kbr.be\/fr\/museum","email":"info@kbr.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 519 53 11","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.504860"},"en":{"name":"KBR museum","shortdescr":"Belgium has been hiding a treasure for 600 years: the manuscripts of the Dukes of Burgundy. Come discover these fabulous masterpieces rescued from time at the KBR museum.","longdescr":"Six centuries ago, Brussels belonged to the rich and powerful Dukes of Burgundy. Skilled politicians and cultured patrons, they established a stirring treasure, a unique and fascinating collection of manuscripts: the Library of the Dukes of Burgundy. These masterpieces, which have survived the ravages of time and history, have been looked aft er by KBR and can now be admired at the KBR museum. Explore Europe\u2019s medieval cultural past and then admire the magnificent illuminated manuscripts from the ducal library. Although manuscripts form the heart of the museum, the KBR museum is much more than just looking at books. There is also a lot to experience!","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.kbr.be\/en\/museum","email":"info@kbr.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 519 53 11","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.504860"},"it":{"name":"KBR museum","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.kbr.be\/fr\/museum","email":"info@kbr.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 519 53 11","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.504860"},"cn":{"name":"KBR museum","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.kbr.be\/fr\/museum","email":"info@kbr.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 519 53 11","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.504860"},"fr":{"name":"KBR museum","shortdescr":"La Belgique cache un tr\u00e9sor depuis 600 ans : la Librairie des ducs de Bourgogne. Venez d\u00e9couvrir ces fabuleux chefs d\u2019\u0153uvre rescap\u00e9s du temps au nouveau KBR museum.","longdescr":"Il y a six si\u00e8cles, Bruxelles appartenait aux souverains les plus riches et les plus puissants d\u2019Europe : les ducs de Bourgogne. Fins politiques et m\u00e9c\u00e8nes cultiv\u00e9s, ils se sont constitu\u00e9 un \u00e9mouvant tr\u00e9sor : la Librairie, une collection pr\u00e9cieuse et unique de manuscrits. Ces chefs-d\u2019oeuvre, rescap\u00e9s des outrages du temps et de l\u2019Histoire, KBR les prot\u00e8ge pour vous et sont dor\u00e9navant accessibles au KBR museum. Cet endroit unique vous permet de d\u00e9couvrir le pass\u00e9 culturel du Moyen \u00c2ge en Europe puis de p\u00e9n\u00e9trer dans le Saint des saints et d\u2019y admirer les splendides manuscrits enlumin\u00e9s de la Librairie des ducs. En plus de cette d\u00e9couverte unique, le KBR museum vous propose une exp\u00e9rience immersive dans la vie culturelle du XVe si\u00e8cle, la sollicitation de tous vos sens et un voyage dans le temps de mani\u00e8re originale et interactive.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.kbr.be\/fr\/museum","email":"info@kbr.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 519 53 11","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.504860"},"sp":{"name":"KBR museum","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.kbr.be\/fr\/museum","email":"info@kbr.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 519 53 11","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.504860"},"nl":{"name":"KBR museum","shortdescr":"Belgi\u00eb verbergt al 600 jaar een schat: de Librije van de Bourgondische hertogen. Kom deze unieke verzameling handschriften nu ontdekken in het KBR museum.","longdescr":"Zeshonderd jaar geleden regeerden de hertogen van Bourgondi\u00eb over Brussel. Deze rijke en machtige vorsten en gecultiveerde mecenassen stelden een schat samen die ook vandaag nog weet te boeien: de Librije, een unieke en kostbare verzameling verluchte handschriften. Heel wat van deze meesterwerken wisten de tand des tijds te doorstaan en kunt u vandaag bewonderen in het KBR museum. Verken het middeleeuwse culturele verleden van Europa en bewonder dan de prachtige verluchte handschriften uit de hertogelijke bibliotheek. Hoewel handschriften het hart van het museum vormen, is het KBR museum veel meer dan kijken naar boeken. Er valt immers ook heel wat te beleven!","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.kbr.be\/nl\/museum","email":"info@kbr.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 519 53 11","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.504860"}},"place":{"id":981,"translations":{"de":{"name":"KBR museum","address_street_name":"Mont des Arts","address_street_number":"28","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@kbr.be","website":"http:\/\/www.kbr.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 519 53 11","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Mont des Arts, 28","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"KBR museum","address_street_name":"Mont des Arts","address_street_number":"28","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@kbr.be","website":"http:\/\/www.kbr.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 519 53 11","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Mont des Arts, 28","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"KBR museum","address_street_name":"Mont des Arts","address_street_number":"28","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@kbr.be","website":"http:\/\/www.kbr.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 519 53 11","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Mont des Arts, 28","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Six centuries ago, Brussels belonged to the rich and powerful Dukes of Burgundy. Skilled politicians and cultured patrons, they established a stirring treasure, a unique and fascinating collection of manuscripts: the Library of the Dukes of Burgundy.\r\nThese masterpieces, which have survived the ravages of time and history, have been looked aft er by KBR and can now be admired at the KBR museum. Explore Europe\u2019s medieval cultural past and then admire the magnificent illuminated manuscripts from the ducal library.\r\nAlthough manuscripts form the heart of the museum, the KBR museum is much more than just looking at books. There is also a lot to experience!\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"KBR museum","address_street_name":"Mont des Arts","address_street_number":"28","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@kbr.be","website":"http:\/\/www.kbr.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 519 53 11","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Mont des Arts, 28","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"KBR museum","address_street_name":"Mont des Arts","address_street_number":"28","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@kbr.be","website":"http:\/\/www.kbr.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 519 53 11","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Mont des Arts, 28","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"fr":{"name":"KBR museum","address_street_name":"Mont des Arts","address_street_number":"28","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@kbr.be","website":"http:\/\/www.kbr.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 519 53 11","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Mont des Arts, 28","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Il y a six si\u00e8cles, Bruxelles appartenait aux souverains les plus riches et les plus puissants d\u2019Europe : les ducs de Bourgogne. Fins politiques et m\u00e9c\u00e8nes cultiv\u00e9s, ils se sont constitu\u00e9 un \u00e9mouvant tr\u00e9sor : la Librairie, une collection pr\u00e9cieuse et unique de manuscrits.\r\nCes chefs-d\u2019oeuvre, rescap\u00e9s des outrages du temps et de l\u2019Histoire, KBR les prot\u00e8ge pour vous et sont dor\u00e9navant accessibles au KBR museum. Cet endroit unique vous permet de d\u00e9couvrir le pass\u00e9 culturel du Moyen \u00c2ge en Europe puis de p\u00e9n\u00e9trer dans le Saint des saints et d\u2019y admirer les splendides manuscrits enlumin\u00e9s de la Librairie des ducs.\r\nEn plus de cette d\u00e9couverte unique, le KBR museum vous propose une exp\u00e9rience immersive dans la vie culturelle du XVe si\u00e8cle, la sollicitation de tous vos sens et un voyage dans le temps de mani\u00e8re originale et interactive.\r\n\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"KBR museum","address_street_name":"Mont des Arts","address_street_number":"28","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@kbr.be","website":"http:\/\/www.kbr.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 519 53 11","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Mont des Arts, 28","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"KBR museum","address_street_name":"Kunstberg ","address_street_number":"28","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@kbr.be","website":"http:\/\/www.kbr.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 519 53 11","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Kunstberg , 28","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Zeshonderd jaar geleden regeerden de hertogen van Bourgondi\u00eb over Brussel. Deze rijke en machtige vorsten en gecultiveerde mecenassen stelden een schat samen die ook vandaag nog weet te boeien: de Librije, een unieke en kostbare verzameling verluchte handschriften.\r\nHeel wat van deze meesterwerken wisten de tand des tijds te doorstaan en kunt u vandaag bewonderen in het KBR museum. Verken het middeleeuwse culturele verleden van Europa en bewonder dan de prachtige verluchte handschriften uit de hertogelijke bibliotheek.\r\nHoewel handschriften het hart van het museum vormen, is het KBR museum veel meer dan kijken naar boeken. Er valt immers ook heel wat te beleven!\r\n\r\n","descr