:null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/weinsistboutique","email":"weinsistbrussels@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 479 60 19 16","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50002911"},"pt":{"name":"The Marolles reflected","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/weinsistboutique","email":"weinsistbrussels@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 479 60 19 16","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50002911"},"en":{"name":"The Marolles reflected","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Danny Juchtmans likes to wander around cities and over the years he developed a very unique way to look at them.\nLike a mirror, his photographic gesture refers to urban behavior and the effects they produce. Although people are barely visible in the images, you can always recognize some human presence. Photography itself, seen literally as a reflection, is a major theme in his work. Just like in a mirror, the multiplication of faces or places in their daily or impersonal banality reflects the stratification that goes with city life. Danny Juchtmans' work as a graphic designer and illustrator has been shown in various places but he shows his photos less frequently.  Now there is the opportunity at We Insist in the heart of the Marolles.","performers":"Danny Juchtmans - Photographer","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/weinsistboutique","email":"weinsistbrussels@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 479 60 19 16","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50002911"},"it":{"name":"The Marolles reflected","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/weinsistboutique","email":"weinsistbrussels@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 479 60 19 16","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50002911"},"cn":{"name":"The Marolles reflected","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/weinsistboutique","email":"weinsistbrussels@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 479 60 19 16","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50002911"},"fr":{"name":"R\u00e9flexions des Marolles","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Danny Juchtmans aime promener son regard singulier dans les villes qu\u2019il parcourt. A la mani\u00e8re d\u2019un miroir, son geste photographique renvoie aux comportements urbains et aux effets qu\u2019ils produisent. Si les personnes sont \u00e0 peine visibles sur les images, la pr\u00e9sence humaine est toujours palpable. La photographie elle-m\u00eame, envisag\u00e9e litt\u00e9ralement comme reflet, est un th\u00e8me majeur de son travail. La multiplication sp\u00e9culaire des visages ou des lieux dans leur banalit\u00e9 quotidienne ou impersonnelle refl\u00e8te la stratification inh\u00e9rente \u00e0 la vie en ville.\nLe regard de Danny Juchtmans, tout en subtillit\u00e9, aborde la ville, ceux qui la parcourent et les choses qui la jonchent en saisissant leur \u00e9ph\u00e9m\u00e8re reflet l\u00e0 o\u00f9 il se d\u00e9pose fugacement\u2026\nSi le travail de graphiste et d\u2019illustrateur de Danny Juchtmans circule tr\u00e8s fr\u00e9quemment, il montre plus rarement ses photos. Il y a d\u00e9sormais une opportunit\u00e9 chez We Insist au coeur des Marolles.","performers":"Danny Juchtmans - Fotographe","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/weinsistboutique","email":"weinsistbrussels@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 479 60 19 16","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50002911"},"sp":{"name":"The Marolles reflected","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/weinsistboutique","email":"weinsistbrussels@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 479 60 19 16","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50002911"},"nl":{"name":"De Marollen weerspiegeld","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Danny Juchtmans dwaalt graag door steden en door de jaren heen ontwikkelde hij een heel unieke manier om ernaar te kijken. In zekere zin houdt hij een spiegel voor en confronteert de mens met zijn gewoontes en handelingen. Alledaagse resultaten daarvan in de ons omringende omgeving legt hij vast. Personen zijn haast niet zichtbaar op de beelden, maar menselijke aanwezigheid is voelbaar.  Reflecteren over het menselijk gedrag zit vervat in de foto\u2019s en ook de gevolgen van handelingen zijn waarneembaar. Letterlijke reflecties in ramen vormen een onderdeel binnen de foto\u2019s. Deze verstilde veelgezichten weerspiegelen een gelaagdheid die eigen is aan het stadsleven. Straten en steden zijn een inspiratiebron. Plaatsen waar mensen achteloos voorbijlopen omdat ze oninteressant lijken, daar probeert hij schoonheid in te zien. Compositie en kleur of de afwezigheid ervan, zijn bepalend voor de artistieke kwaliteit van het beeld. Danny Juchtmans is grafisch ontwerper en illustrator. Zijn foto\u2019s werden nog niet vaak getoond. Maak van de gelegenheid gebruik bij We Insist in het hart van de Marollen om zijn werk te ontdekken.","performers":"Danny Juchtmans - Fotograaf","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/weinsistboutique","email":"weinsistbrussels@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 479 60 19 16","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50002911"}},"place":{"id":50000623,"translations":{"de":{"name":"We Insist boutique","address_street_name":"Rue Haute","address_street_number":"306","address_street_box":null,"email":"weinsistbrussels@gmail.com","website":"htt