adjam, Roy K\u00f6hnke, Garush Melkonyan, Lewi Moore, Valentin Ranger, Jacob Schoolmeesters, Julia Tarissan\n","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/pilar.brussels\/nl\/events\/another-land","email":"Pilar@vub.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 629 23 29","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50002355"},"it":{"name":"Another Land","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/pilar.brussels\/nl\/events\/another-land","email":"Pilar@vub.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 629 23 29","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50002355"},"cn":{"name":"Another Land","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/pilar.brussels\/nl\/events\/another-land","email":"Pilar@vub.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 629 23 29","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50002355"},"fr":{"name":"Another Land","shortdescr":"Une exposition collective organis\u00e9e par Carlota de Torregrosa en collaboration avec les artistes participants.","longdescr":"Another Land nous emm\u00e8ne dans une exploration d'une r\u00e9alit\u00e9 uchronique, dans le sillage de la violence actuelle, des blessures du pass\u00e9 et des inqui\u00e9tudes pour l'avenir. Des artistes s\u00e9lectionn\u00e9s ont collabor\u00e9 \u00e0 la cr\u00e9ation de cet univers \"final\", entre r\u00e9alit\u00e9 et fiction. \u00c0 travers un texte de science-fiction, des sculptures, des vid\u00e9os et des installations sonores, des dialogues significatifs s'engagent, devenant une passerelle vers la contemplation collective, plongeant dans les complexit\u00e9s de l'existence humaine, les paysages politiques, le point de rencontre entre l'ornementalisme et l'architecture, et les aspects intimes de nos vies.","performers":"Tristan Br\u00fcndler, Omar Castillo Alfaro, Paola Siri Renard, Astrid Vandercamere, Megan Bruinen, Ivan Cheng, Carolina D\u00e9odat, Gaadjika, Luca Hadjam, Roy K\u00f6hnke, Garush Melkonyan, Lewi Moore, Valentin Ranger, Jacob Schoolmeesters, Julia Tarissan\n","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/pilar.brussels\/nl\/events\/another-land","email":"Pilar@vub.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 629 23 29","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50002355"},"sp":{"name":"Another Land","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/pilar.brussels\/nl\/events\/another-land","email":"Pilar@vub.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 629 23 29","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50002355"},"nl":{"name":"Another Land","shortdescr":"Een groepstentoonstelling samengesteld door Carlota de Torregrosa in nauwe samenwerking met de deelnemende kunstenaars.","longdescr":"Another Land neemt ons mee op een verkenningstocht naar een uchronische realiteit, in de nasleep van het huidige geweld, wonden uit het verleden en zorgen om de toekomst. Geselecteerde kunstenaars werkten samen aan de creatie van dit \"definitieve\" universum dat het midden houdt tussen realiteit en fictie. Door middel van een sciencefiction tekst, sculpturen, video- en geluidsinstallaties, gaan ze zinvolle dialogen aan die een poort worden naar collectieve contemplatie, waarbij ze zich verdiepen in de complexiteit van het menselijk bestaan, politieke landschappen, het ontmoetingspunt tussen ornamentiek en architectuur, en de intieme aspecten van ons leven.","performers":"Tristan Br\u00fcndler, Omar Castillo Alfaro, Paola Siri Renard, Astrid Vandercamere, Megan Bruinen, Ivan Cheng, Carolina D\u00e9odat, Gaadjika, Luca Hadjam, Roy K\u00f6hnke, Garush Melkonyan, Lewi Moore, Valentin Ranger, Jacob Schoolmeesters, Julia Tarissan\n\n","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/pilar.brussels\/nl\/events\/another-land","email":"Pilar@vub.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 629 23 29","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50002355"}},"place":{"id":273547,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Pilar ","address_street_name":"Triomflaan, VUB  Ingang 6","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"pilar@vub.be","website":"https:\/\/pilar.brussels\/en","phone_contact":"+32 2 629 23 25","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Triomflaan, VUB  Ingang 6","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Pilar ","address_street_name":"Triomflaan, VUB  Ingang 6","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"pilar@vub.be","website":"https:\/\/pilar.brussels\/en","phone_contact":"+32 2 629 23 25","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Triomflaan, VUB  Ingang 6","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Pilar","address_street_name":"Triomflaan, VUB  Ingang 6","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"pilar@vub.be","website":"https:\/\/pilar.brussels\/en","phone_contact":"+32 2 629 23 25","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Triomflaan, VUB  Ingang 6","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"The legendary Kultuurkaffee opened in 1981 and was a place of encounters and discoveries for generations of students until it was demolished in 2015 to make way for a new cultural site. For four and a half years Kultuurkaffee has been operating as a nomadic cultural organization, collaborating with various venues in the capital. Now they are back on the VUB campus, but under a new name: Pilar. Pilar is an open, artistic laboratory in Brussels, a pillar of support for and by young people, a place for cross-fertilisation between art, science and entrepreneurship. Pilar's new space includes a concert and event hall, exhibition areas and a sustainable caf\u00e9 capable of hosting events.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Pilar ","address_street_name":"Triomflaan, VUB  Ingang 6","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"pilar@vub.be","website":"https:\/\/pilar.brussels\/en","phone_contact":"+32 2 629 23 25","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Triomflaan, VUB  Ingang 6","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"Pilar ","address_street_name":"Triomflaan, VUB  Ingang 6","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"pilar@vub.be","website":"https:\/\/pilar.brussels\/en","phone_contact":"+32 2 629 23 25","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Triomflaan, VUB  Ingang 6","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"fr":{"name":"Pilar ","address_street_name":"Triomflaan, VUB  Ingang 6","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"pilar@vub.be","website":"https:\/\/pilar.brussels\/en","phone_contact":"+32 2 629 23 25","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Triomflaan, VUB  Ingang 6","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"Le l\u00e9gendaire Kultuurkaffee, ouvert en 1981, et lieu de rencontres et d\u00e9couvertes pour plusieurs g\u00e9n\u00e9rations d'\u00e9tudiants, a \u00e9t\u00e9 d\u00e9molie au cours de 2015 pour faire place \u00e0 un nouveau lieu culturel. Depuis, Kultuurkaffee a fonctionn\u00e9 comme organisation culturelle nomade dans divers endroits de la capitale.  Apr\u00e8s 4,5 ans d'errance KultuurKaffee est maintenant de retour sur le campus de la VUB \u00e0 Etterbeek, mais sous un nouveau nom : Pilar. Pilar sera un laboratoire ouvert et artistique \u00e0 Bruxelles, un pilier de soutien pour et par les jeunes. \r\nLes nouvelles salles de Pilar comprennent une salle de concert et d'\u00e9v\u00e9nements, et des zones d'exposition, ainsi qu'un caf\u00e9 durable riche en \u00e9v\u00e9nements. ","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Pilar ","address_street_name":"Triomflaan, VUB  Ingang 6","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"pilar@vub.be","website":"https:\/\/pilar.brussels\/en","phone_contact":"+32 2 629 23 25","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Triomflaan, VUB  Ingang 6","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Pilar ","address_street_name":"Triomflaan, VUB  Ingang 6","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"pilar@vub.be","website":"https:\/\/pilar.brussels\/nl","phone_contact":"+32 2 629 23 25","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Triomflaan, VUB  Ingang 6","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"Sinds de opening in 1981 stond KultuurKaffee gekend als de ontmoetingsplek voor vele generaties studenten, een waar begrip in het Brusselse cultuurleven. In 2015 werd KultuurKaffee afgebroken en startten de bouwwerken van een nieuwe cultuurtoren. Deze zijn nu klaar. Daarmee landt KultuurKaffee na 4,5 jaar omzwervingen als nomadische kunstenorganisatie in Brussel terug op de VUB-campus in Etterbeek, maar wel onder een nieuwe naam: Pilar. Pilar is een open, artistiek laboratorium in Brussel. Een steunzuil voor en door jongeren. Een huis waarin de kruisbestuiving tussen kunst en wetenschap en ook cultureel ondernemerschap een plaats krijgt. \r\n\r\nDe focus van Pilars werking is tweeledig. Enerzijds blijft Pilar een presentatieplek waar ontluikende en vernieuwende kunstenaars, maar ook gevestigde waarden een podium krijgen. Nog meer dan vroeger komen daarbij verschillende disciplines aan bod en zoekt de werking de grenzen tussen deze disciplines op. Anderzijds werkt Pilar laagdrempelige formats uit om jongeren in alle aspecten van de werking te betrekken en toekomstdenkers en -doeners met ondernemende ambities te ondersteunen.\r\n\r\nDe nieuwe vertrekken van Pilar omvatten onder meer een concert\/eventzaal en exporuimtes en zal ook een duurzame caf\u00e9werking en evenementrijk eetcaf\u00e9 omvatten. \r\n\r\n\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null}},"districts":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"zones":{"list":[22],"translations":{"de":["Osten"],"pt":[null],"en":["East"],"it":["Est"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Est"],"sp":["Este"],"nl":["Oost"]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":33547,"location":{"lat":50.84720202,"lon":4.38749088},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2021-11-10T13:58:24+01:00","published_at":"2019-05-21T16:26:47+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":273547,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Pilar ","address_street_name":"Triomflaan, VUB  Ingang 6","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"pilar@vub.be","website":"https:\/\/pilar.brussels\/en","phone_contact":"+32 2 629 23 25","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Triomflaan, VUB  Ingang 6","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Pilar ","address_street_name":"Triomflaan, VUB  Ingang 6","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"pilar@vub.be","website":"https:\/\/pilar.brussels\/en","phone_conta