,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lejardindemasoeur.be","email":"info@lejardindemasoeur.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 65 82","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 65 82","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.559299"},"pt":{"name":"Les Brouillons Intimes d'Alexis van Stratum","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lejardindemasoeur.be","email":"info@lejardindemasoeur.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 65 82","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 65 82","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.559299"},"en":{"name":"Les Brouillons Intimes d'Alexis van Stratum","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lejardindemasoeur.be","email":"info@lejardindemasoeur.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 65 82","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 65 82","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.559299"},"it":{"name":"Les Brouillons Intimes d'Alexis van Stratum","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lejardindemasoeur.be","email":"info@lejardindemasoeur.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 65 82","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 65 82","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.559299"},"cn":{"name":"Les Brouillons Intimes d'Alexis van Stratum","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lejardindemasoeur.be","email":"info@lejardindemasoeur.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 65 82","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 65 82","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.559299"},"fr":{"name":"Les Brouillons Intimes d'Alexis van Stratum","shortdescr":"Gilles a du mal avec les filles. D\u00e8s qu\u2019une femme lui pla\u00eet, il s\u2019emp\u00eatre dans sa timidit\u00e9 et devient son confident. R\u00e9sultat des courses : il n\u2019a toujours pas connu l\u2019amour. Il r\u00eave de devenir \u00e9crivain et s\u2019inscrit \u00e0 un atelier d\u2019\u00e9criture. Il y rencontre Camille et tombe amoureux d\u2019elle\u2026","longdescr":"Gilles r\u00eave de devenir \u00e9crivain et s\u2019inscrit \u00e0 un atelier d\u2019\u00e9criture. Il y fait la connaissance de Camille. \u00c0 travers leurs \u00e9crits, ces deux \u00e2mes bless\u00e9es vont se r\u00e9v\u00e9ler, se rapprocher malgr\u00e9 leurs diff\u00e9rences.\r\nJouant avec les codes de la com\u00e9die romantique, le spectacle met en sc\u00e8ne de fa\u00e7on ludique, entre humour et sensibilit\u00e9, la solitude de deux jeunes personnages en qu\u00eate d'amour et de cr\u00e9ativit\u00e9 litt\u00e9raire. Cette belle histoire est racont\u00e9e par deux jeunes acteurs sensibles, touchants et dr\u00f4les...","performers":"Estelle Cr\u00e9pin (interpr\u00e9tation); Tom Boumeridja (interpr\u00e9tation); Alexis van Stratum (mise en sc\u00e8ne)","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lejardindemasoeur.be","email":"info@lejardindemasoeur.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 65 82","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 65 82","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.559299"},"sp":{"name":"Les Brouillons Intimes d'Alexis van Stratum","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lejardindemasoeur.be","email":"info@lejardindemasoeur.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 65 82","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 65 82","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.559299"},"nl":{"name":"Les Brouillons Intimes d'Alexis van Stratum","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lejardindemasoeur.be","email":"info@lejardindemasoeur.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 65 82","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 65 82","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.559299"}},"place":{"id":220283,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Le Jardin de ma Soeur","address_street_name":"A l'angle du quai au Bois \u00e0 Br\u00fbler et de la rue du Grand Hospice","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lejardindemasoeur.be","website":"http:\/\/www.lejardindemasoeur.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 65 82","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 65 82","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"A l'angle du quai au Bois \u00e0 Br\u00fbler et de la rue du Grand Hospice","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Dieses malerische Caf\u00e9-Theater, das 1994 in der N\u00e4he des alten \"Grand B\u00e9guinage de Bruxelles\" er\u00f6ffnet wurde, \u00fcberrascht durch seine \u00fcberaus kleinen R\u00e4umlichkeiten. Doch daf\u00fcr ist das Programm ist umso \"gr\u00f6\u00dfer\". Reservierung empfohlen!","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Le Jardin de ma Soeur","address_street_name":"A l'angle du quai au Bois \u00e0 Br\u00fbler et de la rue du Grand Hospice","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lejardindemasoeur.be","website":"http:\/\/www.lejardindemasoeur.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 65 82","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 65 82","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"A l'angle du quai au Bois \u00e0 Br\u00fbler et de la rue du Grand Hospice","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Le Jardin de ma Soeur","address_street_name":"A l'angle du quai au Bois \u00e0 Br\u00fbler et de la rue du Grand Hospice","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lejardindemasoeur.be","website":"http:\/\/www.lejardindemasoeur.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 65 82","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 65 82","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"A l'angle du quai au Bois \u00e0 Br\u00fbler et de la rue du Grand Hospice","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"The desire to present theater amongst people; as if a performance is nothing but a conversation, in a place somewhere in between the large halls and the streets, half living room, half pub, in a warm ambiance where one can sip a glass while watching a performance. That's cafe-theater \"Le Jardin de ma Soeur\", at the edge of the ancient \"Grand B\u00e9guinage de Bruxelles\", alongside one of the quays of the old port of Brussels where the spirit of the dock workers lingers and where one can still feel the presence of the beguines with their long black robes.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Le Jardin de ma Soeur","address_street_name":"A l'angle du quai au Bois \u00e0 Br\u00fbler et de la rue du Grand Hospice","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lejardindemasoeur.be","website":"http:\/\/www.lejardindemasoeur.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 65 82","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 65 82","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"A l'angle du quai au Bois \u00e0 Br\u00fbler et de la rue du Grand Hospice","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"Le Jardin de ma Soeur","address_street_name":"A l'angle du quai au Bois \u00e0 Br\u00fbler et de la rue du Grand Hospice","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lejardindemasoeur.be","website":"http:\/\/www.lejardindemasoeur.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 65 82","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 65 82","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"A l'angle du quai au Bois \u00e0 Br\u00fbler et de la rue du Grand Hospice","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"fr":{"name":"Le Jardin de ma Soeur","address_street_name":"A l'angle du quai au Bois \u00e0 Br\u00fbler et de la rue du Grand Hospice","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lejardindemasoeur.be","website":"http:\/\/www.lejardindemasoeur.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 65 82","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 65 82","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"A l'angle du quai au Bois \u00e0 Br\u00fbler et de la rue du Grand Hospice","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Le Jardin de ma S\u0153ur est situ\u00e9 au coin d'une rue du pittoresque March\u00e9 aux poissons, \u00e0 proximit\u00e9 de l\u2019ancien Grand B\u00e9guinage de Bruxelles. On peut difficilement imaginer un nom plus familier. Pourtant, cet endroit n'a pas vol\u00e9 son nom. Vous obtenez exactement ce que vous attendez : une soir\u00e9e sans pr\u00e9tention, pleine de divertissements et de moments partag\u00e9s. Vous vous y sentez comme dans votre salon. Vous oubliez imm\u00e9diatement tous vos soucis et riez, chantez et profitez du spectacle avec les autres participants. Sp\u00e9cialement pour les amateurs de chanson fran\u00e7aise et de th\u00e9\u00e2tre.  \u202f \r\nPensez \u00e0 r\u00e9server votre place !\r\n ","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Le Jardin de ma Soeur","address_street_name":"A l'angle du quai au Bois \u00e0 Br\u00fbler et de la rue du Grand Hospice","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lejardindemasoeur.be","website":"http:\/\/www.lejardindemasoeur.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 65 82","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 65 82","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"A l'angle du quai au Bois \u00e0 Br\u00fbler et de la rue du Grand Hospice","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Le Jardin de ma Soeur","address_street_name":"Op de hoek van de Brandhoutkaai en de Grootgodshuisstraat","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lejardindemasoeur.be","website":"http:\/\/www.lejardindemasoeur.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 65 82","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 65 82","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Op de hoek van de Brandhoutkaai en de Grootgodshuisstraat","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Op een straathoek aan de pittoreske Vismarkt ligt Le Jardin de ma Soeur. Een familialere naam kan je haast niet bedenken. Toch heeft deze plek haar naam niet gestolen. Je krijgt exact wat je er zou verwachten: een pretentieloze avond vol vertier en gedeelde momenten. Hier waan je je in een gezellige en veilige woonkamer. Je vergeet er meteen al je zorgen en lacht, zingt en geniet met de andere aanwezigen. Vooral voor liefhebbers van het Franse chanson en verhaaltheater.    \u202f\u202f\u202f ","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null}},"districts":{"list":[3],"translations":{"de":["Dansaert\/Sainte-Catherine"],"pt":[null],"en":["Dansaert\/Sainte-Catherine"],"it":["Dansaert\/Sainte-Catherine"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Dansaert\/Sainte-Catherine"],"sp":["Dansaert\/Sainte-Catherine"],"nl":["Dansaertwijk\/Sint-Katelijne"]}},"zones":{"list":[21],"translations":{"de":["S\u00fcden"],"pt":[null],"en":["South"],"it":["Sud"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Sud"],"sp":["Sur"],"nl":["Zuid"]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":"terassequai","backoffice_id":596,"location":{"lat":50.80137189,"lon":4.42050369},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2023-09-21T15:24:01+02:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:13:39+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":220283,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Le Jardin de ma Soeur","address_street_name":"A l'angle du quai au Bois \u00e0 Br\u00fbler et de la rue du Grand Hospice","address_street_number":null,"addres