:null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/fb.me\/e\/1DlkqSLK0","email":"contact@coachmebruna.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50003068"},"en":{"name":"The Self Liberation Art Exhibition","shortdescr":"Highlights:\n- Interactive Art Activities: Engage through a talk on Saturday night about our society, freedom, and healing; share your story.\n- Meet the Artist: Bruna Rocha will be present to discuss her inspiration, techniques, and the stories behind her artwork.\n- Enjoy live music as you savor delicious refreshments, adding an auditory and gastronomic layer to your art experience.","longdescr":"**About the Exhibition:**\nJoin us for a captivating journey into the world of self-liberation through art as we present the exquisite works of renowned artist Bruna Rocha. With a unique blend of creativity, emotion, and personal growth, Rocha's artistry will take you on a transformative exploration of the self.\n\n**Artworks on Display:**\n\nExperience an array of thought-provoking pieces, including paintings, sculptures, and mixed media creations that delve into the depths of self-discovery, empowerment, and the pursuit of freedom.\n\n**Event Highlights:**\n- **Opening Reception:** Be among the first to witness Bruna Rocha's masterpieces while mingling with fellow art enthusiasts.\n- **Interactive Art Activities:** Engage with the art on a deeper level through interactive installations and activities designed to spark introspection.\n- **Meet the Artist:** Bruna Rocha will be present to discuss her inspiration, techniques, and the stories behind her artwork.\n- **Live Music & Refreshments:** Enjoy live music as you savor delicious refreshments, adding an auditory and gastronomic layer to your art experience.\n\n**Admission:**\n- Opening Reception: Free Admission\n- Exhibition Dates: Free Admission \n\n**No RSVP is needed.**\n\nDon't miss this opportunity to immerse yourself in the world of self-liberation through the incredible artistry of Bruna Rocha. Join us at Ploef! Brussels for a memorable evening of creativity, inspiration, and self-discovery.\n\nFollow us on @coachmebruna for updates and behind-the-scenes glimpses leading up to the event. We look forward to seeing you there!\n\n","performers":"Join us for a captivating journey into the world of self-liberation through art as we present the exquisite works of renowned artist Bruna Rocha. With a blend of creativity, emotion, and personal growth, Rocha's artistry will take you on a transformative exploration of the self.\nExperience an array of thought-provoking pieces into self-discovery, empowerment, and the pursuit of freedom.\n\n\n\n","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/fb.me\/e\/1DlkqSLK0","email":"contact@coachmebruna.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50003068"},"it":{"name":"The Self Liberation Art Exhibition","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/fb.me\/e\/1DlkqSLK0","email":"contact@coachmebruna.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50003068"},"cn":{"name":"The Self Liberation Art Exhibition","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/fb.me\/e\/1DlkqSLK0","email":"contact@coachmebruna.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50003068"},"fr":{"name":"The Self Liberation Art Exhibition","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/fb.me\/e\/1DlkqSLK0","email":"contact@coachmebruna.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50003068"},"sp":{"name":"The Self Liberation Art Exhibition","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/fb.me\/e\/1DlkqSLK0","email":"contact@coachmebruna.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50003068"},"nl":{"name":"The Self Liberation Art Exhibition","shortdescr":"- Interactieve kunstactiviteiten: neem deel aan een lezing op zaterdagavond over onze samenleving, vrijheid en genezing, en deel je verhaal.\n- Meet the Artist: Bruna Rocha zal zelf aanwezig zijn om haar inspiratie, technieken en de verhalen achter haar kunstwerken te bespreken.\n- Geniet van livemuziek!","longdescr":"**Over de tentoonstelling:**\nGa met ons mee op een boeiende reis naar de wereld van zelfbevrijding door middel van kunst terwijl we de voortreffelijke werken van de beroemde kunstenaar Bruna Rocha presenteren. Met een unieke mix van creativiteit, emotie en persoonlijke groei neemt Rocha's kunstenaarschap je mee op een transformerende verkenning van het zelf.\n\n**Kunstwerken tentoongesteld:**\n\nErvaar een scala aan tot nadenken stemmende stukken, waaronder schilderijen, sculpturen en creaties met gemengde media die zich verdiepen in de diepten van zelfontdekking, empowerment en het nastreven van vrijheid.\n\n**Evenement Hoogtepunten:**\n- **Openingsreceptie:** Wees een van de eersten die getuige is van de meesterwerken van Bruna Rocha terwijl je je mengt met andere kunstliefhebbers.\n- **Interactieve kunstactiviteiten:** Ga op een dieper niveau in aanraking met de kunst via interactieve installaties en activiteiten die zijn ontworpen om introspectie te stimuleren.\n- **Ontmoet de kunstenaar:** Bruna Rocha zal aanwezig zijn om haar inspiratie, technieken en de verhalen achter haar kunstwerken te bespreken.\n- **Livemuziek en versnaperingen:** Geniet van livemuziek terwijl u geniet van heerlijke versnaperingen, waardoor uw kunstervaring een auditieve en gastronomische laag krijgt.\n\n**Erkenning:**\n- Openingsreceptie: gratis toegang\n- Beursdata: gratis toegang\n\n**Er is geen RSVP nodig.**\n\nMis deze kans niet om jezelf onder te dompelen in de wereld van zelfbevrijding door het ongelooflijke kunstenaarschap van Bruna Rocha. Kom naar Ploef! Brussel voor een onvergetelijke avond vol creativiteit, inspiratie en zelfontdekking.\n\nVolg ons op @coachmebruna voor updates en een kijkje achter de schermen voorafgaand aan het evenement. We kijken ernaar uit om je daar te zien!","performers":"Ga met ons mee op een boeiende reis naar de wereld van zelfbevrijding door middel van kunst terwijl we de voortreffelijke werken van de beroemde kunstenaar Bruna Rocha presenteren. \nErvaar een scala aan tot nadenken stemmende stukken over zelfontdekking, empowerment en het nastreven van vrijheid.","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/fb.me\/e\/1DlkqSLK0","email":"contact@coachmebruna.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50003068"}},"place":{"id":248324,"translations":{"de":{"name":"PLOEF! PLus On Est de Fous...","address_street_name":"Rue Bonaventure","address_street_number":"100","address_street_box":null,"email":"ploefplus@gmail.com","website":"http:\/\/www.ploef.eu","phone_contact":"+32 2 476 98 07","phone_booking":"+32 2 476 98 07","address_zip":"1090","address_city":"Jette","address_line1":"Rue Bonaventure, 100","address_line2":"1090 Jette","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"PLOEF! PLus On Est de Fous...","address_street_name":"Rue Bonaventure","address_street_number":"100","address_street_box":null,"email":"ploefplus@gmail.com","website":"http:\/\/www.ploef.eu","phone_contact":"+32 2 476 98 07","phone_booking":"+32 2 476 98 07","address_zip":"1090","address_city":"Jette","address_line1":"Rue Bonaventure, 100","address_line2":"1090 Jette","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"book