":"Ca va \u00e7a vient","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.improviste.be\/Ca-va-ca-vient","email":"info@improviste.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50000171"},"fr":{"name":"Ca va \u00e7a vient","shortdescr":"Un couple. Un lit. Une d\u00e9cision \u00e0 prendre.","longdescr":"Un couple : son pass\u00e9, son pr\u00e9sent, ses futurs. Vont-ils rester ensemble ? Mathilde et Arthur rentrent d\u2019une soir\u00e9e et s\u2019appr\u00eatent \u00e0 se coucher... Mais une discussion anodine va les mettre face au probl\u00e8me qu\u2019ils essayent d\u2019ignorer depuis un moment. Quelle sera l\u2019issue de cette crise ? \"\u00c7a va, \u00e7a vient\" est un spectacle improvis\u00e9 o\u00f9 les souvenirs, le quotidien et l\u2019avenir hypoth\u00e9tique s\u2019entrechoquent... Cr\u00e9ez votre couple, imaginez \u00e0 quelle d\u00e9cision il sera confront\u00e9 et savourez le plaisir de d\u00e9couvrir ce que les films romantiques ne vous montrent jamais ! Une soir\u00e9e pleine d\u2019humour, de po\u00e9sie et de temps forts.","performers":"Compagnie Les 4 Saisons","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.improviste.be\/Ca-va-ca-vient","email":"info@improviste.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50000171"},"sp":{"name":"Ca va \u00e7a vient","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.improviste.be\/Ca-va-ca-vient","email":"info@improviste.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50000171"},"nl":{"name":"Ca va \u00e7a vient","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.improviste.be\/Ca-va-ca-vient","email":"info@improviste.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_boo