"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50003007"},"en":{"name":"A l'ombre de la Justice, l'art nouveau se d\u00e9cline au quotidien","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.91parallele.be","email":"info@91parallele.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50003007"},"it":{"name":"A l'ombre de la Justice, l'art nouveau se d\u00e9cline au quotidien","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.91parallele.be","email":"info@91parallele.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50003007"},"cn":{"name":"A l'ombre de la Justice, l'art nouveau se d\u00e9cline au quotidien","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.91parallele.be","email":"info@91parallele.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50003007"},"fr":{"name":"A l'ombre de la Justice, l'art nouveau se d\u00e9cline au quotidien","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"L\u2019itin\u00e9raire, du Sablon aux Marolles, multiplie les d\u00e9couvertes et t\u00e9moins li\u00e9s au style art nouveau et nous entra\u00eene \u00e0 la rencontre d\u2019architectes et de d\u00e9corateurs tels que Victor Horta, les fr\u00e8res Hamesse, Albert Cortvriendt, Adolphe Crespin, Jules Barbier et Fernand Symons.\n\nChacun d\u2019eux y a laiss\u00e9 son empreinte cr\u00e9ative et\/ou novatrice, chaque commanditaire son individualit\u00e9. Esth\u00e9tique et simplicit\u00e9, souci du d\u00e9tail, polychromie des d\u00e9cors\u2026 s\u2019affichent sur des \u00e9difices et des fa\u00e7ades aussi diverses que des maisons de ma\u00eetre, ateliers d\u2019artiste, commerces, galeries d\u2019art, \u00e9coles\u2026\n\nUne visite qui s'inscrit dans le cadre de l'ann\u00e9e Art nouveau \u00e0 Bruxelles.\n\nPrix : 15\u20ac (10\u20ac pour les 6-12 ans)\nInfos et r\u00e9servations : info@91parallele.be","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.91parallele.be","email":"info@91parallele.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50003007"},"sp":{"name":"A l'ombre de la Justice, l'art nouveau se d\u00e9cline au quotidien","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.91parallele.be","email":"info@91parallele.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50003007"},"nl":{"name":"A l'ombre de la Justice, l'art nouveau se d\u00e9cline au quotidien","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.91parallele.be","email":"info@91parallele.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50003007"}},"place":{"id":238555,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Place Poelaert","address_street_name":null,"address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place Poelaert","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Bei dem Place Poelaert, der sich 63 Meter \u00fcber der Br\u00fcsseler Unterstadt befindet, handelt es sich um den Vorplatz des beeindruckenden Br\u00fcsseler Justizpalasts. Ein Fahrstuhl ist die schnellste Verbindung zwischen Ober- und Unterstadt. Der Platz misst 155 m x 50 m, d. h. knapp 8 hat - damit ist der Place Poelaert der gr\u00f6\u00dfte Platz Br\u00fcssels.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Place Poelaert","address_street_name":null,"address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place Poelaert","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Place Poelaert","address_street_name":null,"address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place Poelaert","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Between the popular Marolles district and the elegant Louise neighbourhood lies the place Poelaert. This is the place to go for a superb panoramic view of the lower part of the city. On the horizon are architectural heritage gems such as the Basilica of Koekelberg and the Atomium. Sunset in particular is a great time to enjoy the seemingly endless sky. Not afraid of heights? Since 2019, the giant Ferris wheel 'The View' has taken up residence here and you can admire the Belgian capital from a height of no less than one hundred metres! Afterwards, take the free glass lift and dive into the Marolles for more urban fun.\r\n\r\nPlace Poelaert, with its 750m\u00b2 surface area, is also the largest square in the capital. It was named after Joseph Poelaert, the architect of the Palace of Justice, which is the monumental courthouse you see on this square, a mastodon from the 19th century. The scaffolding surrounding the courthouse has become part of the public's collective memory.\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Place Poelaert","address_street_name":null,"address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place Poelaert","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"Place Poelaert","address_street_name":null,"address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place Poelaert","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"fr":{"name":"Place Poelaert","address_street_name":null,"address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place Poelaert","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Entre les Marolles tr\u00e8s populaires, et l'\u00e9l\u00e9gant quartier Louise, se trouve la place Poelaert. C'est le meilleur spot pour avoir une vue panoramique \u00e0 couper le souffle sur la ville. \u00c0 l'horizon se profilent des joyaux du patrimoine bruxellois comme la basilique de Koekelberg et l'Atomium ; \u00e0 admirer sans mod\u00e9ration, et particuli\u00e8rement au coucher du soleil. Vous n'avez pas le vertige ? Depuis 2019, la grande roue \" The View \" vous emm\u00e8ne \u00e0 cent m\u00e8tres de haut pour admirer la capitale belge, tandis que l'ascenseur (gratuit), tout en verre, vous fait plonger dans les Marolles pour encore plus de plaisir en ville.\r\n\r\nAvec ses 750 m2, la place Poelaert est \u00e9galement la plus grande place de la capitale. Elle doit son nom \u00e0 Joseph Poelaert, l'architecte du monumental palais de justice, construit au 19\u00e8me si\u00e8cle, qui tr\u00f4ne sur cette place ; et l\u2019\u00e9chafaudage qui le soutient depuis des ann\u00e9es fait d\u00e9sormais partie de la m\u00e9moire collective.\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Place Poelaert","address_street_name":null,"address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place Poelaert","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Poelaertplein","address_street_name":null,"address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Poelaertplein","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Tussen de volkse Marollen en de elegante Louizawijk ligt het Poelaertplein. Hier moet je zijn voor een prachtig panoramisch uitzicht over de (beneden)stad. Aan de horizon prijken architecturale erfgoedparels zoals de Basiliek van Koekelberg en het Atomium. Vooral bij zonsondergang is het hier volop genieten van een eindeloze hemel. Geen hoogtevrees? Sinds 2019 staat hier het reuzenrad \u2018The View\u2019 en kan je de Belgische hoofdstad bewonderen vanop maar liefst honderd meter hoogte! Nadien kan je gratis de glazen lift nemen en de Marollen induiken voor meer stadsplezier.\r\n\r\nHet Poelaertplein is met een oppervlakte van 750 m\u00b2 ook het grootste plein van de hoofdstad. Het werd vernoemd naar Joseph Poelaert, de architect van het justitiepaleis. Dat is het monumentale gerechtsgebouw dat je op dit plein ziet, een mastodont uit de 19de eeuw. De steigers waarin het justitiepaleis sinds jaar en dag verpakt is, maken ondertussen deel uit van het collectieve geheugen.\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null}},"districts":{"list":[2],"translations":{"de":["Marollen"],"pt":[null],"en":["Marolles"],"it":["Marolles"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Marolles"],"sp":["Marolles"],"nl":["Marollen"]}},"zones":{"list":[19],"translations":{"de":["Zentrum"],"pt":[null],"en":["Centre"],"it":["Centro"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Centre"],"sp":["Centro"],"nl":["Centrum"]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":"109264419156670","backoffice_id":2016,"location":{"lat":50.83696471,"lon":4.35179017},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2022-10-10T10:25:09+02:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:14:50+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":false,"is_in_vb_export":false,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":50000434,"translations":{"de":{"name":"91\u00e8me parall\u00e8le","address_street_name":"Rue Gaucheret","address_street_number":"4","address_street_box":"B73","email":"info@91parallele.be","website":"https:\/\/91parallele.be\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Rue Gaucheret, 4 \/ B73","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"91\u00e8me parall\u00e8le","address_street_name":"Rue Gaucheret","address_street_number":"4","address_street_box":"B73","email":"info@91parallele.be","website":"https:\/\/91parallele.be\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Rue Gaucheret, 4 \/ B73","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"91\u00e8me parall\u00e8le","address_street_name":"Rue Gaucheret","address_street_number":"4","address_street_box":"B73","email":"info@91parallele.be","website":"https:\/\/91parallele.be\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Rue Gaucheret, 4 \/ B73","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"91\u00e8me parall\u00e8le","address_street_name":"Rue Gaucheret","address_street_number":"4","address_street_box":"B73","email":"info@91parallele.be","website":"https:\/\/91parallele.be\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Rue Gaucheret, 4 \/ B73","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"91\u00e8me parall\u00e8le","address_street_name":"Rue Gaucheret","address_street_number":"4","address_street_box":"B73","email":"info@91parallele.be","website":"https:\/\/91parallele.be\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Rue Gaucheret, 4 \/ B73","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"fr":{"name":"91\u00e8me parall\u00e8le","address_street_name":"Rue Gaucheret","address_street_number":"4","address_street_box":"B73","email":"info@91parallele.be","website":"https:\/\/91parallele.be\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Rue Gaucheret, 4 \/ B73","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":"Avec les guides de 91eme parall\u00e8le, prenez de la hauteur, d\u00e9couvrez des territoires inconnus, embarquez dans des voyages au c\u0153ur de l\u2019Histoire, des l\u00e9gendes, de l\u2019architecture, de la musique... toujours avec ce petit point de vue d\u00e9cal\u00e9 qui fait leur marque de fabrique. Pourquoi 91\u00e8me parall\u00e8le ? Horizontalement, chaque h\u00e9misph\u00e8re terrestre est divis\u00e9 en cercles imaginaires reliant les lieux se trouvant sur une m\u00eame latitude. L\u2019\u00e9quateur est le point 0, les P\u00f4le nord et sud sont les 90eme parall\u00e8les.\nIl n'y a donc pas de 91eme parall\u00e8le...Un nom d'\u00e9quipe est un peu loufoque, un v\u00e9ritable petit clin d\u2019\u0153il au surr\u00e9alisme belge !\n\n\nVisites publiques et priv\u00e9es, pour petits et grands, jeunes et moins jeunes. Tous nos \"voyages\" sont repris dans l'agenda en ligne sur notre site internet.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"91\u00e8me parall\u00e8le","address_street_name":"Rue Gaucheret","address_street_number":"4","address_street_box":"B73","email":"info@91parallele.be","website":"https:\/\/91parallele.be\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Rue Gaucheret, 4 \/ B73","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"91\u00e8me parall\u00e8le","address_street_name":"Gaucheretstraat","address_street_number":"4","address_street_box":"B73","email":"info@91parallele.be","website":"https:\/\/91parallele.be\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Gaucheretstraat, 4 \/ B73","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"region":"brussels","backoffice_id":41178,"location":{"lat":50.8624095,"lon":4.3601281},"last_updated_at":"2023-09-05T10:40:01+02:00","published_at":"2023-08-28T11:27:17+02:00","is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":false,"import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"resto_ranking":0},"media":[],"dates":[{"day":"2023-10-28","doors":null,"start":"10:00:00","end":"12:00:00","is_soldout":false,"is_canceled":false}],"prices":[{"translations":{"de":{"name":"Kinder"},"en":{"name":"Children"},"it":{"name":"Bambini"},"fr":{"name":"Enfants"},"sp":{"name":"Ni\u00f1os"},"nl":{"name":"Kinderen"}},"value":10},{"translations":{"de":{"name":"Normal"},"en":{"name":"Normal"},"it":{"name":"Norma