nOn Wednesday, Thursday and Friday evenings, the chef offers a delicious gastronomic meal with 2 appetizers and 3 courses. \r\nOn Saturday evenings, the menu is extended to 3 appetizers and 3 courses, with a particularly exceptional menu, as it uses the recipes he used when he worked for the royal palace. A delight for all gastronomes curious to put themselves in the shoes of a King or Queen on a ceremonial mission.\r\nWelcome aboard!\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Flylounge","address_street_name":"Rue du Commerce","address_street_number":"65","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@flylounge.com","website":"https:\/\/www.flylounge.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 318 00 47","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Commerce, 65","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"Flylounge","address_street_name":"Rue du Commerce","address_street_number":"65","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@flylounge.com","website":"https:\/\/www.flylounge.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 318 00 47","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Commerce, 65","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"fr":{"name":"Flylounge","address_street_name":"Rue du Commerce","address_street_number":"65","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@flylounge.com","website":"https:\/\/www.flylounge.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 318 00 47","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Commerce, 65","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Embarquez sans attendre \u00e0 bord de l\u2019incroyable avion restaurant gastronomique de l'espace \u00e9v\u00e9nementiel Flylounge ! \r\n\r\nCette nouvelle exp\u00e9rience allie originalit\u00e9 de la salle, accueil chaleureux de l\u2019\u00e9quipage et d\u00e9licieux voyage culinaire. Elle est ponctu\u00e9e d\u2019animations comme des annonces passager, une visite cockpit avec option pilotage pour les plus t\u00e9m\u00e9raires, une pr\u00e9sentation du chef Daniel Dupuis et de la gen\u00e8se du flylounge\u2026\r\n\r\nLes mercredis, jeudis et vendredis soir, le chef vous propose un d\u00e9licieux repas gastronomique d\u00e9clin\u00e9 en 2 amuses bouches et 3 plats. \r\nLes samedis soir on passe \u00e0 3 amuses bouches et 3 plats avec menu particuli\u00e8rement exceptionnel puisqu\u2019il reprend ses recettes utilis\u00e9es lorsqu\u2019il travaillait pour le palais royal. Un bonheur pour tous les gastronomes curieux de se mettre dans la peau d\u2019un Roi ou d\u2019une Reine en mission protocolaire.\r\nBienvenue \u00e0 bord !\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Flylounge","address_street_name":"Rue du Commerce","address_street_number":"65","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@flylounge.com","website":"https:\/\/www.flylounge.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 318 00 47","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Commerce, 65","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Flylounge","address_street_name":"Handelsstraat","address_street_number":"65","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@flylounge.com","website":"https:\/\/www.flylounge.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 318 00 47","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Handelsstraat, 65","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Kom aan boord van het ongelooflijke gastronomische restaurantvliegtuig van de Flylounge evenementenruimte! \r\n\r\nDeze nieuwe ervaring combineert de origi