nouveaux endroits ! ","longdescr":"Profitez du r\u00e9veil silencieux de la ville le dimanche matin. Une balade \u00e0 v\u00e9lo agr\u00e9able, une excellente dose de mouvement et id\u00e9ale pour rencontrer d'autres Bruxellois ! Une balade \u00e0 v\u00e9lo qui nous emm\u00e8ne \u00e0 Vlezenbeek \u00e0 la d\u00e9couverte d'un verger de poiriers unique et idyllique (+\/- 16km aller). Nous arrivons vers midi. Nous apportons quelque chose \u00e0 boire. N'h\u00e9sites pas \u00e0 apporter votre petit pique-nique! \nD\u00e9part \u00e0 10:00 au Grand Hospice \nGratuit - Inscriptions: info@cactus.brussels ","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/cactus.brussels\/brussel-velo\/zondag-a-velo","email":"info@cactus.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 497 19 07 14","phone_booking":"+32 497 19 07 14","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50001785"},"sp":{"name":"Dimanche \u00e0 v\u00e9lo - Perenboomgaard, Vlezenbeek","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/cactus.brussels\/brussel-velo\/zondag-a-velo","email":"info@cactus.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 497 19 07 14","phone_booking":"+32 497 19 07 14","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50001785"},"nl":{"name":"Dimanche \u00e0 v\u00e9lo - Perenboomgaard, Vlezenbeek","shortdescr":"Geniet mee van de nog stille ontwakende stad op zondagochtend. Een gezellige fietstocht, een gezonde dosis beweging en ideaal om andere Brusselaars te ontmoeten en nieuwe plekken te ontdekken met de fiets!","longdescr":"Geniet van het stille ontwaken van de stad op zondagochtend. Een aangename fietstocht, een goede dosis beweging, ideaal om andere Brusselaars te ontmoeten en nieuwe plekken te ontdekken met de fiets! De fietstocht leidt ons naar Vlezenbeek waar we een bezoek brengen aan een bijzondere en idyllische perenboomgaard (+\/- 16 km heen). We komen rond het middaguur aan op onze bestemming waar we ook even pauzeren alvorens terug te keren. We voorzien iets om te drinken. Aarzel niet om je eigen picknick meebrengen! \nVertrek 10:00 aan de Grand Hospice \nGratis | Inschrijven: Info@cactus.brussels","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/cactus.brussels\/brussel-velo\/zondag-a-velo","email":"info@cactus.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 497 19 07 14","phone_booking":"+32 497 19 07 14","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50001785"}},"place":{"id":277608,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Cactus Brussel \u00e0 v\u00e9lo","address_street_name":"Rue du Grand Hospice","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@cactus.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.cactus.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 497 19 07 14","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Grand Hospice, 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Cactus Brussel \u00e0 v\u00e9lo","address_street_name":"Rue du Grand Hospice","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@cactus.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.cactus.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 497 19 07 14","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Grand Hospice, 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Cactus Brussel \u00e0 v\u00e9lo","address_street_name":"Rue du Grand Hospice","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@cactus.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.cactus.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 497 19 07 14","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Grand Hospice, 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Cactus Brussel \u00e0 v\u00e9lo is an associati