fee.\n\nBring your family, friends, and kids.\n______\n\nIf you'd like to get the whole family in for brunch, we also offer private rooms. Get in touch for a custom rate.\n______\n\nChoose your brunch:\n\nClassic brunch: \u20ac35 - Assortment of cold cuts and cheese, sunday egg and unlimited pastries, bread, fruits and juices.\n\nHealthy brunch: \u20ac35 - A platter of vegetables with hummus, a sunday egg, a yummy pancake and unlimited pastries, bread, fruits and juices.\n\nKids' Brunch: \u20ac15 - Specifically designed for children aged 2 to 12, featuring a savory salty pancake with egg and bacon and unlimited pastries, bread, fruits and juices.\n\nLittle ones under 2: Free","performers":"Ici chez vous (food)","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/fosburyandsons.com\/calendar\/boitsfort-noon-boitsfort-brussels","email":"boitsfort@fosburyandsons.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50003392"},"it":{"name":"NOON - a sunday brunch","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/fosburyandsons.com\/calendar\/boitsfort-noon-boitsfort-brussels","email":"boitsfort@fosburyandsons.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50003392"},"cn":{"name":"NOON - a sunday brunch","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/fosburyandsons.com\/calendar\/boitsfort-noon-boitsfort-brussels","email":"boitsfort@fosburyandsons.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50003392"},"fr":{"name":"NOON - a sunday brunch","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/fosburyandsons.com\/calendar\/boitsfort-noon-boitsfort-brussels","email":"boitsfort@fosburyandsons.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":n