ravodiscovery.com","email":"info@bravodiscovery.com","phone_contact":"+32 470 60 35 05","phone_booking":"+32 495 32 03 62","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.539551"},"en":{"name":"Brussels Comic Book Route","shortdescr":"Not only is Brussels the capital of Belgium and Europe, it is also the capital of Comic strip. Comic strip images are scattered around the streets telling the adventures of iconic characters such as Tintin, Lucky Luke, the Smurfs or Quick & Flupke.","longdescr":"Program:\r\n\r\nHerg\u00e9 \u2013 Tintin in America.\r\nOlivier Rameau.\r\nLe Passage de Fran\u00e7ois Schuiten.\r\nBroussaille de Frank P\u00e9.\r\nVictor Sackeville.\r\nRic Hochet.\r\nN\u00e9ron.\r\nL\u2019Ange.\r\nLucky Luke.\r\nAst\u00e9rix.\r\nLes r\u00eaves de Nic.\r\nCori le Moussaillon.\r\nGaston Lagaffe.\r\nPoje.\r\nSmurf statue.\r\n\r\nPractical information:\r\n\r\nPrice:\r\nAdults: 35\u20ac\r\nChildren (6 to 12 years old): 20\u20ac\r\nChildren (under 6 years old): Free.\r\n\r\nWhen:\r\nEvery Sunday.\r\nStarting time:\r\n10:30am\r\n\r\nMeeting point:\r\nGrand-Place in front of the City Hall. Find our guides! They hold a white umbrella.\r\n\r\nDuration:\r\nAbout 3 hours.\r\n\r\nLanguage:\r\nEnglish.\r\n\r\nIncluded:\r\nProfessional guides (English-speaking). Experts and passionate about the history of the Comic Book Art.\r\n\r\nNot included:\r\nThe tram or bus tickets.\r\nThe tickets to the museums\r\n","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.bravodiscovery.com","email":"info@bravodiscovery.com","phone_contact":"+32 470 60 35 05","phone_booking":"+32 495 32 03 62","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.539551"},"it":{"name":"Parcours BD de Bruxelles","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.bravodiscovery.com","email":"info@bravodiscovery.com","phone_contact":"+32 470 60 35 05","phone_booking":"+32 495 32 03 62","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.539551"},"cn":{"name":"Parcours BD de Bruxelles","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.bravodiscovery.com","email":"info@bravodiscovery.com","phone_contact":"+32 470 60 35 05","phone_booking":"+32 495 32 03 62","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.539551"},"fr":{"name":"Parcours BD de Bruxelles","shortdescr":"Ce parcours guid\u00e9 de la bande dessin\u00e9e \u00e0 Bruxelles est une activit\u00e9 id\u00e9ale \u00e0 faire en famille, entre amis ou entre coll\u00e8gues. En effet, cette balade d\u2019environ 3 heures nous permettra de d\u00e9couvrir les personnages les plus c\u00e9l\u00e8bres de la bande dessin\u00e9e belge de Tintin \u00e0 Ast\u00e9rix en passant par les Schtroumpfs, tous seront pr\u00e9sent lors de notre balade.","longdescr":"Programme :\r\n\r\nHerg\u00e9 \u2013 Tintin en Am\u00e9rique.\r\nOlivier Rameau.\r\nLe Passage de Fran\u00e7ois Schuiten.\r\nBroussaille de Frank P\u00e9.\r\nVictor Sackeville.\r\nRic Hochet.\r\nN\u00e9ron.\r\nL\u2019Ange.\r\nLucky Luke.\r\nAst\u00e9rix.\r\nLes r\u00eaves de Nic.\r\nCori le Moussaillon.\r\nGaston Lagaffe.\r\nPoje.\r\nSculpture Schtroumpf.\r\n \r\n\r\nInformations pratiques :\r\n\r\nPrix :\r\nAdultes : 35\u20ac\r\nEnfants (de 6 \u00e0 12 ans) : 20\u20ac\r\nEnfants (moins de 6 ans) : Gratuit.\r\n\r\nQuand :\r\nTous les dimanches.\r\n\r\nHeures de d\u00e9part :\r\n10h30\r\n\r\nPoint de rencontre :\r\nLa Grand-Place de Bruxelles, en face de l\u2019H\u00f4tel de ville. Vous reconna\u00eetrez nos guides gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 leur parapluie blanc muni du logo Bravo Discovery.\r\n\r\nDur\u00e9e :\r\nEnviron 3h.\r\n\r\nLangue :\r\nFran\u00e7ais.\r\n\r\nInclus :\r\nGuide francophone passionn\u00e9 et professionnel.\r\n\r\nNon inclus : Entr\u00e9e aux mus\u00e9es\r\nBrussels Comic Book Route\r\n","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.bravodiscovery.