blication_state":"public","date_embargo":null,"show_in_agenda":true,"is_outside":false,"is_high_capacity":false,"is_not_major_event":false,"backoffice_id":285382,"facebook_link":null,"import_origin":null,"is_part_of":null,"sub_type":"other","ranking":1.2599210498948732,"languages":{"spoken":["en","fr","nl"],"subtitles":[]},"categories":{"main":{"id":90,"translations":{"de":"Animationen","pt":null,"en":"Animations","it":"Animazioni","cn":null,"fr":"Animations","sp":"Animaciones","nl":"Animaties"}},"others":{}},"translations":{"de":{"name":"Halloween Murder game \/ Coudenberg Palace","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/coudenberg.brussels\/halloweenmmg","email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 563 61 79","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50002154"},"pt":{"name":"Halloween Murder game \/ Coudenberg Palace","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/coudenberg.brussels\/halloweenmmg","email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 563 61 79","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50002154"},"en":{"name":"Halloween Murder game","shortdescr":"Descend beneath Place Royale to discover the remains of Charles V's former palace and lead the investigation in a thrilling Murder Party.","longdescr":"We travel back in time to the year 1521 in Brussels. While a party is in full swing in the Coudenberg Palace, an important person dies in suspicious circumstances. A few centuries later, his ghost and those of several other guests reappear in the ruins of the Palace. Startled by the presence of these ghosts, the museum guards ask for your help to unravel the mystery.\n\nBut time is running out...\n\nOn the eve before Halloween, horrific creatures join the party to torment mortals and challenge the bravest among yourselves. Rise to the challenge and try to emerge victorious, it will save you a lot of fear\u2026\n\nPractical information:\n\nMonday 30 October 2023 between 4pm and 9pm (last entry at 7.30pm)\nEntrance: Place Royale 10, 1000 Brussels\nPrice: 15 euros - 12 euros (under 26)\nTickets: visitbrussels\nTarget group: adolescents and adults\nSchedule: from 4pm to 9pm - duration 1h30 - possible shifts:\n4pm - 5.30pm\n4.30pm - 6pm\n5pm - 6.30pm\n5.30pm - 7pm\n6pm - 7.30pm\n6.30pm - 8pm\n7pm - 8.30pm\n7.30pm - 9pm\nPublic transport:\nMetro: 1, 5\u00a0\nBus: 27, 38, 71, 95\u00a0\nTram: 92, 93\nTrain: Brussels-Central\nDress code: Halloween\u00a0\nUse your smartphone or tablet to read the QR codes. Don't forget to download a QR Code application beforehand if your device doesn't have one.\u00a0\nFree Wi-Fi on site.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":"https:\/\/shop.utick.net\/?pos=coudenberg&module=CATALOGUE&lg=en","website":"https:\/\/coudenberg.brussels\/halloweenmmg","email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 563 61 79","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50002154"},"it":{"name":"Halloween Murder game \/ Coudenberg Palace","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/coudenberg.brussels\/halloweenmmg","email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 563 61 79","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50002154"},"cn":{"name":"Halloween Murder game \/ Coudenberg Palace","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/coudenberg.brussels\/halloweenmmg","email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 563 61 79","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50002154"},"fr":{"name":"Halloween Murder game","shortdescr":"Descendez sous la Place Royale \u00e0 la d\u00e9couverte des vestiges de l\u2019ancien palais de Charles Quint et menez l\u2019enqu\u00eate dans une \u00ab Murder Party \u00bb haletante.","longdescr":"Bruxelles, 1521. Alors qu\u2019une f\u00eate bat son plein dans le Palais du Coudenberg, un personnage important d\u00e9c\u00e8de dans des circonstances \u00e9tranges. Quelques si\u00e8cles plus tard, son fant\u00f4me et celui de plusieurs convives r\u00e9apparaissent dans les ruines du Palais. Alert\u00e9 par la pr\u00e9sence de ces fant\u00f4mes, les gardiens du mus\u00e9e demandent aux visiteurs de d\u00e9couvrir la cl\u00e9 de ce myst\u00e8re.\n\nMais le temps est compt\u00e9\u2026\n\nEn cette veille d\u2019Halloween, des cr\u00e9atures horrifiques se joignent \u00e0 la f\u00eate pour tourmenter les mortels ou mettre au d\u00e9fi les plus hardis. Acceptez ces d\u00e9fis et tentez d\u2019en sortir vainqueurs, cela vous \u00e9vitera bien des terreurs\u2026\"\n\nInformations pratiques :\n\nLundi 30 octobre 2023 entre 16h et 21h (derni\u00e8re entr\u00e9e \u00e0 19h30).\nEntr\u00e9e : place Royale 10, 1000 Bruxelles\nTarif : 15 euros - 12 euros (-26 ans)\nTickets via visitbrussels\nGroupe cible : adolescents et adultes\nHoraire : de 16h \u00e0 21h \u2013 dur\u00e9e 1h30 \u00a0\u2013 shifts possibles :\n16.00 - 17.30\n16.30 - 18.00\n17.00 - 18.30\n17.30 - 19.00\n18.00 - 19.30\n18.30 - 20.00\n19.00 - 20.30\n19.30 - 21.00\nTransports en commun :\u00a0\nMetro: 1, 5\u00a0\nBus: 27, 38, 71, 95\u00a0\nTram: 92, 93\nTrain: Bruxelles-Centrale\nDress code : Halloween\u00a0\nMunissez-vous de votre smartphone ou tablette pour lire les QR codes. N\u2019oubliez pas de t\u00e9l\u00e9charger une application QR Code pr\u00e9alablement si votre appareil n\u2019en dispose pas.\u00a0\nWifi gratuit sur place.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":"https:\/\/shop.utick.net\/?pos=coudenberg&module=CATALOGUE&lg=fr","website":"https:\/\/coudenberg.brussels\/halloweenmmg","email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 563 61 79","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50002154"},"sp":{"name":"Halloween Murder game \/ Coudenberg Palace","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/coudenberg.brussels\/halloweenmmg","email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 563 61 79","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50002154"},"nl":{"name":"Halloween Murder Game","shortdescr":"Daal af tot onder het Koningsplein, ontdek de overblijfselen van het voormalige paleis van Karel V en leidt het onderzoek tijdens dit spannend Moordspel.","longdescr":"We reizen terug in de tijd naar Brussel, 1521. Terwijl in het Coudenbergpaleis een feest in volle gang is, sterft een belangrijk persoon in vreemde omstandigheden. Enkele eeuwen later verschijnen zijn geest en die van verschillende gasten opnieuw in de ru\u00efnes van het paleis. Opgeschrikt door de aanwezigheid van deze geesten, hebben de bewakers van het museum jouw hulp nodig om dit mysterie te ontrafelen.\n\nMaar de tijd dringt...\n\nAan de vooravond van Halloween sluiten gruwelijke wezens zich bij het gezelschap aan om stervelingen te kwellen en de dappersten uit te dagen. Ga de uitdagingen aan en probeer als overwinnaar uit de bus te komen, het zal je een hoop angst besparen...\n\nPraktische informatie:\n\nMaandag 30 oktober 2023 tussen 16u en 21u (laatste toegang 19u30).\nToegangsprijs: Koningsplein 10, 1000 Brussel\nPrijs: 15 euro - 12 euro (onder 26 jaar)\nTickets via visitbrussels\nDoelgroep: adolescenten en volwassenen\nSchema: van 16u tot 21u - duur 1u30 - mogelijke tijdsloten:\n4pm - 5.30pm\n4.30pm - 6pm\n5pm - 6.30pm\n5.30pm - 7pm\n6pm - 7.30pm\n6.30pm - 8pm\n7pm - 8.30pm\n7.30pm - 9pm\nOpenbaar vervoer:\u00a0\nMetro: 1, 5\u00a0\nBus: 27, 38, 71, 95\u00a0\nTram: 92, 93\nTrein: Brussel-Centraal\nDresscode: Halloween\u00a0\nGebruik je smartphone of tablet om de QR codes te lezen. Vergeet niet van tevoren een QR-code-applicatie te downloaden als je apparaat die niet heeft.\u00a0\nGratis Wi-Fi ter plaatse.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":"https:\/\/shop.utick.net\/?pos=coudenberg&module=CATALOGUE&lg=nl","website":"https:\/\/coudenberg.brussels\/halloweenmmg","email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 563 61 79","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50002154"}},"place":{"id":258195,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Coudenberg Palast","address_street_name":"Place des Palais","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 500 45 54","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place des Palais, 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Ein unterirdischer Parcours, in dessen Verlauf Sie die \u00dcberreste des Palastes von Charles V. entdecken k\u00f6nnen. Seit dem Mittelalter \u00fcberragt eine f\u00fcrstliche Residenz auf dem Coudenberg die Stadt Br\u00fcssel. Das architektonische Ensemble, das sich seit dem 12. Jahrhundert immer wieder weiterentwickelt hat, gilt als einer der sch\u00f6nsten Pal\u00e4ste Europas und eine der wichtigsten Residenzen von Karl V. Dieses prestigetr\u00e4chtige Geb\u00e4ude wurde bei einem Brand im Februar 1731 schwer besch\u00e4digt. Vierzig Jahre sp\u00e4ter wurden die Ruinen des Palasts dem Erdboden gleichgemacht, um Platz f\u00fcr den Place Royale zu machen. Die \u00dcberreste dieses Geb\u00e4udes bilden heute die arch\u00e4ologische St\u00e4tte des Coudenberg. ","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Palais du Coudenberg ","address_street_name":"Place des Palais","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 500 45 54","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place des Palais, 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Coudenberg Palace","address_street_name":"Place des Palais","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 500 45 54","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place des Palais, 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Once upon a time, the Coudenberg Palace towered over the city of Brussels. Charles V and many other of the most powerful rulers ever to reign in Europe made this princely residence their home between the 12th and 18th centuries, until it was consumed by a terrible fire.  Every trace of this prestigious palace simply disappeared underground for many years. Today, however, these ruins constitute a fascinating archeological site incorporating a network of underground passages and chambers.\r\n \r\nWhen you visit it you can explore the principal buildings of the palace and enjoy a stroll along the Rue Isabelle, which is now underground.  In the Coudenberg Museum, located in Hoogstraeten House, the finest of the archeological discoveries made during the various excavations of the Coudenberg site are displayed.\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Coudenberg Palazzo ","address_street_name":"Place des Palais","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 500 45 54","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place des Palais, 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"\"Il sito archeologico di Coudenberg vi svela un percorso sotterraneo e un museo dedicati a Carlo V sulla Place de Palais a Bruxelles.\tSito Archeologico di Coudenbergl sito...\"\r\n\r\nIl sito archeologico di Coudenberg vi svela un percorso sotterraneo e un museo dedicati a Carlo V sulla Place de Palais a Bruxelles.\r\n\r\nSito Archeologico di Coudenberg\r\n\r\nl sito riunisce vestigia dell'antico palazzo di Bruxelles, della residenza di Hoogstraeten e della Rue Isabelle. Un'affascinante passeggiata che vi conduce sotto il pav\u00e9 della place Royale, alla scoperta dei resti del Palazzo di Coudenberg che fu una delle residenze principali di Carlo V. \u00a0\r\n\r\nMuseo del Coudenberg\r\nil museo vi invita a scoprire un'esposizione permanente di oggetti trovati durante gli scavi effettuati sul sito negli ultimi 25 anni. potete combinare la vostra visita con quella del Museo BELvue.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"Palais du Coudenberg ","address_street_name":"Place des Palais","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 500 45 54","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place des Palais, 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"fr":{"name":"Palais du Coudenberg ","address_street_name":"Place des Palais","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 500 45 54","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place des Palais, 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Autrefois, l\u2019impressionnant palais du Coudenberg dominait la ville de Bruxelles. Charles Quint et d\u2019autres souverains parmi les plus puissants que l\u2019Europe ait connus ont habit\u00e9 cette r\u00e9sidence princi\u00e8re du 12e au 18e si\u00e8cle, jusqu\u2019\u00e0 ce qu\u2019un terrible incendie la d\u00e9truise \u00e0 jamais. Les ruines de ce palais ont disparu pendant de nombreuses ann\u00e9es dans les sous-sols. Aujourd\u2019hui, ces vestiges forment un site arch\u00e9ologique enchanteur constitu\u00e9 d\u2019un r\u00e9seau de salles et de passages souterrains.\r\n \r\nAu cours de votre visite, vous d\u00e9couvrirez les b\u00e2timents principaux du palais et vous fl\u00e2nerez dans la rue Isabelle, qui est aujourd\u2019hui souterraine. Dans le mus\u00e9e du Coudenberg, qui est abrit\u00e9 dans l\u2019h\u00f4tel d\u2019Hoogstraeten, sont expos\u00e9es les plus belles d\u00e9couvertes arch\u00e9ologiques effectu\u00e9es lors des diff\u00e9rentes campagnes de fouilles men\u00e9es sur le site du Coudenberg\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Coudenberg Palacio ","address_street_name":"Place des Palais","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 500 45 54","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place des Palais, 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"En el emplazamiento arqueol\u00f3gico de Coudenberg encontrar\u00e1s un recorrido subterr\u00e1neo y un museo dedicado al Palacio Carlos V, en la Place des Palais de Bruselas....\r\n\r\nEn el emplazamiento arqueol\u00f3gico de Coudenberg encontrar\u00e1s un recorrido subterr\u00e1neo y un museo dedicado al Palacio Carlos V, en la Place des Palais de Bruselas.\r\n\r\nEl emplazamiento arqueol\u00f3gico Coudenberg\r\n\r\nEl emplazamiento arqueol\u00f3gico Coudenberg est\u00e1 compuesto de vestigios del antiguo Palacio de Bruselas, del Hotel Hoogstraeten y de la Rue Isabelle.\u00a0Este fascinante paseo te llevar\u00e1 a descubrir los <b>vestigios del Palacio Coudenberg<\/b>, que fue una de las residencias de Carlos V.\r\n\r\nMuseo Coudenberg\r\n\r\nInstalado en los vestigios del antiguo Hotel de Hoogstraeten, el Museo Coudenberg  te invita a descubrir una <b>exposici\u00f3n permanente<\/b> de objetos hallados durante las distintas <b>excavaciones arqueol\u00f3gicas<\/b> realizadas los \u00faltimos 25 a\u00f1os.\u00a0Podr\u00e1s combinar tu visita del Coudenberg con la del Museo BELvue.\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Coudenbergpaleis","address_street_name":"Paleizenplein","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 500 45 54","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Paleizenplein, 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Ooit werd Brussel gedomineerd door het reusachtige Coudenbergpaleis. Keizer Karel en het kruim van de Europese adel verbleven er tussen de twaalfde en de achttiende eeuw. Tot het noodlot toesloeg en een brand het prachtige gebouw verwoestte. Vele resten bleven echter intact en verdwenen ... onder de grond. Nu is het een betoverende archeologische site, een netwerk van gewelfde gangen, zalen en verborgen kamers.\r\n \r\nTijdens een bezoek ontdek je de hoofdgebouwen van het paleis en flaneer je door de Isabellastraat, die nu onder de grond ligt! In het museum van de Coudenberg, dat in het bovengrondse Hof van Hoogstraeten ondergebracht is, kan je de mooiste archeologische voorwerpen bewonderen die in de loop van de verschillende opgravingswerken op de Coudenbergsite werden ontdekt.\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null}},"districts":{"list":[16],"translations":{"de":["K\u00f6nigliches Viertel"],"pt":[null],"en":["Royal"],"it":["Quartiere reale"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Quartier Royal"],"sp":["Quartier Royal \u2014Barrio de la Corte\u201