in the heart. Pitou forges songs that resonate deeply. Anno 2023 there is the long-awaited debut album Big Tear. The record features creative alternative pop songs that draw on vocal layering, loops, wistful melodies, and classical instruments that all come together in stylish, clever ways. A beautiful testament to her unwavering dedication to embracing life's turmoil to the fullest. \n\n\"Pitou heeft haar superkrachten ontdekt. De zangvogel vliegt haar eigen kooi uit en ontdekt de eindeloze hemel\"- 3voor12 about Pitou at Best Kept Secret\n\nTJE is a quirky experimental electronic folk trio.\n\"De stem van frontvrouw Lindy kroop onder onze huid en zorgde voor kippenvel. Het drietal mag dan nog maar weinig ervaring hebben, de internationale sound van de band was er eentje die ons nog lang zal bijblijven\" Dancing Bears\n","performers":"TJE, PITOU","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/pilar.brussels\/nl\/events\/pitou","email":"Pilar@vub.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 629 23 29","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50002377"},"it":{"name":"Pitou","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/pilar.brussels\/nl\/events\/pitou","email":"Pilar@vub.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 629 23 29","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50002377"},"cn":{"name":"Pitou","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/pilar.brussels\/nl\/events\/pitou","email":"Pilar@vub.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 629 23 29","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50002377"},"fr":{"name":"Pitou","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Bienvenue dans le monde enchanteur de Pitou, o\u00f9 se m\u00ealent finesse classique et audace pop alternative. Cette musicienne d'Amsterdam \u00e0 la voix d'or interpr\u00e8te une folk-pop intimiste qui se garde de tout exc\u00e8s de ringardise, mais qui vous touche droit au c\u0153ur. Pitou forge des chansons qui r\u00e9sonnent profond\u00e9ment. Anno 2023 marque l'arriv\u00e9e du tr\u00e8s attendu premier album Big Tear. Ce disque propose des chansons pop alternatives cr\u00e9atives qui s'appuient sur des superpositions vocales, des boucles, des m\u00e9lodies nostalgiques et des instruments classiques qui s'assemblent de mani\u00e8re \u00e9l\u00e9gante et intelligente. Un beau t\u00e9moignage de sa volont\u00e9 in\u00e9branlable d'embrasser pleinement les bouleversements de la vie. \n\n\"Pitou heeft haar superkrachten ontdekt. De zangvogel vliegt haar eigen kooi uit en ontdekt de eindeloze hemel\" - 3voor12 over Pitou op Best Kept Secret\n\nTJE est un trio folk \u00e9lectronique exp\u00e9rimental excentrique.\n\"De stem van frontvrouw Lindy kroop onder onze huid en zorgde voor kippenvel. Het drietal mag dan nog maar weinig ervaring hebben, de internationale sound van de band was er eentje die ons nog lang zal bijblijven\"- Dancing Bears\n","performers":"TJE, PITOU","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/pilar.brussels\/nl\/events\/pitou","email":"Pilar@vub.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 629 23 29","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50002377"},"sp":{"name":"Pitou","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/pilar.brussels\/nl\/events\/pitou","email":"Pilar@vub.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 629 23 29","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50002377"},"nl":{"name":"Pitou","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Welkom in de betoverende wereld van Pitou, waar klassieke finesse en alternatieve popdurf samenkomen. De Amsterdamse muzikante met gouden stem brengt intieme folkpop die wegblijf van overdreven meligheid, maar die je toch recht in het hart raakt. Pitou smeedt liederen die diep resoneren. Anno 2023 is daar het langverwachte debuutalbum Big Tear. De plaat bevat creatieve alternatieve popsongs die putten uit vocale gelaagdheid, loops, weemoedige melodie\u00ebn, en klassieke instrumenten die allemaal samenkomen op stijlvolle, slimme manieren. Een prachtige getuigenis van haar onwankelbare toewijding om het roerige leven ten volle te omarmen. \n\n\"Pitou heeft haar superkrachten ontdekt. De zangvogel vliegt haar eigen kooi uit en ontdekt de eindeloze hemel\" - 3voor12 over Pitou op Best Kept Secret\n\nTJE is een eigenzinnig experimenteel elektronisch folktrio.\n\"De stem van frontvrouw Lindy kroop onder onze huid en zorgde voor kippenvel. Het drietal mag dan nog maar weinig ervaring hebben, de internationale sound van de band was er eentje die ons nog lang zal bijblijven\" Dansende Beren","performers":"TJE, PITOU","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/pilar.brussels\/nl\/events\/pitou","email":"Pilar@vub.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 629 23 29","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50002377"}},"place":{"id":273547,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Pilar ","address_street_name":"Triomflaan, VUB  Ingang 6","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"pilar@vub.be","website":"https:\/\/pilar.brussels\/en","phone_contact":"+32 2 629 23 25","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Triomflaan, VUB  Ingang 6","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Pilar ","address_street_name":"Triomflaan, VUB  Ingang 6","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"pilar@vub.be","website":"https:\/\/pilar.brussels\/en","phone_contact":"+32 2 629 23 25","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Triomflaan, VUB  Ingang 6","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Pilar","address_street_name":"Triomflaan, VUB  Ingang 6","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"pilar@vub.be","website":"https:\/\/pilar.brussels\/en","phone_contact":"+32 2 629 23 25","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Triomflaan, VUB  Ingang 6","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"The legendary Kultuurkaffee opened in 1981 and was a place of encounters and discoveries for generations of students until it was demolished in 2015 to make way for a new cultural site. For four and a half years Kultuurkaffee has been operating as a nomadic cultural organization, collaborating with various venues in the capital. Now they are back on the VUB campus, but under a new name: Pilar. Pilar is an open, artistic laboratory in Brussels, a pillar of support for and by young people, a place for cross-fertilisation between art, science and entrepreneurship. Pilar's new space includes a concert and event hall, exhibition areas and a sustainable caf\u00e9 capable of hosting events.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Pilar ","address_street_name":"Triomflaan, VUB  Ingang 6","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"pilar@vub.be","website":"https:\/\/pilar.brussels\/en","phone_contact":"+32 2 629 23 25","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Triomflaan, VUB  Ingang 6","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"Pilar ","address_street_name":"Triomflaan, VUB  Ingang 6","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"pilar@vub.be","website":"https:\/\/pilar.brussels\/en","phone_contact":"+32 2 629 23 25","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Triomflaan, VUB  Ingang 6","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"fr":{"name":"Pilar ","address_street_name":"Triomflaan, VUB  Ingang 6","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"pilar@vub.be","website":"https:\/\/pilar.brussels\/en","phone_contact":"+32 2 629 23 25","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Triomflaan, VUB  Ingang 6","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"Le l\u00e9gendaire Kultuurkaffee, ouvert en 1981, et lieu de rencontres et d\u00e9couvertes pour plusieurs g\u00e9n\u00e9rations d'\u00e9tudiants, a \u00e9t\u00e9 d\u00e9molie au cours de 2015 pour faire place \u00e0 un nouveau lieu culturel. Depuis, Kultuurkaffee a fonctionn\u00e9 comme organisation culturelle nomade dans divers endroits de la capitale.  Apr\u00e8s 4,5 ans d'errance KultuurKaffee est maintenant de retour sur le campus de la VUB \u00e0 Etterbeek, mais sous un nouveau nom : Pilar. Pilar sera un laboratoire ouvert et artistique \u00e0 Bruxelles, un pilier de soutien pour et par les jeunes. \r\nLes nouvelles salles de Pilar comprennent une salle de concert et d'\u00e9v\u00e9nements, et des zones d'exposition, ainsi qu'un caf\u00e9 durable riche en \u00e9v\u00e9nements. ","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Pilar ","address_street_name":"Triomflaan, VUB  Ingang 6","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"pilar@vub.be","website":"https:\/\/pilar.brussels\/en","phone_contact":"+32 2 629 23 25","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Triomflaan, VUB  Ingang 6","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Pilar ","address_street_name":"Triomflaan, VUB  Ingang 6","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"pilar@vub.be","website":"https:\/\/pilar.brussels\/nl","phone_contact":"+32 2 629 23 25","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Triomflaan, VUB  Ingang 6","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"Sinds de opening in 1981 stond KultuurKaffee gekend als de ontmoetingsplek voor vele generaties studenten, een waar begrip in het Brusselse cultuurleven. In 2015 werd KultuurKaffee afgebroken en startten de bouwwerken van een nieuwe cultuurtoren. Deze zijn nu klaar. Daarmee landt KultuurKaffee na 4,5 jaar omzwervingen als nomadische kunstenorganisatie in Brussel terug op de VUB-campus in Etterbeek, maar wel onder een nieuwe naam: Pilar. Pilar is een open, artistiek laboratorium in Brussel. Een steunzuil voor en door jongeren. Een huis waarin de kruisbestuiving tussen kunst en wetenschap en ook cultureel ondernemerschap een plaats krijgt. \r\n\r\nDe focus van Pilars werking is tweeledig. Enerzijds blijft Pilar een presentatieplek waar ontluikende en vernieuwende kunstenaars, maar ook gevestigde waarden een podium krijgen. Nog meer dan vroeger komen daarbij verschillende disciplines aan bod en zoekt de werking de grenzen tussen deze disciplines op. Anderzijds werkt Pilar laagdrempelige formats uit om jongeren in alle aspecten van de werking te betrekken en toekomstdenkers en -doeners met ondernemende ambities te ondersteunen.\r\n\r\nDe nieuwe vertrekken van Pilar omvatten onder meer een concert\/eventzaal en exporuimtes en zal ook een duurzame caf\u00e9werking en evenementrijk eetcaf\u00e9 omvatten. \r\n\r\n\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null}},"districts":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"zones":{"list":[22],"translations":{"de":["Osten"],"pt":[null],"en":["East"],"it":["Est"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Est"],"sp":["Este"],"nl":["Oost"]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":33547,"location":{"lat":50.84720202,"lon":4.38749088},"region":"brussels","