fice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/lamaisondesarts.be\/after-five-dressing\/","email":"info@lamaisondesarts.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 240 34 99","phone_booking":"+32 2 240 34 99","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50001451"},"pt":{"name":"After Five","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/lamaisondesarts.be\/after-five-dressing\/","email":"info@lamaisondesarts.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 240 34 99","phone_booking":"+32 2 240 34 99","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50001451"},"en":{"name":"After Five","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/lamaisondesarts.be\/after-five-dressing\/","email":"info@lamaisondesarts.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 240 34 99","phone_booking":"+32 2 240 34 99","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50001451"},"it":{"name":"After Five","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/lamaisondesarts.be\/after-five-dressing\/","email":"info@lamaisondesarts.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 240 34 99","phone_booking":"+32 2 240 34 99","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50001451"},"cn":{"name":"After Five","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/lamaisondesarts.be\/after-five-dressing\/","email":"info@lamaisondesarts.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 240 34 99","phone_booking":"+32 2 240 34 99","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50001451"},"fr":{"name":"After Five","shortdescr":"PROFITEZ D\u2019UNE NOCTURNE DANS L\u2019EXPO ET D\u2019UNE ACTIVIT\u00c9 \u00c0 L\u2019ESTAMINET ","longdescr":"\nDans le cadre de l\u2019exposition Dressing, la Maison des Arts et l\u2019Estaminet vous accueillent trois soir\u00e9es durant lesquelles vous pourrez d\u00e9couvrir l\u2019expo et profiter d\u2019une activit\u00e9.\n\nJEUDI 28.09:\n17:00 > 22h: Nocturne expo\n17:00 > 21:00: Vide-dressing\n\nPr\u00e9parez-vous \u00e0 d\u00e9couvrir une s\u00e9lection de v\u00eatements d\u2019occasion de qualit\u00e9, tous soigneusement choisis pour leur style, leur \u00e9tat impeccable et leur abordabilit\u00e9. Que vous soyez \u00e0 la recherche de pi\u00e8ces tendance, de v\u00eatements vintage ou de marques de cr\u00e9ateurs, vous trouverez certainement votre bonheur parmi la collection qui sera pr\u00e9sent\u00e9e ce jour-l\u00e0.\n\nVous souhaitez y participer et y proposer vos v\u00eatements ? Avec grand plaisir ! Envoyez-nous un mail \u00e0 info@estaminet1030.be\nDate limite : 14\/09\/2023\n\nAu menu \u00e9galement: boissons et p\u00e2tisseries propos\u00e9s par l\u2019Estaminet pour se r\u00e9galer, autant les yeux que les papilles!\n\n \n\nJEUDI 12.10:\n17:00 > 22h: Nocturne expo\n20:30: Concert: Better Off Alive (be\/it)\n\nBetter Off Alive est un groupe bruxellois qui voyage \u00e0 travers les hits des ann\u00e9es 90 et 2000 qui sont rest\u00e9s inoubliables (que vous vouliez les oublier ou non !) et y ajouter une touche personnelle. Ils utilisent leurs propres instruments pour recr\u00e9er la musique qui a \u00e9t\u00e9 con\u00e7ue pour \u00eatre jou\u00e9e en appuyant sur les boutons d\u2019une console. Ils aiment aussi improviser, en gardant l\u2019esprit de la musique vivante, tout en laissant de l\u2019espace pour interagir avec la vibration du public, qui est toujours pr\u00eat \u00e0 se jeter dans la danse. Leur but est de secouer la piste de danse et de faire la f\u00eate comme en 2004!\n\n \n\nJEUDI 09.11:\n17:00 > 22h: Nocturne expo\n19:00: Atelier Couture\n\nBienvenue \u00e0 notre premier atelier couture ! Que vous soyez un d\u00e9butant curieux ou un amateur exp\u00e9riment\u00e9, notre atelier est l\u2019endroit id\u00e9al pour lib\u00e9rer votre cr\u00e9ativit\u00e9 et explorer l\u2019art intemporel de la couture. Venez profiter du cadre comfy du caf\u00e9 pour venir cr\u00e9er et \u00e9changer bonnes pratiques et techniques.\n\nPlus d\u2019info sur l\u2019intervenant \u00e0 venir.\n\nSur inscription via info@estaminet1030.be\n10 places max. \u2013 Gratuit","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/lamaisondesarts.be\/after-five-dressing\/","email":"info@lamaisondesarts.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 240 34 99","phone_booking":"+32 2 240 34 99","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50001451"},"sp":{"name":"After Five","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/lamaisondesarts.be\/after-five-dressing\/","email":"info@lamaisondesarts.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 240 34 99","phone_booking":"+32 2 240 34 99","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50001451"},"nl":{"name":"After Five","shortdescr":"GENIET VAN DRIE NOCTURNES OP DE TENTOONSTELLING EN EEN ACTIVITEIT IN L\u2019ESTAMINET","longdescr":"\nIn het kader van de tentoonstelling \u2018Dressing\u2019 verwelkomen La Maison des Arts en het Estaminet je op drie nocturnes om de tentoonstelling te ontdekken en te genieten van een activiteit.\n\nDONDERDAG 28.09:\n17:00 > 22:00: Nocturne Dressing\n17:00 > 21:00: Verkoop tweedehandskleding\n\nOntdek een selectie kwaliteitsvolle tweedehandskleding, zorgvuldig samengesteld op basis van hun stijl, onberispelijke staat en betaalbaarheid. Op zoek naar trendy stukken, vintage kleding of designermerken? Je vindt hier vast iets dat je hart sneller doet slaan!\n\n \n\nWil je zelf kleding verkopen? Dat kan! Stuur ons een mailtje op info@estaminet1030.be\n\nSchrijf je in voor uiterlijk 14.09.2023\n\n \n\nOok op het menu: drankjes en gebak van L\u2019Estaminet om smaakpapillen \u00e9n ogen te verwennen.\n\nDONDERDAG 12.10:\n17:00 > 22:00: Nocturne Dressing\n20:30: Concert: Better Off Alive (be\/it)\n\nBetter Off Alive is een Brusselse band die onvergetelijke (of je dat nu wilt of niet) hits uit de jaren 90 en 2000 onder handen neemt met een persoonlijke touch. Ze gebruiken hun eigen instrumenten om de muziek na te spelen die werd geschreven voor de knoppen van een toetsenbord. Improviseren doen ze ook graag. De geest van de muziek blijft wel altijd overeind, met toch genoeg ruimte om in interactie te gaan met het publiek dat zijn danspasjes zelden kan onderdrukken. Hun ambitie? De dansvloer op zijn kop zetten en \u2026 party like it\u2019s 2004!\n\n \n\nDONDERDAG 09.11:\n17:00 > 22:00: Nocturne Dressing\n19:00: Naaiatelier\n\nWelkom in ons eerste naaiatelier! Ben je een nieuwsgierige beginner of een rot in het vak? Het maakt niet uit. Leef je creatief uit in ons atelier en verken de tijdloze kunst van het naaien! Kom in het knusse caf\u00e9 de mooiste creaties maken en deel tips en technieken. \n\nMeer info over de organisatie volgt nog.\n\n \n\nMax. 10 plaatsen \u2013 op inschrijving via info@estaminet1030.be\n\nGratis\n\n ","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/lamaisondesarts.be\/after-five-dressing\/","email":"info@lamaisondesarts.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 240 34 99","phone_booking":"+32 2 240 34 99","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50001451"}},"place":{"id":222932,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Maison des Arts","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Haecht","address_street_number":"147","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lamaisondesarts.be","website":"http:\/\/www.lamaisondesarts.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 240 34 99","phone_booking":"+32 2 240 34 85","address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de Haecht, 147","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Maison des Arts","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Haecht","address_street_number":"147","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lamaisondesarts.be","website":"http:\/\/www.lamaisondesarts.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 240 34 99","phone_booking":"+32 2 240 34 85","address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de Haecht, 147","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Maison des Arts","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Haecht","address_street_number":"147","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lamaisondesarts.be","website":"http:\/\/www.lamaisondesarts.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 240 34 99","phone_booking":"+32 2 240 34 85","address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de Haecht, 147","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":"The MdA is run and staffed by the Francophone Cultural Service of Schaerbeek Council and is a unique place whose activities are mainly concerned with the creation of works of contemporary art with a significant partnership programme that promotes access for all to contemporary art.\r\n\r\nThe MdA has hosted a rich programme of artistic activities since the 1950s when the building was purchased by Schaerbeek Council. In 2005, the MdA began a programme of inviting artists to work in building, to build more coherence between their works of art and the MdA.\r\n\r\nMost recently, in 2016, Schaerbeek Council decided to position the MdA as a centre for the creation, diffusion and promotion of culture, contemporary two-dimensional, three-dimensional and digital art.\r\nThe MdA\u2019s educational and social approach aims to promoting equality of access to art and its introduction to new audiences.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Maison des Arts","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Haecht","address_street_number":"147","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lamaisondesarts.be","website":"http:\/\/www.lamaisondesarts.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 240 34 99","phone_booking":"+32 2 240 34 85","address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de Haecht, 147","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"Maison des Arts","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Haecht","address_street_number":"147","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lamaisondesarts.be","website":"http:\/\/www.lamaisondesarts.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 240 34 99","phone_booking":"+32 2 240 34 85","address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de Haecht, 147","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"fr":{"name":"Maison des Arts","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Haecht","address_street_number":"147","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lamaisondesarts.be","website":"http:\/\/www.lamaisondesarts.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 240 34 99","phone_booking":"+32 2 240 34 85","address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de Haecht, 147","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":"La Maison des Arts, anim\u00e9e par le Service Culture fran\u00e7aise de la Commune de Schaerbeek, est un espace singulier dont les activit\u00e9s sont principalement ax\u00e9es sur la cr\u00e9ation contemporaine dans le domaine des arts plastiques avec un important programme de m\u00e9diation permettant l\u2019acc\u00e8s de l\u2019art contemporain \u00e0 tous.\r\n\r\nLa MA conna\u00eet une riche activit\u00e9 artistique depuis les ann\u00e9es \u201950, \u00e9poque \u00e0 laquelle la commune rach\u00e8te le b\u00e2timent. En 2005, elle se voit prendre un premier tournant en proposant aux artistes de travailler in situ, afin d\u2019\u00e9tablir une r\u00e9elle coh\u00e9rence entre l\u2019\u0153uvre et la Maison.\r\nEt finalement, c\u2019est en 2016 que la Commune de Schaerbeek d\u00e9cide de la positionner dans le domaine des arts plastiques, contemporains et num\u00e9riques comme un lieu de cr\u00e9ation, de diffusion et de rayonnement culturel.\r\n\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Maison des Arts","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Haecht","address_street_number":"147","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lamaisondesarts.be","website":"http:\/\/www.lamaisondesarts.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 240 34 99","phone_booking":"+32 2 240 34 85","address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de Haecht, 147","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Huis der Kunsten","address_street_name":"Haachtsesteenweg","address_street_number":"147","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lamaisondesarts.be","website":"http:\/\/www.lamaisondesarts.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 240 34 99","phone_booking":"+32 2 240 34 85","address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Haachtsesteenweg, 147","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":"La Maison des Arts, geanimeerd door de dienst Franstalige Cultuur van de gemeente Schaarbeek, is een heel bijzondere plek. De activiteiten zijn vooral gericht op hedendaagse creativiteit in de plastische kunsten.\r\n\r\nIn La Maison des Arts heerst reeds sedert 1950 ( datum waarop de gemeente het huis aankocht) een ruime artistieke activiteit. In 2005 is er een belangrijke ontwikkeling : het voorstel aan de kunstenaars om ter plaatse te werken, teneinde een echte samenhang te bereiken tussen het werk en het Huis. Uiteindelijk beslist de Gemeente Schaarbeek er een echte broeikast van te maken in het domein van de beeldende kunsten, een bron van schepping, verspreiding en culturele uitstraling.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null}},"districts":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"zones":{"list":[20],"translations":{"de":["Norden"],"pt":[null],"en":["North"],"it":["Nord"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Nord"],"sp":["Norte"],"nl":["Noord"]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":663,"location":{"lat":50.85951067,"lon":4.37063079},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2022-11-09T13:59:40+01:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:13:42+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":222932,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Maison des Arts","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Haecht","address_street_number":"147","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lamaisondesarts.be","website":"http:\/\/www.lamaisondesarts.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 240 34 99","phone_booking":"+32 2 240 34 85","address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de Haecht, 147","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Maison des Arts","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Haecht","address_street_number":"147","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lamaisondesarts.be","website":"http:\/\/www.lamaisondesarts.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 240 34 99","phone_booking":"+32 2 240 34 85","address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de Haecht, 147","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Maison des Arts","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Haecht","address_street_number":"147","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lamaisondesarts.be","website":"http:\/\/www.lamaisondesarts.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 240 34 99","phone_booking":"+32 2 240 34 85","address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de Haecht, 147","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":"The MdA is run and staffed by the Francophone Cultural Service of Schaerbeek Council and is a unique place whose activities are mainly concerned with the creation of works of contemporary art with a significant partnership programme that promotes access for all to contemporary art.\r\n\r\nThe MdA has hosted a rich programme of artistic activities since the 1950s when the building was purchased by Schaerbeek Council. In 2005, the MdA began a programme of inviting artists to work in building, to build more coherence between their works of art and the MdA.\r\n\r\nMost recently, in 2016, Schaerbeek Council decided to position the MdA as a centre for the creation, diffusion and promotion of culture, contemporary two-dimensional, three-dimensional and digital art.\r\nThe MdA\u2019s educational and social approach aims to promoting equality of access to art and its introduction to new audiences.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Maison des Arts","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Haecht","address_street_number":"147","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lamaisondesarts.be","website":"http:\/\/www.lamaisondesarts.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 240 34 99","phone_booking":"+32 2 240 34 85","address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de Haecht, 147","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"Maison des Arts","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Haecht","address_street_number":"147","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lamaisondesarts.be","website":"http:\/\/www.lamaisondesarts.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 240 34 99","phone_booking":"+32 2 240 34 85","address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de Haecht, 147","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"fr":{"name":"Maison des Arts","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Haecht","address_street_number":"147","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lamaisondesarts.be","website":"http:\/\/www.lamaisondesarts.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 240 34 99","phone_booking":"+32 2 240 34 85","address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de Haecht, 147","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":"La Maison des Arts, anim\u00e9e par le Service Culture fran\u00e7aise de la Commune de Schaerbeek, est un espace singulier dont les activit\u00e9s sont principalement ax\u00e9es sur la cr\u00e9ation contemporaine dans le domaine des arts plastiques avec un important programme de m\u00e9diation permettant l\u2019acc\u00e8s de l\u2019art contemporain \u00e0 tous.\r\n\r\nLa MA conna\u00eet une riche activit\u00e9 artistique depuis les ann\u00e9es \u201950, \u00e9poque \u00e0 laquelle la commune rach\u00e8te le b\u00e2timent. En 2005, elle se voit prendre un premier tournant en proposant aux artistes de travailler in situ, afin d\u2019\u00e9tablir une r\u00e9elle coh\u00e9rence entre l\u2019\u0153uvre et la Maison.\r\nEt finalement, c\u2019est en 2016 que la Commune de Schaerbeek d\u00e9cide de la positionner dans le domaine des arts plastiques, contemporains et num\u00e9riques comme un lieu de cr\u00e9ation, de diffusion et de rayonnement culturel.\r\n\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Maison des Arts","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Haecht","address_street_number":"147","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lamaisondesarts.be","website":"http:\/\/www.lamaisondesarts.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 240 34 99","phone_booking":"+32 2 240 34 85","address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de Haecht, 147","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":null,"description_print":null