necting","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Taking the time to be totally absorbed by a work of art is becoming a rare occurrence in today's fast-paced society. Marjan Abadie developed her Mindful Art Experience method to invite the public to slow down. Using mindfulness, she encourages us to gain a more emotional and intuitive understanding of works of art. With a series of guided exercises, children and accompanying adults are invited to awaken their senses and connect with their emotions to discover immersive works in a unique sensory experience. Bring comfortable clothing!\n\n08.10 (FR) - https:\/\/tickets.kanal.brussels\/en\/buyingflow\/tickets\/18150\/41537\n22.10 (NL) - https:\/\/tickets.kanal.brussels\/en\/buyingflow\/tickets\/18150\/41539\n12.11 (FR) -  https:\/\/tickets.kanal.brussels\/en\/buyingflow\/tickets\/18150\/41586","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/kanal.brussels\/fr\/evenements\/visite-guidee\/slow-visit-mindfulness","email":"info@kanal.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50002915"},"it":{"name":"Slow visit - Mindfulness","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/kanal.brussels\/fr\/evenements\/visite-guidee\/slow-visit-mindfulness","email":"info@kanal.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50002915"},"cn":{"name":"Slow visit - Mindfulness","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/kanal.brussels\/fr\/evenements\/visite-guidee\/slow-visit-mindfulness","email":"info@kanal.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50002915"},"fr":{"name":"Slow visit - Mindfulness |\u00a0Connecting","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Prendre le temps de se laisser totalement absorber par une \u0153uvre devient rare dans des soci\u00e9t\u00e9s contemporaines o\u00f9 tout pousse \u00e0 une consommation rapide. Avec la m\u00e9thode Mindful Art Experience [Exp\u00e9rience artistique consciente] de Marjan Abadie, le public est invit\u00e9 \u00e0 ralentir. Via la pleine conscience, elle nous invite \u00e0 une compr\u00e9hension plus \u00e9motionnelle et intuitive des \u0153uvres d\u2019art. Pr\u00e9voyez une tenue confortable!\n\n08.10 (FR) - https:\/\/tickets.kanal.brussels\/en\/buyingflow\/tickets\/18150\/41537\n22.10 (NL) - https:\/\/tickets.kanal.brussels\/en\/buyingflow\/tickets\/18150\/41539\n12.11 (FR) -  https:\/\/tickets.kanal.brussels\/en\/buyingflow\/tickets\/18150\/41586\n ","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/kanal.brussels\/fr\/evenements\/visite-guidee\/slow-visit-mindfulness","email":"info@kanal.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50002915"},"sp":{"name":"Slow visit - Mindfulness","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/kanal.brussels\/fr\/evenements\/visite-guidee\/slow-visit-mindfulness","email":"info@kanal.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50002915"},"nl":{"name":"Slow visit - Mindfulness |\u00a0Connecting","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Helemaal opgaan in een kunstwerk is in de huidige consumptiemaatschappij niet altijd even eenvoudig. De Mindful Art Experience methode van Marjan Abadie moedigt het publiek aan om rustig de tijd te nemen. Met behulp van mindfulness geeft ze tips om kunstwerken emotioneler en intu\u00eftiever te begrijpen. Zorg voor comfortabele kleding!\n\n08.10 (FR) - https:\/\/tickets.kanal.brussels\/en\/buyingflow\/tickets\/18150\/41537\n22.10 (NL) - https:\/\/tickets.kanal.brussels\/en\/buyingflow\/tickets\/18150\/41539\n12.11 (FR) -  https:\/\/tickets.ka