sur cette affaire!","longdescr":"Avec Quiveutpister, d\u00e9couvrez des lieux connus et m\u00e9connus de Bruxelles en vous amusant. R\u00e9partis en plusieurs \u00e9quipes, retrouvez des indices, r\u00e9solvez une enqu\u00eate et parcourez un itin\u00e9raire. Des r\u00e9compenses viendront r\u00e9compenser les meilleures \u00e9quipes.\r\n\r\nSur le jeu Que cache Bruce Helle, vous devrez partir sur les traces d'un myst\u00e9rieux kidnappeur terrorisant la famille Leclerq. Le garde du corps Victor Lambert a \u00e9t\u00e9 appel\u00e9 pour la prot\u00e9ger. C\u2019est lors d\u2019une filature qu\u2019il va entendre parler d\u2019un projet secret impliquant cette famille\u2009: le projet Bruce Helle\u2026\r\n\r\nSaurez-vous d\u00e9couvrir ce qui se cache derri\u00e8re ce projet? Bonne chance!","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.quiveutpisterbruxelles.com","email":"guillaume@quiveutpisterbruxelles.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 318 36 07","phone_booking":"+32 2 318 36 07","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.553334"},"sp":{"name":"Chasse au tr\u00e9sor - Que cache Bruce Helle ?","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.quiveutpisterbruxelles.com","email":"guillaume@quiveutpisterbruxelles.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 318 36 07","phone_booking":"+32 2 318 36 07","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.553334"},"nl":{"name":"Chasse au tr\u00e9sor - Que cache Bruce Helle ?","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.quiveutpisterbruxelles.com","email":"guillaume@quiveutpisterbruxelles.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 318 36 07","phone_booking":"+32 2 318 36 07","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.553334"}},"place":{"id":258844,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Quiveutpister","address_street_name":null,"address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"guillaume@quiveutpisterbruxelles.com","website":"https:\/\/www.quiveutpisterbruxelles.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 318 36 07","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Quiveutpister","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Quiveutpister","address_street_name":null,"address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"guillaume@quiveutpisterbruxelles.com","website":"https:\/\/www.quiveutpisterbruxelles.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 318 36 07","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Quiveutpister","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Quiveutpister","address_street_name":null,"address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"guillaume@quiveutpisterbruxelles.com","website":"https:\/\/www.quiveutpisterbruxelles.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 318 36 07","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Quiveutpister","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Experience an unforgettable tourism and immersive adventure through scavenger hunts in Brussels offered by Quiveutpister! \r\nWhile solving an investigation, track characters and discover tourism locations along your journey. \r\nOur scavenger hunts are an entertaining way of discovering known or obscure parts of Brussels. \r\nOn the day of departure, the participants go to the location indicated. A briefcase consisting of a road book and various detectives\u2019 accessories is given to each team. \r\nThe start is then signalled, and the teams begin their investigation. \r\nEach team proceeds independently to try and find clues along an itinerary spanning an average distance ranging between 3 and 4 kilometres. \r\