and immersive adventure through scavenger hunts in Brussels offered by Quiveutpister! \r\nWhile solving an investigation, track characters and discover tourism locations along your journey. \r\nOur scavenger hunts are an entertaining way of discovering known or obscure parts of Brussels. \r\nOn the day of departure, the participants go to the location indicated. A briefcase consisting of a road book and various detectives\u2019 accessories is given to each team. \r\nThe start is then signalled, and the teams begin their investigation. \r\nEach team proceeds independently to try and find clues along an itinerary spanning an average distance ranging between 3 and 4 kilometres. \r\nA team\u2019s search for clues ends when it reaches the arrival location. \r\nThe team must then connect all clues gathered to establish its investigation report. \r\nA ranking is then established, and a prize is awarded to the top-ranked team. \r\nOn average, the event takes 2 hours 30 minutes.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Quiveutpister","address_street_name":null,"address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"guillaume@quiveutpisterbruxelles.com","website":"https:\/\/www.quiveutpisterbruxelles.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 318 36 07","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Quiveutpister","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"Quiveutpister","address_street_name":null,"address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"guillaume@quiveutpisterbruxelles.com","website":"https:\/\/www.quiveutpisterbruxelles.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 318 36 07","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Quiveutpister","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":nul