 beers with a positive societal impact. The goal is to share a place and more precisely to share brewing equipment, skills, a brewpub and a sandwich shop. C\u00e9dric d'Agalmalt, a guide and enthusiast, offers fun and entertaining workshops that allow participants to acquire a better knowledge of the brewing world. Visits and tastings upon reservation.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/cohop.be\/","email":"gestion@cohop.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.557936"},"it":{"name":"Tour &amp; Tasting : introduction \u00e0 la zythologie","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/cohop.be\/","email":"gestion@cohop.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.557936"},"cn":{"name":"Tour &amp; Tasting : introduction \u00e0 la zythologie","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/cohop.be\/","email":"gestion@cohop.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.557936"},"fr":{"name":"Tour and Tasting : introduction \u00e0 la zythologie","shortdescr":"D\u00e9couvrez une brasserie partag\u00e9e et \u00e9co-responsable","longdescr":"Premi\u00e8re coop\u00e9rative de microbrasseries \u00e0 Bruxelles, CoHop est une brasserie partag\u00e9e et \u00e9co-responsable proposant des bi\u00e8res artisanales avec un impact soci\u00e9tal positif. Le but est de mutualiser un lieu et plus pr\u00e9cis\u00e9ment de mutualiser du mat\u00e9riel de brassage, des comp\u00e9tences, un brewpub et une sandwicherie. C\u00e9dric d'Agalmalt, guide et passionn\u00e9 propose des ateliers ludiques et amusants qui permettent aux participants.es d'acqu\u00e9rir une meilleure connaissance du monde brassicole.&nbsp; Visites, d\u00e9gustations sur r\u