,"targets":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"educational_targets":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"tags":["exterior"]},{"id":545873,"date_start":"2023-10-17","date_end":"2024-01-14","date_next":"2024-01-14","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_pay_as_you_can":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"last_updated_at":"2023-10-10T14:15:15+02:00","published_at":"2022-11-18T11:47:32+01:00","publication_state":"public","date_embargo":null,"show_in_agenda":true,"is_outside":false,"is_high_capacity":false,"is_not_major_event":false,"backoffice_id":265873,"facebook_link":null,"import_origin":null,"is_part_of":"Ann\u00e9e Art Nouveau","sub_type":"expo","ranking":0.44628863338811303,"languages":{"spoken":["en","fr","nl"],"subtitles":[]},"categories":{"main":{"id":23,"translations":{"de":"Ausstellung","pt":null,"en":"Exhibition","it":"Esposizioni","cn":null,"fr":"Exposition","sp":"Exhibici\u00f3n","nl":"Tentoonstellingen"}},"others":{"list":[48,36],"translations":{"de":["Architektur","Museen & Kunstzentren"],"pt":[null,null],"en":["Architecture ","Museums and art centers"],"it":["Architettura","Musei e centri artistici"],"cn":[null,null],"fr":["Architecture","Mus\u00e9es et art centers"],"sp":["Arquitectura","Museos y centros de arte"],"nl":["Architectuur","Musea en kunstcentra"]}}},"translations":{"de":{"name":"Victor Horta et la grammaire de l\u2019Art Nouveau","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.bozar.be","email":"info@bozar.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 507 82 00","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.545873"},"pt":{"name":"Victor Horta et la grammaire de l\u2019Art Nouveau","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.bozar.be","email":"info@bozar.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 507 82 00","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.545873"},"en":{"name":"Victor Horta and the Grammar of Art Nouveau","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"What remains of Horta's Art Nouveau if we abstract the style and if we discard his typical vegetal vocabulary? The exhibition\u00a0Victor Horta and the\u00a0Grammar of Art Nouveau\u00a0probes the fundamental themes and lines of force in the oeuvre of the most famous Belgian architect of all time. The intimate link between Horta's\u00a0Art\u00a0Nouveau and Leopold II's Congo Free State is also scrutinised.\n\nCurators: Iwan Strauven, Benjamin Zurstrassen","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.bozar.be","email":"info@bozar.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 507 82 00","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.545873"},"it":{"name":"Victor Horta et la grammaire de l\u2019Art Nouveau","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.bozar.be","email":"info@bozar.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 507 82 00","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.545873"},"cn":{"name":"Victor Horta et la grammaire de l\u2019Art Nouveau","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.bozar.be","email":"info@bozar.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 507 82 00","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.545873"},"fr":{"name":"Victor Horta et la grammaire de l\u2019Art Nouveau","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Que reste-t-il de l\u2019art nouveau de Horta si nous faisons abstraction du style et de son vocabulaire v\u00e9g\u00e9tal caract\u00e9ristique ? L\u2019exposition\u00a0Victor Horta et la Grammaire de l\u2019Art nouveau\u00a0s\u2019int\u00e9resse aux th\u00e8mes fondamentaux et aux lignes de force de l\u2019\u0153uvre de l\u2019architecte belge le plus c\u00e9l\u00e8bre de tous les temps. Le lien intime entre l\u2019art nouveau de Horta et l'\u00c9tat ind\u00e9pendant du Congo de L\u00e9opold II est \u00e9galement examin\u00e9 de plus pr\u00e8s.\u00a0\n\n\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200bCommissaires\u00a0: Iwan Strauven, Benjamin Zurstrassen","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.bozar.be","email":"info@bozar.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 507 82 00","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.545873"},"sp":{"name":"Victor Horta et la grammaire de l\u2019Art Nouveau","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.bozar.be","email":"info@bozar.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 507 82 00","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.545873"},"nl":{"name":"Victor Horta en de grammatica van Art Nouveau","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Wat blijft er over van Horta\u2019s art nouveau als we abstractie maken van de stijl en als we zijn typische vegetale vocabularium wegdenken? De tentoonstelling\u00a0Victor Horta en de grammatica van de Art Nouveau\u00a0peilt naar de fundamentele thema\u2019s en krachtlijnen in het oeuvre van de bekendste Belgische architect aller tijden. Ook de intieme link tussen Horta\u2019s art nouveau met Kongo-Vrijstaat van Leopold II onder de loep genomen.\n\n\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200bCuratoren: Iwan Strauven, Benjamin Zurstrassen","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.bozar.be","email":"info@bozar.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 507 82 00","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.545873"}},"place":{"id":63,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Palais des Beaux-Arts - Bozar","address_street_name":"Rue Ravenstein","address_street_number":"23","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@bozar.be","website":"http:\/\/www.bozar.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 507 82 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 507 82 00","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Ravenstein, 23","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Das Br\u00fcsseler BOZAR z\u00e4hlt zu den dynamischsten und hochkar\u00e4tigsten Kultur- und Kunstzentren der belgischen Kulturlandschaft. Das Art D\u00e9co-Meisterwerk aus der Feder Victor Hortas ist zudem einer der gro\u00dfen architektonischen Sch\u00e4tze Br\u00fcssels.\r\nKultur, Kultur und noch mehr Kultur! Auf mehr als 4 000 Quadratmetern gibt es Konzerte, Ausstellungen, Theater, Tanz, Literatur, Konferenzen und Filmvorf\u00fchrungen unter einem Dach zu sehen.\r\n\r\nF\u00fcr Musikinteressierte reicht das Angebot von Weltmusik \u00fcber Electronic DJs bis hin zum klassischen Symphonieorchester. Kunst- und Literaturliebhaber kommen mit zeitgen\u00f6ssischen, avantgardistischen und klassischen Kunst- und Gem\u00e4ldeausstellungen, der Fotobiennale Summer of Photography, mehrsprachigen Theaterinszenierungen, Brussels Short Film Festival, Book Clubs in franz\u00f6sischer und fl\u00e4mischer Version oder auch Architekturkonferenzen auf ihre Kosten.\r\n\r\nBOZAR-Brasserie:\r\nKulturinteressierte Genie\u00dfer k\u00f6nnen sich in der BOZAR-Brasserie von dem franz\u00f6sischen Chefkoch David Martin mit Men\u00fcs verw\u00f6hnen lassen, die dem kulturellen Angebot in nichts nachstehen. Die Brasserie ist Teil eines umfassenden Restaurierungs- und Renovierungsprogramms, sie wurde nach dem Vorbild der Original-Horta-Brasserie gestaltet. Von dem Gourmetf\u00fchrer Gault&Millau 2013 wurde sie \u00fcbrigens zur \u201eBrasserie des Jahres\" gew\u00e4hlt! \r\n\r\nBozar Caf\u00e9 Victor\r\nFr\u00fchst\u00fcck, Mittag- oder Abendessen vor oder nach dem Ausstellungs- oder Konzertbesuch k\u00f6nnen im Caf\u00e9 Victor eingenommen werden. Gro\u00dfe Fensterfronten, puristisches Design, edle Lederb\u00e4nke, spektakul\u00e4re Leuchten und feine Snacks und Speisen ergeben ein harmonisches Ensemble.\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":"Bozar","virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Centro de Belas Artes \u2014 Bozar","address_street_name":"Rue Ravenstein","address_street_number":"23","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@bozar.be","website":"http:\/\/www.bozar.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 507 82 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 507 82 00","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Ravenstein, 23","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Ao falar da cultura belga, \u00e9 obrigat\u00f3rio mencionar o Pal\u00e1cio de Belas Artes de Bruxelas. Quer sejam exposi\u00e7\u00f5es, concertos, teatro, cinema ou projetos liter\u00e1rios e arquitet\u00f3nicos, BOZAR coloca sempre em primeira linha a originalidade e inova\u00e7\u00e3o. N\u00e3o s\u00f3 enfatiza a cria\u00e7\u00e3o, qualidade e riqueza do programa art\u00edstico, mas preocupa-se sobretudo em oferecer uma experi\u00eancia completa aos seus visitantes.\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Centre for Fine Arts - Bozar","address_street_name":"Rue Ravenstein","address_street_number":"23","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@bozar.be","website":"http:\/\/www.bozar.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 507 82 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 507 82 00","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Ravenstein, 23","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"It\u2019s impossible to talk about culture in Belgium without mentioning the Centre for Fine Arts located in Brussels. Whether it comes to exhibitions, concerts, theater performances, movies or projects concerning literature and architecture, BOZAR will always put originality and innovation first. They prove to keep a finger on the pulse with their varied and sophisticated programme. Besides emphasizing the importance of creation, quality and a rich artistic offering, BOZAR is especially concerned about the total experience of the visitors.","description_print":"It\u2019s impossible to talk about culture in Belgium without mentioning the Centre for Fine Arts located in Brussels. Whether it comes to exhibitions, concerts, theater performances, movies or projects concerning literature and architecture, BOZAR will always put originality and innovation first. They prove to keep a finger on the pulse with their varied and sophisticated programme. Besides emphasizing the importance of creation, quality and a rich artistic offering, BOZAR is especially concerned about the total experience of the visitors.","booking_url":null,"sort_order":"Bozar","virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Palazzo delle Belle Arti - Bozar","address_street_name":"Rue Ravenstein","address_street_number":"23","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@bozar.be","website":"http:\/\/www.bozar.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 507 82 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 507 82 00","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Ravenstein, 23","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"BOZAR il Palazzo delle Belle Arti, centro d'arte per eccellenza del panorama culturale belga, offre un programma internazionale nel cuore di Bruxelles.\r\n\r\nL'edificio \u00e8 un gioiello del patrimonio architettonico del Belgio. E' stato realizzato da Victor Horta in stile Art Nouveau nel 1920.\r\n\r\nIl Bozar \u00e8 un centro d'arte attivo e dinamico che accoglie ogni anno pi\u00f9 di un milione di visitatori: 4.000 m\u00b2 di spazi espositivi, una grandiosa sala concerti, una sala per musica da camera, due piccoli teatri, tre nuove sale multimediali, il BOZAR SHOP, la BOZAR BRASSERIE e la Cinemateca Reale, famosa in tutto il mondo per la sua collezione di grande valore.\r\n\r\n\r\nLa BOZAR BRASSERIE vi aspetta con il suo chef stellato David Martin. Prenotazioni, solo per telefono, al n\u00b0 +32 (0)2 503 00 00. Aperto 7 giorni su 7, dalle 12 alle 23.\r\n\r\nVisitate anche il BOZARSHOP: migliaia di libri d'arte, CD, DVD, idee regalo.\r\nSpazio giochi per i vostri bambini.\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"Palais des Beaux-Arts - Bozar","address_street_name":"Rue Ravenstein","address_street_number":"23","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@bozar.be","website":"http:\/\/www.bozar.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 507 82 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 507 82 00","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Ravenstein, 23","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"fr":{"name":"Palais des Beaux-Arts - Bozar","address_street_name":"Rue Ravenstein","address_street_number":"23","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@bozar.be","website":"http:\/\/www.bozar.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 507 82 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 507 82 00","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Ravenstein, 23","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Lorsqu\u2019on parle de la culture en Belgique, on pense forc\u00e9ment au Palais des Beaux-Arts de Bruxelles. Qu\u2019il s\u2019agisse d\u2019expositions, de concerts, de th\u00e9\u00e2tre ou de cin\u00e9ma, de projets autour de la litt\u00e9rature et d\u2019architecture, BOZAR met toujours en avant l\u2019originalit\u00e9 et l\u2019innovation. Non seulement ils mettent un point d\u2019honneur \u00e0 la cr\u00e9ation, la qualit\u00e9 et la richesse du programme artistique, mais se pr\u00e9occupent surtout d\u2019offrir une exp\u00e9rience totale \u00e0 ses visiteurs.","description_print":"Lorsqu\u2019on parle de la culture en Belgique, on pense forc\u00e9ment au Palais des Beaux-Arts de Bruxelles. Qu\u2019il s\u2019agisse d\u2019expositions, de concerts, de th\u00e9\u00e2tre ou de cin\u00e9ma, de projets autour de la litt\u00e9rature et d\u2019architecture, BOZAR met toujours en avant l\u2019originalit\u00e9 et l\u2019innovation. Non seulement ils mettent un point d\u2019honneur \u00e0 la cr\u00e9ation, la qualit\u00e9 et la richesse du programme artistique, mais se pr\u00e9occupent surtout d\u2019offrir une exp\u00e9rience totale \u00e0 ses visiteurs.","booking_url":null,"sort_order":"Bozar","virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Palacio de las Bellas Artes - Bozar","address_street_name":"Rue Ravenstein","address_street_number":"23","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@bozar.be","website":"http:\/\/www.bozar.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 507 82 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 507 82 00","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Ravenstein, 23","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"El Bozar, el Palacio de las Bellas Artes, es el centro de arte por excelencia del paisaje cultural belga. \r\n\r\nEl Palacio de las Bellas Artes de Bruselas ofrece un programa cultural y art\u00edstico. Es uno de los n\u00facleos art\u00edsticos m\u00e1s din\u00e1micos de B\u00e9lgica, con 1 mill\u00f3n de visitas al a\u00f1o. \r\n\r\nEn el programa: exposiciones, m\u00fasica, danza, teatro, cine, literatura o arquitectura para peque\u00f1os y no tan peque\u00f1os. \r\n\r\nEl edificio constituye una de las obras maestras del patrimonio arquitect\u00f3nico de B\u00e9lgica. \r\n\r\nEste Palacio Art D\u00e9co lo ide\u00f3 el arquitecto Victor Horta en 1920 e incluye:\r\n\r\n- M\u00e1s de 4.000 m\u00b2 espacios de exposici\u00f3n\r\n- La Sala Henry le B\u0153uf, es decir, una magn\u00edfica sala de conciertos\r\n- 1 sala de m\u00fasica de c\u00e1mara\r\n- 2 peque\u00f1os teatros y 3 nuevas salas multimedia\r\n- La Bozar Brasserie y la cocina innovadora del chef galardonado David Martin\r\n- La Cinemateca Real y su indiscutible colecci\u00f3n internacionalmente conocida\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Paleis voor Schone Kunsten - Bozar","address_street_name":"Ravensteinstraat","address_street_number":"23","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@bozar.be","website":"http:\/\/www.bozar.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 507 82 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 507 82 00","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Ravensteinstraat, 23","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Als je in Belgi\u00eb over cultuur spreekt, dan kun je niet om het Paleis voor Schone Kunsten in Brussel heen. Of het nu gaat om tentoonstellingen, concerten, theater- en filmvoorstellingen, projecten rond literatuur en architectuur, steeds stelt Bozar originaliteit en vernieuwing voorop. Ze bewijzen dat ze de vinger aan de pols hebben met hun gevarieerd en uitgekiend programma. Niet alleen creatie, kwaliteit en een rijk artistiek aanbod draagt de zorg weg. Bij Bozar zijn ze bekommerd om de totaalervaring. Het imposante en tegelijk intieme gebouw - van de hand van Horta- heeft een bevreemdende schoonheid.","description_print":"Als je in Belgi\u00eb over cultuur spreekt, dan kun je niet om het Paleis voor Schone Kunsten in Brussel heen. Of het nu gaat om tentoonstellingen, concerten, theater- en filmvoorstellingen, projecten rond literatuur en architectuur, steeds stelt Bozar originaliteit en vernieuwing voorop. Ze bewijzen dat ze de vinger aan de pols hebben met hun gevarieerd en uitgekiend programma. Niet alleen creatie, kwaliteit en een rijk artistiek aanbod draagt de zorg weg. Bij Bozar zijn ze bekommerd om de totaalervaring. Het imposante en tegelijk intieme gebouw - van de hand van Horta- heeft een bevreemdende schoonheid.","booking_url":null,"sort_order":"Bozar","virtual_visit":null}},"districts":{"list":[16],"translations":{"de":["K\u00f6nigliches Viertel"],"pt":[null],"en":["Royal"],"it":["Quartiere reale"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Quartier Royal"],"sp":["Quartier Royal \u2014Barrio de la Corte\u2014"],"nl":["Koninklijke wijk"]}},"zones":{"list":[19],"translations":{"de":["Zentrum"],"pt":[null],"en":["Centre"],"it":["Centro"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Centre"],"sp":["Centro"],"nl":["Centrum"]}},"neca":"art_center","facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":13,"location":{"lat":50.8442214,"lon":4.35950594},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2023-08-14T16:21:56+02:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:13:13+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":63,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Palais des Beaux-Arts - Bozar","address_street_name":"Rue Ravenstein","address_street_number":"23","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@bozar.be","website":"http:\/\/www.bozar.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 507 82 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 507 82 00","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Ravenstein, 23","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Das Br\u00fcsseler BOZAR z\u00e4hlt zu den dynamischsten und hochkar\u00e4tigsten Kultur- und Kunstzentren der belgischen Kulturlandschaft. Das Art D\u00e9co-Meisterwerk aus der Feder Victor Hortas ist zudem einer der gro\u00dfen architektonischen Sch\u00e4tze Br\u00fcssels.\r\nKultur, Kultur und noch mehr Kultur! Auf mehr als 4 000 Quadratmetern gibt es Konzerte, Ausstellungen, Theater, Tanz, Literatur, Konferenzen und Filmvorf\u00fchrungen unter einem Dach zu sehen.\r\n\r\nF\u00fcr Musikinteressierte reicht das Angebot von Weltmusik \u00fcber Electronic DJs bis hin zum klassischen Symphonieorchester. Kunst- und Literaturliebhaber kommen mit zeitgen\u00f6ssischen, avantgardistischen und klassischen Kunst- und Gem\u00e4ldeausstellungen, der Fotobiennale Summer of Photography, mehrsprachigen Theaterinszenierungen, Brussels Short Film Festival, Book Clubs in franz\u00f6sischer und fl\u00e4mischer Version oder auch Architekturkonferenzen auf ihre Kosten.\r\n\r\nBOZAR-Brasserie:\r\nKulturinteressierte Genie\u00dfer k\u00f6nnen sich in der BOZAR-Brasserie von dem franz\u00f6sischen Chefkoch David Martin mit Men\u00fcs verw\u00f6hnen lassen, die dem kulturellen Angebot in nichts nachstehen. Die Brasserie ist Teil eines umfassenden Restaurierungs- und Renovierungsprogramms, sie wurde nach dem Vorbild der Original-Horta-Brasserie gestaltet. Von dem Gourmetf\u00fchrer Gault&Millau 2013 wurde sie \u00fcbrigens zur \u201eBrasserie des Jahres\" gew\u00e4hlt! \r\n\r\nBozar Caf\u00e9 Victor\r\nFr\u00fchst\u00fcck, Mittag- oder Abendessen vor oder nach dem Ausstellungs- oder Konzertbesuch k\u00f6nnen im Caf\u00e9 Victor eingenommen werden. Gro\u00dfe Fensterfronten, puristisches Design, edle Lederb\u00e4nke, spektakul\u00e4re Leuchten und feine Snacks und Speisen ergeben ein harmonisches Ensemble.\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":"Bozar","virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Centro de Belas Artes \u2014 Bozar","address_street_name":"Rue Ravenstein","address_street_number":"23","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@bozar.be","website":"http:\/\/www.bozar.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 507 82 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 507 82 00","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Ravenstein, 23","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Ao falar da cultura belga, \u00e9 obrigat\u00f3rio mencionar o Pal\u00e1cio de Belas Artes de Bruxelas. Quer sejam exposi\u00e7\u00f5es, concertos, teatro, cinema ou projetos liter\u00e1rios e arquitet\u00f3nicos, BOZAR coloca sempre em primeira linha a originalidade e inova\u00e7\u00e3o. N\u00e3o s\u00f3 enfatiza a cria\u00e7\u00e3o, qualidade e riqueza do programa art\u00edstico, mas preocupa-se sobretudo em oferecer uma experi\u00eancia completa aos seus visitantes.\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Centre for Fine Arts - Bozar","address_street_name":"Rue Ravenstein","address_street_number":"23","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@bozar.be","website":"http:\/\/www.bozar.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 507 82 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 507 82 00","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Ravenstein, 23","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"It\u2019s impossible to talk about culture in Belgium without mentioning the Centre for Fine Arts located in Brussels. Whether it comes to exhibitions, concerts, theater performances, movies or projects concerning literature and architecture, BOZAR will always put originality and innovation first. They prove to keep a finger on the pulse with their varied and sophisticated programme. Besides emphasizing the importance of creation, quality and a rich artistic offering, BOZAR is especially concerned about the total experience of the visitors.","description_print":"It\u2019s impossible to talk about culture in Belgium without mentioning the Centre for Fine Arts located in Brussels. Whether it comes to exhibitions, concerts, theater performances, movies or projects concerning literature and architecture, BOZAR will always put originality and innovation first. They prove to keep a finger on the pulse with their varied and sophisticated programme. Besides emphasizing the importance of creation, quality and a rich artistic offering, BOZAR is especially concerned about the total experience of the visitors.","booking_url":null,"sort_order":"Bozar","virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Palazzo delle Belle Arti - Bozar","address_street_name":"Rue Ravenstein","address_street_number":"23","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@bozar.be","website":"http:\/\/www.bozar.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 507 82 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 507 82 00","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Ravenstein, 23","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"BOZAR il Palazzo delle Belle Arti, centro d'arte per eccellenza del panorama culturale belga, offre un programma internazionale nel cuore di Bruxelles.\r\n\r\nL'edificio \u00e8 un gioiello del patrimonio architettonico del Belgio. E' stato realizzato da Victor Horta in stile Art Nouveau nel 1920.\r\n\r\nIl Bozar \u00e8 un centro d'arte attivo e dinamico che accoglie ogni anno pi\u00f9 di un milione di visitatori: 4.000 m\u00b2 di spazi espositivi, una grandiosa sala concerti, una sala per musica da camera, due piccoli teatri, tre nuove sale multimediali, il BOZAR SHOP, la BOZAR BRASSERIE e la Cinemateca Reale, famosa in tutto il mondo per la sua collezione di grande valore.\r\n\r\n\r\nLa BOZAR BRASSERIE vi aspetta con il suo chef stellato David Martin. Prenotazioni, solo per telefono, al n\u00b0 +32 (0)2 503 00 00. Aperto 7 giorni su 7, dalle 12 alle 23.\r\n\r\nVisitate anche il BOZARSHOP: migliaia di libri d'arte, CD, DVD, idee regalo.\r\nSpazio giochi per i vostri bambini.\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"Palais des Beaux-Arts - Bozar","address_street_name":"Rue Ravenstein","address_street_number":"23","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@bozar.be","website":"http:\/\/www.bozar.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 507 82 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 507 82 00","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Ravenstein, 23","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"fr":{"name":"Palais des Beaux-Arts - Bozar","address_street_name":"Rue Ravenstein","address_street_number":"23","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@bozar.be","website":"http:\/\/www.bozar.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 507 82 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 507 82 00","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Ravenstein, 23","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Lorsqu\u2019on parle de la culture en Belgique, on pense forc\u00e9ment au Palais des Beaux-Arts de Bruxelles. Qu\u2019il s\u2019agisse d\u2019expositions, de concerts, de th\u00e9\u00e2tre ou de cin\u00e9ma, de projets autour de la litt\u00e9rature et d\u2019architecture, BOZAR met toujours en avant l\u2019originalit\u00e9 et l\u2019innovation. 